(328605, 25211, 1829, '<td valign="top">A very emotional photograph.  B&amp;W works very well here.  Composition is brilliant as wel as the lightingl.  Truely a wonderful portrait photo.  GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'A very emotional photograph.  B&W works very well here.  Composition is brilliant as wel as the lightingl.  Truely a wonderful portrait photo.  GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-06-18 02:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
