(328610, 25177, 1829, '<td valign="top">A beautiful self portrait shot.  I can see that the B&amp;W works really well here.  I also like the way your hand is crossing over like that.  Lovely job and GL in this weeks challenge.</td>', 'A beautiful self portrait shot.  I can see that the B&W works really well here.  I also like the way your hand is crossing over like that.  Lovely job and GL in this weeks challenge.', '2003-06-18 02:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
