(329035, 25075, 4224, '<td valign="top">I think the shadow on your face is a tad too dark, however I really like the composition of the photo.</td>', 'I think the shadow on your face is a tad too dark, however I really like the composition of the photo.', '2003-06-18 10:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(329038, 25042, 5333, '<td valign="top">Overexposed on the right. Other than that it''s very nice.</td>', 'Overexposed on the right. Other than that it''s very nice.', '2003-06-18 10:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(329041, 24709, 4224, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of the lighting.  I can''t help but wonder if I would like it better if you weren''t looking directly at the camera.  That might totally change the mood of the shot, but it already feels like a fairly dark picture to me.  Maybe that''s what I''m trying to say: it feels to me like there is a slight contradiction between the tone of the picture, and your facial expression.  Still, very good photo.</td>', 'Very nice use of the lighting.  I can''t help but wonder if I would like it better if you weren''t looking directly at the camera.  That might totally change the mood of the shot, but it already feels like a fairly dark picture to me.  Maybe that''s what I''m trying to say: it feels to me like there is a slight contradiction between the tone of the picture, and your facial expression.  Still, very good photo.', '2003-06-18 10:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(329043, 25188, 5333, '<td valign="top">He hee, nice pose! I really like the lighting here.</td>', 'He hee, nice pose! I really like the lighting here.', '2003-06-18 10:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(329045, 25212, 6896, '<td valign="top">Out of focus</td>', 'Out of focus', '2003-06-18 10:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(329046, 25274, 7369, '<td valign="top">What''s imperfect? Maybe the light and the focus could be improved a little, perhaps you could have zoomed out a little but all in all I think you have made a nice self-portrait.</td>', 'What''s imperfect? Maybe the light and the focus could be improved a little, perhaps you could have zoomed out a little but all in all I think you have made a nice self-portrait.', '2003-06-18 10:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(329050, 24994, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m not going to give this a 1 or 2 because it is almost abstract enough to be interesting.  I think some interesting things can be done with this technique...<br/>Too much white negative space in this image.  Maybe a different crop so the main subject is notso centered vertically.  Try this with yourself in the lower left of the frame.  I like when people go out on a limb to be creative and try something fun.  Unfortunately, people don''t reward that here...  Good Luck.</td>', 'I''m not going to give this a 1 or 2 because it is almost abstract enough to be interesting.  I think some interesting things can be done with this technique...Too much white negative space in this image.  Maybe a different crop so the main subject is notso centered vertically.  Try this with yourself in the lower left of the frame.  I like when people go out on a limb to be creative and try something fun.  Unfortunately, people don''t reward that here...  Good Luck.', '2003-06-18 10:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(329051, 25218, 4224, '<td valign="top">I think this is a tad too dark, especially taking into considering that a good portion of your face is blocked by something that is entirely black (the tripod and camera).  It''s also not to your benefit that other people did shots with candles, and rather them just being "low light" shots, the candle light is more focused, allowing you to still see a good amount of detail in the subject.<br/> <br/>on a side note, from what i can see of your face, you remind me of Chino Moreno.</td>', 'I think this is a tad too dark, especially taking into considering that a good portion of your face is blocked by something that is entirely black (the tripod and camera).  It''s also not to your benefit that other people did shots with candles, and rather them just being "low light" shots, the candle light is more focused, allowing you to still see a good amount of detail in the subject. on a side note, from what i can see of your face, you remind me of Chino Moreno.', '2003-06-18 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(329052, 24886, 5333, '<td valign="top">oooo... what a long neck you got...j/k</td>', 'oooo... what a long neck you got...j/k', '2003-06-18 10:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
