(329057, 24800, 4224, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Great lighting, and I love the additional touch of the bracelet.  It''s a very tough pose, as though this is who you are and you are ready to take what the world has for you (and you know it''s not going to be easy).  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Great lighting, and I love the additional touch of the bracelet.  It''s a very tough pose, as though this is who you are and you are ready to take what the world has for you (and you know it''s not going to be easy).  I like it a lot.', '2003-06-18 10:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
