(329059, 25101, 92, '<td valign="top">SugarBritches !!!!! So far this is the best shot I''ve seen. Unique and well done ! I love it !  10</td>', 'SugarBritches !!!!! So far this is the best shot I''ve seen. Unique and well done ! I love it !  10', '2003-06-18 10:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
