(329066, 25217, 8987, '<td valign="top">Another great picture and idea! And again I have to give good marks against the fact that I ddin''t want to give good marks to people hiding ;o)</td>', 'Another great picture and idea! And again I have to give good marks against the fact that I ddin''t want to give good marks to people hiding ;o)', '2003-06-18 11:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(329068, 25094, 8987, '<td valign="top">Awesome use of light and darkness. Seems like a statue. Good work!</td>', 'Awesome use of light and darkness. Seems like a statue. Good work!', '2003-06-18 11:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(329071, 24894, 6775, '<td valign="top">This is really cool!</td>', 'This is really cool!', '2003-06-18 11:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(329074, 25304, 8987, '<td valign="top">Good composition! And a nice face :)</td>', 'Good composition! And a nice face :)', '2003-06-18 11:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(329075, 25192, 4224, '<td valign="top">I find this is a very captivating picture.  With the angles of the camera and the mirror, I almost feel as though your reflection is looking at you with a different expression, as though it is curious and filled with longing moreso than you are.  Not having hair visible in the reflection contributes to that effect.  Very nice picture, good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-25 00:09:41.</i></td>', 'I find this is a very captivating picture.  With the angles of the camera and the mirror, I almost feel as though your reflection is looking at you with a different expression, as though it is curious and filled with longing moreso than you are.  Not having hair visible in the reflection contributes to that effect.  Very nice picture, good work.', '2003-06-18 11:04:39.000000', '2003-06-25 01:09:41.000000', 1),
