(329485, 25180, 7504, '<td valign="top">Nice colors on this, and you are a very handsome fella!</td>', 'Nice colors on this, and you are a very handsome fella!', '2003-06-18 13:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(329486, 24767, 6008, '<td valign="top">The colors are appealing. I can certainly see the effect you are trying to achieve - the body''s form appearing like a mountain range, the sheet as a desert or sea, but I think perhaps a soft focus may have helped more than the grain. In some ways I like the grain, it gives an aged feel to it, but in others I feel it''s too harsh for an otherwise sensual shape. The left area is a little too harshly lit and the definition of the curve is a little lost because of it. Overall I think it''s quite an intriguing image.</td>', 'The colors are appealing. I can certainly see the effect you are trying to achieve - the body''s form appearing like a mountain range, the sheet as a desert or sea, but I think perhaps a soft focus may have helped more than the grain. In some ways I like the grain, it gives an aged feel to it, but in others I feel it''s too harsh for an otherwise sensual shape. The left area is a little too harshly lit and the definition of the curve is a little lost because of it. Overall I think it''s quite an intriguing image.', '2003-06-18 13:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(329487, 24633, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love the delicate light and the good use of negative space on the right.  Very artistic.  I also like the way you''re peeking at the camera.</td>', 'I love the delicate light and the good use of negative space on the right.  Very artistic.  I also like the way you''re peeking at the camera.', '2003-06-18 13:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(329488, 24716, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool....love this idea, composition and lighting. Nice work.</td>', 'Very cool....love this idea, composition and lighting. Nice work.', '2003-06-18 13:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(329489, 25050, 2978, '<td valign="top">I guess you are trying to interpret the challenge in a different way, the ghost effect, which is quite remarkable. But the background is dominant and inbalance. Try symmetry and without the the crowd in the back.</td>', 'I guess you are trying to interpret the challenge in a different way, the ghost effect, which is quite remarkable. But the background is dominant and inbalance. Try symmetry and without the the crowd in the back.', '2003-06-18 13:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(329490, 24625, 8268, '<td valign="top">wow.. =)  lovely eyes.. =)   a suggestion.. your hair is very distracting.. you need the light in your face, not in your hair..  change the background, or made a blurry efect in background.. your expression is so cute.. congratulations..  you should try this shot again.. =)</td>', 'wow.. =)  lovely eyes.. =)   a suggestion.. your hair is very distracting.. you need the light in your face, not in your hair..  change the background, or made a blurry efect in background.. your expression is so cute.. congratulations..  you should try this shot again.. =)', '2003-06-18 13:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
