(329495, 25043, 7339, '<td valign="top">Wow is your eye blue.  Cute shot. Your arm is a bit blown out and while the pose is unique, it apears your have a pretty face and I would prefer seeing that then a hand. If you were trying to show the ring thats cool but why hide a pretty face.</td>', 'Wow is your eye blue.  Cute shot. Your arm is a bit blown out and while the pose is unique, it apears your have a pretty face and I would prefer seeing that then a hand. If you were trying to show the ring thats cool but why hide a pretty face.', '2003-06-18 13:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
