(329536, 25113, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely photos.....wow. Very cool.</td>', 'Lovely photos.....wow. Very cool.', '2003-06-18 13:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(329537, 25262, 2978, '<td valign="top">This feels warm. The expressions and posing of you and the boys are great.  I would like to suggest the stylist details such as the couch shoud be tidy, props are not so neccessary eg. the doll and the cloths. Maybe you can try B/W to get rid of the un-unity colours. I hope I make sense here :-)</td>', 'This feels warm. The expressions and posing of you and the boys are great.  I would like to suggest the stylist details such as the couch shoud be tidy, props are not so neccessary eg. the doll and the cloths. Maybe you can try B/W to get rid of the un-unity colours. I hope I make sense here :-)', '2003-06-18 13:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
