(329641, 24894, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is certainly funny and original! The lining up with the glasses is spot on, it really does a great job in looking ''real'' - the only really petty thing is that the background vines dont show in the ''photograph'' section, which may have been intentional, I''m not sure, but I think that would have just made it more of a ''wow'' it''s still a neat shot as is. I also like the toning. I think the ''goofy'' look also helps with the jovial mood of the entire image.</td>', 'This is certainly funny and original! The lining up with the glasses is spot on, it really does a great job in looking ''real'' - the only really petty thing is that the background vines dont show in the ''photograph'' section, which may have been intentional, I''m not sure, but I think that would have just made it more of a ''wow'' it''s still a neat shot as is. I also like the toning. I think the ''goofy'' look also helps with the jovial mood of the entire image.', '2003-06-18 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
