(329652, 25059, 4564, '<td valign="top">Man, I''ve got to hand it to you: you have a great sense of humor.  Technically, I really don''t like the grainyness of this photo.  But somehow, it just works well with your pose.  It seems to add some surrealism to it.  You did a good job!  7</td>', 'Man, I''ve got to hand it to you: you have a great sense of humor.  Technically, I really don''t like the grainyness of this photo.  But somehow, it just works well with your pose.  It seems to add some surrealism to it.  You did a good job!  7', '2003-06-18 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
