(329665, 25272, 4564, '<td valign="top">Hi.  I love this "frame in a frame" idea.  Actually, I was thinking of doing something similar, but didn''t find a frame in time.  I''m glad I didn''t because you probably did it better than I would have.  You''re a very pretty girl and I think this is a bonus for the shot you decided to go with.  Your expression is perfect.  The pose is great.  I have a little Photoshop Plugin that would have helped you int his photo to get rid of the yellowish tint in your backgruond while keeping the nice skin tones.  It''s legit with DPC, so contact me if you want it (it''s free, but forgot where I downlaoded it).  Removing the yellow in the bgr would have helped to add to the quality of your shot I think.  Using Neat image just a bit more (if you already did) would have added to the skin as well with this kind of glamour shot.  I love the hair! Bad hair day you say?  Nha!  It''s perfect.   On a final note, if you plan to spot edit your final shot later on, you could whiten the eyes a littlebit to make them stand out and the shot will be perfect!  As it is, for DPC, it''s very well done.  I give you an 8.</td>', 'Hi.  I love this "frame in a frame" idea.  Actually, I was thinking of doing something similar, but didn''t find a frame in time.  I''m glad I didn''t because you probably did it better than I would have.  You''re a very pretty girl and I think this is a bonus for the shot you decided to go with.  Your expression is perfect.  The pose is great.  I have a little Photoshop Plugin that would have helped you int his photo to get rid of the yellowish tint in your backgruond while keeping the nice skin tones.  It''s legit with DPC, so contact me if you want it (it''s free, but forgot where I downlaoded it).  Removing the yellow in the bgr would have helped to add to the quality of your shot I think.  Using Neat image just a bit more (if you already did) would have added to the skin as well with this kind of glamour shot.  I love the hair! Bad hair day you say?  Nha!  It''s perfect.   On a final note, if you plan to spot edit your final shot later on, you could whiten the eyes a littlebit to make them stand out and the shot will be perfect!  As it is, for DPC, it''s very well done.  I give you an 8.', '2003-06-18 14:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(329666, 24661, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is so great.  Technically well done, funny, and the perfect book thrown in pushes it over the top in terms of creativity.  Congrats!  10</td>', 'This is so great.  Technically well done, funny, and the perfect book thrown in pushes it over the top in terms of creativity.  Congrats!  10', '2003-06-18 14:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
