(329670, 25199, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very stylish image. The shadows work well and the choice of black and white is good. The upturned white collar gives it a great GQ feel. I also like the slightly off-center composition with the eyes not looking directly at the camera, adds to the broody feel of the portrait.</td>', 'A very stylish image. The shadows work well and the choice of black and white is good. The upturned white collar gives it a great GQ feel. I also like the slightly off-center composition with the eyes not looking directly at the camera, adds to the broody feel of the portrait.', '2003-06-18 14:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(329671, 25101, 5391, '<td valign="top">What an awesome shot.  Great eye-catching colors, tack sharp focus, and creative idea.  10</td>', 'What an awesome shot.  Great eye-catching colors, tack sharp focus, and creative idea.  10', '2003-06-18 14:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
