(329679, 25247, 7653, '<td valign="top">That was pretty neat, the two of you, opposite shots. Nice.</td>', 'That was pretty neat, the two of you, opposite shots. Nice.', '2003-06-18 14:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(329685, 25095, 7778, '<td valign="top">This piece so much more than a photograph. The seemingly incidental composition makes child''s play of the inherent complexity. Assymetries appearing in both, the puzzle pieces (i.e. the unusual triangular shapes) and in the background, add a welcome dynamic and coherence. Background hue and the considerable range of tonality here are sublte, yet aesthetically exciting. There is a wonderful balance between the various elements of this picture, which so often indicates an integrated and apt approach on part of the author. Not a baroque or self-conscious approach to the subject!<br/> <br/>I consistenly reserve 10''s for pieces I''d like to see alongside the ''classic greats''. This is one of them. It does, in my book, add interest to the word.  &gt; 10  <br/></td>', 'This piece so much more than a photograph. The seemingly incidental composition makes child''s play of the inherent complexity. Assymetries appearing in both, the puzzle pieces (i.e. the unusual triangular shapes) and in the background, add a welcome dynamic and coherence. Background hue and the considerable range of tonality here are sublte, yet aesthetically exciting. There is a wonderful balance between the various elements of this picture, which so often indicates an integrated and apt approach on part of the author. Not a baroque or self-conscious approach to the subject! I consistenly reserve 10''s for pieces I''d like to see alongside the ''classic greats''. This is one of them. It does, in my book, add interest to the word.  > 10  ', '2003-06-18 14:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(329686, 24723, 8298, '<td valign="top">very very well done</td>', 'very very well done', '2003-06-18 14:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(329688, 24801, 4224, '<td valign="top">I love the way the blue in the tie and the blue in your eyes compliment each other.  I think the border is also a nice touch.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I love the way the blue in the tie and the blue in your eyes compliment each other.  I think the border is also a nice touch.  Very nicely done.', '2003-06-18 14:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
