(329695, 24767, 4224, '<td valign="top">Do I really even need to say that this is a fantastic picture?  I especially like that the blanket is not simply smooth, but it is uneven.  The similar tones between the body and the background help emphasize the ghostly quality for me.  Lovely picture.</td>', 'Do I really even need to say that this is a fantastic picture?  I especially like that the blanket is not simply smooth, but it is uneven.  The similar tones between the body and the background help emphasize the ghostly quality for me.  Lovely picture.', '2003-06-18 14:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(329696, 25181, 5364, '<td valign="top">I think you should have included a mirror - to show yourself now.</td>', 'I think you should have included a mirror - to show yourself now.', '2003-06-18 14:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(329697, 25134, 4224, '<td valign="top">I like the balance in the background a lot, and I wish that carried into the subject.  The bag being off to one side, as well as the hair predominantly on the other throws this off a little.  The backlighting is a nice touch to emphasize the subject.</td>', 'I like the balance in the background a lot, and I wish that carried into the subject.  The bag being off to one side, as well as the hair predominantly on the other throws this off a little.  The backlighting is a nice touch to emphasize the subject.', '2003-06-18 14:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
