(329700, 25269, 5364, '<td valign="top">Any excuse for a sunset/sunrise!  I think you would have been better placing yourself slightly more to the left in the frame. Otherwise a nice job.</td>', 'Any excuse for a sunset/sunrise!  I think you would have been better placing yourself slightly more to the left in the frame. Otherwise a nice job.', '2003-06-18 14:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
