(329708, 25304, 2152, '<td valign="top">a shame about the border at the bottom being off.  i don''t think you need it anyway.  nice shot, good focus.</td>', 'a shame about the border at the bottom being off.  i don''t think you need it anyway.  nice shot, good focus.', '2003-06-18 14:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(329709, 24801, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hey! Jacko!  Comment va? ;-) You don''t look too too crazzzzzzzzy on this shot though. Nice frame, the white line catches the chemise. And the tie brings out your blue eyes. LOL The negative space works well here as does the cropping... it makes you look taller. :-) 8</td>', 'Hey! Jacko!  Comment va? ;-) You don''t look too too crazzzzzzzzy on this shot though. Nice frame, the white line catches the chemise. And the tie brings out your blue eyes. LOL The negative space works well here as does the cropping... it makes you look taller. :-) 8', '2003-06-18 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(329711, 25096, 2587, '<td valign="top">Love the color, the flash feel ... and the expression. Nice!</td>', 'Love the color, the flash feel ... and the expression. Nice!', '2003-06-18 14:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(329712, 24676, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I love original shots! Too bad your W B was off.</td>', 'Great idea! I love original shots! Too bad your W B was off.', '2003-06-18 14:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(329714, 25224, 2152, '<td valign="top">I think the crop could be better here.  I guess you were going for the neg space thing, but based on your face in the frame, I don''t think it works too well.  Might want to crop out all the black on the right then crop so your nose is centered - more of a portrait orientation rather than a square.</td>', 'I think the crop could be better here.  I guess you were going for the neg space thing, but based on your face in the frame, I don''t think it works too well.  Might want to crop out all the black on the right then crop so your nose is centered - more of a portrait orientation rather than a square.', '2003-06-18 14:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(329715, 25247, 5364, '<td valign="top">The eyes closed was a nice touch.</td>', 'The eyes closed was a nice touch.', '2003-06-18 14:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(329716, 24775, 2152, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what''s in your left hand.  If it''s a beer, I''ll raise my vote a point.  As it is, if you''re doing a reflection shot, lose the camera.</td>', 'I can''t really tell what''s in your left hand.  If it''s a beer, I''ll raise my vote a point.  As it is, if you''re doing a reflection shot, lose the camera.', '2003-06-18 15:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
