(329718, 25078, 2587, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus ... weird pose ... snapshot expression .... overlit ... I love it! I''ll give ya a 9 just for originality .... and cause I like your sweater/ dresshirt combo  :-)</td>', 'Very out of focus ... weird pose ... snapshot expression .... overlit ... I love it! I''ll give ya a 9 just for originality .... and cause I like your sweater/ dresshirt combo  :-)', '2003-06-18 15:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
