(329721, 24828, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>  Interesting Picture Idea.  Do they actually wear these masks on the plane?<br/>The first time I looked at this one i thought it was very blurry, but it doesn''t seems so right now.  Maybe it''s my lack of sleep.  But any way the photo seems to be missing some Wow factor.  A lot of the bottom is just a black void, and the reflections on your glasses is a little distracting.  But Kudos for being able to take your Selfportrait in such a public place.</td>', 'Hello,  Interesting Picture Idea.  Do they actually wear these masks on the plane?The first time I looked at this one i thought it was very blurry, but it doesn''t seems so right now.  Maybe it''s my lack of sleep.  But any way the photo seems to be missing some Wow factor.  A lot of the bottom is just a black void, and the reflections on your glasses is a little distracting.  But Kudos for being able to take your Selfportrait in such a public place.', '2003-06-18 15:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(329722, 25136, 2152, '<td valign="top">whoa, easy on the sepia.  i''m a little overwhelmed by that.  that stairway is nice, should have used a bit more of it.  also, you should have done something to stand out from the background.  nat light, a flash, something</td>', 'whoa, easy on the sepia.  i''m a little overwhelmed by that.  that stairway is nice, should have used a bit more of it.  also, you should have done something to stand out from the background.  nat light, a flash, something', '2003-06-18 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(329723, 25042, 7510, '<td valign="top">Greetings,<br/>You speak french, I guess.  Nice shot.  I line the reflections in your eyes.  Interesting the way you have the contrast going from bright on the left to black on the right.  Personally i think this one is cropped a little too close on your face (top and left).</td>', 'Greetings,You speak french, I guess.  Nice shot.  I line the reflections in your eyes.  Interesting the way you have the contrast going from bright on the left to black on the right.  Personally i think this one is cropped a little too close on your face (top and left).', '2003-06-18 15:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(329725, 24889, 1368, '<td valign="top">just terrible - 1</td>', 'just terrible - 1', '2003-06-18 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(329726, 24767, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the duotone and soft lighitng and focus too.  The grainyness that you added is very effective. And the way you''ve devided the frame into thirds is very good too.</td>', 'I like the duotone and soft lighitng and focus too.  The grainyness that you added is very effective. And the way you''ve devided the frame into thirds is very good too.', '2003-06-18 15:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
