(329741, 24964, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>Nice aura effect here.  You probably know already the line in the ceiling and the power cord are distracting.  I wonder if you could have shot this one from the right so that your head was covering the cord.  It would also be interesting to see what this one would be like if you moved your head forward a little and covered the shadow cast by the light fixture, so that there are just beams coming out.  =o)</td>', 'Hi,Nice aura effect here.  You probably know already the line in the ceiling and the power cord are distracting.  I wonder if you could have shot this one from the right so that your head was covering the cord.  It would also be interesting to see what this one would be like if you moved your head forward a little and covered the shadow cast by the light fixture, so that there are just beams coming out.  =o)', '2003-06-18 15:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(329742, 25236, 7778, '<td valign="top">I like the less than ''self-conscious'' approach and appreciate the intended (and achieved) silhouette. The figure profile clearly retains individual features. The chair reveals an epoch without adding any ''baroque'' distractions, and the converging rungs and arch add a (needed) graphic element.<br/> <br/>My eye, however, would prefer a less central composition...</td>', 'I like the less than ''self-conscious'' approach and appreciate the intended (and achieved) silhouette. The figure profile clearly retains individual features. The chair reveals an epoch without adding any ''baroque'' distractions, and the converging rungs and arch add a (needed) graphic element. My eye, however, would prefer a less central composition...', '2003-06-18 15:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
