(329791, 25276, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus and soft lighting as well, which bring out your features nicely. Cropping works well here too even with the top of your head cut off. I also like the negative space to the left, which helps to define your face. Pose is well chosen. You have big beautiful eyes and the shot is very captivating. Beautiful photo of a beautiful woman!</td>', 'I like the soft focus and soft lighting as well, which bring out your features nicely. Cropping works well here too even with the top of your head cut off. I also like the negative space to the left, which helps to define your face. Pose is well chosen. You have big beautiful eyes and the shot is very captivating. Beautiful photo of a beautiful woman!', '2003-06-18 15:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(329793, 25272, 2587, '<td valign="top">I like your frame idea but I don''t think the bra exposure was necessary to get a high score. A smaller frame around your face would''ve been nice.  ... I like the cheek highlight ...</td>', 'I like your frame idea but I don''t think the bra exposure was necessary to get a high score. A smaller frame around your face would''ve been nice.  ... I like the cheek highlight ...', '2003-06-18 15:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(329794, 25177, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>Nice B/W shot.  It looks like you are laying down and the photo is turned 90 deg.  I like the reflections in you eyes.  I think more contrast (more shadows) might have drawn out more detail and therefore more interest in this photo, because it seems a little flat (I''m not sure that the right term).</td>', 'Hello,Nice B/W shot.  It looks like you are laying down and the photo is turned 90 deg.  I like the reflections in you eyes.  I think more contrast (more shadows) might have drawn out more detail and therefore more interest in this photo, because it seems a little flat (I''m not sure that the right term).', '2003-06-18 15:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(329795, 24676, 9295, '<td valign="top">When looking at the thumbnail on this shot, I wasn''t going to give it a very high score because I didn''t care for the lighting and it seems a bit out of focus. However, I do like the kind of funkiness you get from using the mirror.  Kind of makes you wonder, what''s real and what''s a reflection?</td>', 'When looking at the thumbnail on this shot, I wasn''t going to give it a very high score because I didn''t care for the lighting and it seems a bit out of focus. However, I do like the kind of funkiness you get from using the mirror.  Kind of makes you wonder, what''s real and what''s a reflection?', '2003-06-18 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(329796, 24624, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello Shadow,<br/>I would have perfered to have seen, at least part of the real you in some way.  I think you cropped a little too much at the top, and the light spot in the center distracts.  The footsteps in the sand make a nice backdrop.</td>', 'Hello Shadow,I would have perfered to have seen, at least part of the real you in some way.  I think you cropped a little too much at the top, and the light spot in the center distracts.  The footsteps in the sand make a nice backdrop.', '2003-06-18 15:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(329798, 24801, 8864, '<td valign="top">Can you hear me now, Sprint?  I love it!</td>', 'Can you hear me now, Sprint?  I love it!', '2003-06-18 15:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(329799, 24604, 9295, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit out of focus. In this case, I don''t think the semi-silhouette concept works too well. I would have liked to see more of your eye.</td>', 'It seems a bit out of focus. In this case, I don''t think the semi-silhouette concept works too well. I would have liked to see more of your eye.', '2003-06-18 15:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(329800, 25296, 8864, '<td valign="top">Nice butt!</td>', 'Nice butt!', '2003-06-18 15:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(329801, 25127, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi there,<br/>I tried some "Digital Art" kind of photos before.  They didn''t do so hot.  I hope you do better than I did.  I like how our eyes stand out.  I might have tried to put more focus on them some how.  Maybe the rule of thirds.  Nice colour.</td>', 'Hi there,I tried some "Digital Art" kind of photos before.  They didn''t do so hot.  I hope you do better than I did.  I like how our eyes stand out.  I might have tried to put more focus on them some how.  Maybe the rule of thirds.  Nice colour.', '2003-06-18 15:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(329805, 24557, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hey,<br/>Don''t do it!  OK, this subject turns me of just a bit, but anyways.  I think this one has too much contrast.  I might have tried more black and grayish.  It''s too harsh as it is.</td>', 'Hey,Don''t do it!  OK, this subject turns me of just a bit, but anyways.  I think this one has too much contrast.  I might have tried more black and grayish.  It''s too harsh as it is.', '2003-06-18 15:56:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(329808, 24667, 9295, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and capture of the character in your face. I''m impressed that you were able to elminate so much reflection from  your glasses. That''s the hardest part of taking a photo of anyone who wears them (I know. You rarely see my eyes in most pictures of myself! LOL!). I appreciate that you were able to reduce this problem while taking the picture yourself.</td>', 'Good lighting and capture of the character in your face. I''m impressed that you were able to elminate so much reflection from  your glasses. That''s the hardest part of taking a photo of anyone who wears them (I know. You rarely see my eyes in most pictures of myself! LOL!). I appreciate that you were able to reduce this problem while taking the picture yourself.', '2003-06-18 15:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(329809, 25296, 2223, '<td valign="top">Nice butt!! LOL!! i like this pic, good composition, the lighting is perfect and the colors blend well.</td>', 'Nice butt!! LOL!! i like this pic, good composition, the lighting is perfect and the colors blend well.', '2003-06-18 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(329810, 24894, 2223, '<td valign="top">you did this well.</td>', 'you did this well.', '2003-06-18 16:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(329811, 25279, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello DPCer,<br/>Dizzy, yes.  It''s making me dizzy just looking at it, but I get motion sickness easily.  =o)  Hmmm.  I would have liked to have seen you more in focus and just the background blurred.  Nice crop.  Interesting idea.</td>', 'Hello DPCer,Dizzy, yes.  It''s making me dizzy just looking at it, but I get motion sickness easily.  =o)  Hmmm.  I would have liked to have seen you more in focus and just the background blurred.  Nice crop.  Interesting idea.', '2003-06-18 16:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(329813, 25164, 5475, '<td valign="top">Would have given this a 10 if it were better technically.  I give it a 10 for creativity and its emotive value.  Technically, it seems a little hot on the right side, and could use a little more light on the left.  Your background has a hotspot  behind and above your head.  Stepping away from the wall would have helped.  I give it an 8 based on its appeal and interest level.  It would be fun to see you do this again with better lighting and background...<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Would have given this a 10 if it were better technically.  I give it a 10 for creativity and its emotive value.  Technically, it seems a little hot on the right side, and could use a little more light on the left.  Your background has a hotspot  behind and above your head.  Stepping away from the wall would have helped.  I give it an 8 based on its appeal and interest level.  It would be fun to see you do this again with better lighting and background...JD Anderson', '2003-06-18 16:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(329814, 25217, 2223, '<td valign="top">love the concept, i wish you shown your eyes.</td>', 'love the concept, i wish you shown your eyes.', '2003-06-18 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(329816, 25130, 9295, '<td valign="top">My vote is based solely on technical aspects--not subject, ok?  I like how the lighting focuses on your face and the Batman symbol of your shirt, however, I think you might have cropped it so that you were more on the left side of the shot (no reason to waste so much space with the PC behind you).  I just think it might have given you, the subject, more attention.</td>', 'My vote is based solely on technical aspects--not subject, ok?  I like how the lighting focuses on your face and the Batman symbol of your shirt, however, I think you might have cropped it so that you were more on the left side of the shot (no reason to waste so much space with the PC behind you).  I just think it might have given you, the subject, more attention.', '2003-06-18 16:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(329818, 25278, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello Submariner,<br/>You wild and crazy guy.  Points for originality.  What some people will go through to stay anonymous.  LoL  Interesting how you only left the green, but I have mixed feelings about the amount of shadow here.  Also your mouth looks a little creepy, and I have a weak stomach. =o)</td>', 'Hello Submariner,You wild and crazy guy.  Points for originality.  What some people will go through to stay anonymous.  LoL  Interesting how you only left the green, but I have mixed feelings about the amount of shadow here.  Also your mouth looks a little creepy, and I have a weak stomach. =o)', '2003-06-18 16:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(329819, 24800, 2587, '<td valign="top">Maaaan, you''re brave ... but I can''t seem to make out that bracelet ... could you zoom in a bit ... ;-)</td>', 'Maaaan, you''re brave ... but I can''t seem to make out that bracelet ... could you zoom in a bit ... ;-)', '2003-06-18 16:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(329822, 25284, 9295, '<td valign="top">I appreciate the artistic endeavor but, in a portrait entitled "Essense of Self", I would have prefered to see at least a little of your eye. The way you have the lighting, your nose is what stands out more than anything and, sorry, but I just dont'' see that as illustrating the essense of you.  Interesting shot though.</td>', 'I appreciate the artistic endeavor but, in a portrait entitled "Essense of Self", I would have prefered to see at least a little of your eye. The way you have the lighting, your nose is what stands out more than anything and, sorry, but I just dont'' see that as illustrating the essense of you.  Interesting shot though.', '2003-06-18 16:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(329823, 25177, 7778, '<td valign="top">Unassuming, reasonable straigthforward approach, b &amp; w the appropiate choice for this ''true'' capture. The composition (emphasizing face and hand) is both simple and sensitive.<br/> <br/>My compliments.  &gt; 6</td>', 'Unassuming, reasonable straigthforward approach, b & w the appropiate choice for this ''true'' capture. The composition (emphasizing face and hand) is both simple and sensitive. My compliments.  > 6', '2003-06-18 16:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(329824, 25218, 7510, '<td valign="top">Yo,<br/>Well I think that the Candle isn''t throwing enough light.  It''s too dark.  Most is just a dark void.  You can barly make out the camera, and I think that your earing? is a tad distracting.</td>', 'Yo,Well I think that the Candle isn''t throwing enough light.  It''s too dark.  Most is just a dark void.  You can barly make out the camera, and I think that your earing? is a tad distracting.', '2003-06-18 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(329825, 24557, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''m told my monitor isn''t the best in the world, but perhaps in this case, that''s a good thing becuase I like how I am seeing very little more than black and white (in other words, few shades of grey).  I do wish I could see what you''re holding though.</td>', 'I''m told my monitor isn''t the best in the world, but perhaps in this case, that''s a good thing becuase I like how I am seeing very little more than black and white (in other words, few shades of grey).  I do wish I could see what you''re holding though.', '2003-06-18 16:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(329828, 24838, 2223, '<td valign="top">WoW!! very cool, are you sure this wasn'' t photoshopped? The light on top of the bulb is a little distracting, but thats the only bad, the rest is all good.</td>', 'WoW!! very cool, are you sure this wasn'' t photoshopped? The light on top of the bulb is a little distracting, but thats the only bad, the rest is all good.', '2003-06-18 16:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(329829, 25257, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is nice.  I like the idea that you are turned away from the camera like this.  The pink of your dress stands out nicely against the grass (of which I can see almost every distinct blade).</td>', 'This is nice.  I like the idea that you are turned away from the camera like this.  The pink of your dress stands out nicely against the grass (of which I can see almost every distinct blade).', '2003-06-18 16:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(329830, 25057, 5475, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more depth of field here.  Great photo for a macro or still life.  I like the concept and the colors... Not really a self portrait to me.  I am being very open minded with regards to relativity...  I''m not really looking for a photo of you per se, but at least an image that would reveal some of your character, interests, etc maybe.  All this tells me is that you live on or near the Southern East Coast.  Your chess piece is very large in comparison to the scale of the map, so that is even difficult to determine.  For quality and interest of image, I would give it a 7 or 8, but for applicability to this challenge I need to downgrade it to a 5.<br/>Good luck,<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'Would like to see more depth of field here.  Great photo for a macro or still life.  I like the concept and the colors... Not really a self portrait to me.  I am being very open minded with regards to relativity...  I''m not really looking for a photo of you per se, but at least an image that would reveal some of your character, interests, etc maybe.  All this tells me is that you live on or near the Southern East Coast.  Your chess piece is very large in comparison to the scale of the map, so that is even difficult to determine.  For quality and interest of image, I would give it a 7 or 8, but for applicability to this challenge I need to downgrade it to a 5.Good luck,JD Anderson', '2003-06-18 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(329831, 25082, 9295, '<td valign="top">With your eyes so wide and your hand covering your mouth this way, you look almost like an poster for the latest "Halloween" film. LOL!  I like it.</td>', 'With your eyes so wide and your hand covering your mouth this way, you look almost like an poster for the latest "Halloween" film. LOL!  I like it.', '2003-06-18 16:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(329834, 25184, 9295, '<td valign="top">An interesting way to keep yourself in the shot without actually having to reveal yourself.</td>', 'An interesting way to keep yourself in the shot without actually having to reveal yourself.', '2003-06-18 16:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(329835, 25269, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi there,<br/>Did you catch anything?  Nice sunset.  I like the Silhouette (had to open the spell checker for that word) here.  I tried to get one on my shot but it didn''t turn out the way I imagined.  I mihgt have cropped more of the bottom and left, to get rid of some of the black region, since it doesn''t really add anything.</td>', 'Hi there,Did you catch anything?  Nice sunset.  I like the Silhouette (had to open the spell checker for that word) here.  I tried to get one on my shot but it didn''t turn out the way I imagined.  I mihgt have cropped more of the bottom and left, to get rid of some of the black region, since it doesn''t really add anything.', '2003-06-18 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(329836, 25095, 2223, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, i think  the tiles should be in a way where i can make out your face, it just looks too scrambled, i love the idea.</td>', 'Interesting idea, i think  the tiles should be in a way where i can make out your face, it just looks too scrambled, i love the idea.', '2003-06-18 16:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(329838, 24737, 5475, '<td valign="top">I like this alot...  I know lots of people are going to be looking for a photo of a person.  To me, a self portrait is something that reveals one''s character, personality, etc as well as what they look like.  This image tells a story and reveals something about who you are, rather than just what you look like.  I give it a 7.  Good luck<br/>JD Anderson</td>', 'I like this alot...  I know lots of people are going to be looking for a photo of a person.  To me, a self portrait is something that reveals one''s character, personality, etc as well as what they look like.  This image tells a story and reveals something about who you are, rather than just what you look like.  I give it a 7.  Good luckJD Anderson', '2003-06-18 16:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(329840, 25213, 9295, '<td valign="top">A bit soft in focus but nice placement on the page.  I would have liked to see better lighting on you. To be honest, my eye is drawn more to the greenery behind the tree than to you.</td>', 'A bit soft in focus but nice placement on the page.  I would have liked to see better lighting on you. To be honest, my eye is drawn more to the greenery behind the tree than to you.', '2003-06-18 16:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(329841, 25164, 2223, '<td valign="top">This is a great photo!!! 10</td>', 'This is a great photo!!! 10', '2003-06-18 16:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(329843, 24843, 7778, '<td valign="top">The inclusion of ambience here is very refreshing in this context. The photo appeals to me in a very direct and untechnical way. The shadow creates a symmetry, which, IMO, nicely compensates for the subject looking outside of the picture.</td>', 'The inclusion of ambience here is very refreshing in this context. The photo appeals to me in a very direct and untechnical way. The shadow creates a symmetry, which, IMO, nicely compensates for the subject looking outside of the picture.', '2003-06-18 16:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(329844, 25161, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hey dude,<br/>Nice shot.  Looks like you used a strobe or something.  You certainly are falling, but if I was to nit-pick you aren''t falling with style.  I hate to use the term boring here, but I feel this one is lacking something to put it over the top.</td>', 'Hey dude,Nice shot.  Looks like you used a strobe or something.  You certainly are falling, but if I was to nit-pick you aren''t falling with style.  I hate to use the term boring here, but I feel this one is lacking something to put it over the top.', '2003-06-18 16:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(329845, 24889, 2223, '<td valign="top">onesweetsin is this you!! Lookin'' good! lol...ignore if its not.</td>', 'onesweetsin is this you!! Lookin'' good! lol...ignore if its not.', '2003-06-18 16:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(329846, 24882, 6775, '<td valign="top">The mood, the lighting... love this shot</td>', 'The mood, the lighting... love this shot', '2003-06-18 16:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(329849, 24676, 2223, '<td valign="top">very trippy</td>', 'very trippy', '2003-06-18 16:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(329850, 25270, 7510, '<td valign="top">Heya,<br/>Your pretty cute, if you don''t mind me saying.  I like the DoF.  And the red and blue sure are vibrant, and so are your eyes.  Nice composition.  Can''t really see anything wrong with this shot.</td>', 'Heya,Your pretty cute, if you don''t mind me saying.  I like the DoF.  And the red and blue sure are vibrant, and so are your eyes.  Nice composition.  Can''t really see anything wrong with this shot.', '2003-06-18 16:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(329851, 25244, 9412, '<td valign="top">you''re pretttty</td>', 'you''re pretttty', '2003-06-18 16:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(329852, 24737, 9295, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot but not exactly a self-portrait. I like the colors and lighting though.</td>', 'Interesting shot but not exactly a self-portrait. I like the colors and lighting though.', '2003-06-18 16:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(329853, 24683, 7778, '<td valign="top">Ah, it''s bold and has ''zing''! I have a feeling, it may also have ''worked'' in colour? Very refreshing change from the voting routine. Thanks.</td>', 'Ah, it''s bold and has ''zing''! I have a feeling, it may also have ''worked'' in colour? Very refreshing change from the voting routine. Thanks.', '2003-06-18 16:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(329854, 25303, 2223, '<td valign="top">LOL..cool shot.</td>', 'LOL..cool shot.', '2003-06-18 16:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(329855, 25035, 2223, '<td valign="top">I would like this MUCH better if you cropped out that red distraction up top. Its very cool otherwise.</td>', 'I would like this MUCH better if you cropped out that red distraction up top. Its very cool otherwise.', '2003-06-18 16:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(329856, 24791, 7510, '<td valign="top">Greetings,<br/>Is this your Picture?  Your 58 years old?  I keep thinking that this is a X-Ray, and then how you got the contrast so high.  But I guess this is a Cat Scan, or something similar (hense the Magneton).  I think if you were partially standing in front of the XRay/CatScan it might have tied the two together more, instead of seeming like two separate pictures.</td>', 'Greetings,Is this your Picture?  Your 58 years old?  I keep thinking that this is a X-Ray, and then how you got the contrast so high.  But I guess this is a Cat Scan, or something similar (hense the Magneton).  I think if you were partially standing in front of the XRay/CatScan it might have tied the two together more, instead of seeming like two separate pictures.', '2003-06-18 16:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(329857, 24767, 7778, '<td valign="top">It''s overly pixellized, on the very edge of this topic, too artsy... In short, a wonderful photograph. Nothing left to criticize or to improve on. Breathtaking! &gt; 8 <br/> <br/></td>', 'It''s overly pixellized, on the very edge of this topic, too artsy... In short, a wonderful photograph. Nothing left to criticize or to improve on. Breathtaking! > 8  ', '2003-06-18 16:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(329858, 25189, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>Canon eh?  Canon is Kool.  Hmm,  I don''t really like the grainyness of this one.  Maybe if there was a little less Grain.  Also I think the boarder is a little too thick.</td>', 'Hello,Canon eh?  Canon is Kool.  Hmm,  I don''t really like the grainyness of this one.  Maybe if there was a little less Grain.  Also I think the boarder is a little too thick.', '2003-06-18 16:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(329860, 25113, 4610, '<td valign="top">Same thing happens to me....</td>', 'Same thing happens to me....', '2003-06-18 16:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(329861, 25249, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hey,<br/>Hmm.  This one look a little too freaky to me.  Interesting Idea though.  Lots of Hue/Saturation adjustments I am guessing.  Nice use of shallow DoF, but I think your forhead is a little too satruated.  And the blue into the stubble, under your nose, distracts a little.  Maybe that was unavodable.</td>', 'Hey,Hmm.  This one look a little too freaky to me.  Interesting Idea though.  Lots of Hue/Saturation adjustments I am guessing.  Nice use of shallow DoF, but I think your forhead is a little too satruated.  And the blue into the stubble, under your nose, distracts a little.  Maybe that was unavodable.', '2003-06-18 16:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(329862, 24762, 7778, '<td valign="top">I suspect, this portrait may not fare as well here as, IMO, it should. The focus is very ''soft''. The hand, perhaps, a tad too cut off, the frame quite massive, considering the size of the picture. Yet, I like it quite a bit, because of the turn of the century manner and, not least, the sincerity communicated by both manner and subject. &gt; 6</td>', 'I suspect, this portrait may not fare as well here as, IMO, it should. The focus is very ''soft''. The hand, perhaps, a tad too cut off, the frame quite massive, considering the size of the picture. Yet, I like it quite a bit, because of the turn of the century manner and, not least, the sincerity communicated by both manner and subject. > 6', '2003-06-18 16:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(329863, 24661, 2223, '<td valign="top">john..get off the toilet already.</td>', 'john..get off the toilet already.', '2003-06-18 16:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(329865, 25258, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi Pinkie,<br/>Is that your screen name?  I''m not going to check.  I''ll find out when the challenge is over.  Looks like your camera focused on the mirror and not on your face.  In general this photo looks too soft, and too cluttered.</td>', 'Hi Pinkie,Is that your screen name?  I''m not going to check.  I''ll find out when the challenge is over.  Looks like your camera focused on the mirror and not on your face.  In general this photo looks too soft, and too cluttered.', '2003-06-18 16:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(329866, 24716, 2223, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2003-06-18 16:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(329870, 25106, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello DPCer,<br/>Nice B/W shot.  Interesting use of the shallow DoF.  I like the shadows and highlights.  in general a very nice shot.</td>', 'Hello DPCer,Nice B/W shot.  Interesting use of the shallow DoF.  I like the shadows and highlights.  in general a very nice shot.', '2003-06-18 16:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(329872, 24723, 7510, '<td valign="top">Whoa man,<br/>Calm down a little.  =o)  Very in your face.  But a little too close for me.  Nice Texture, and shadows.  But I find your teeth a little too bright.</td>', 'Whoa man,Calm down a little.  =o)  Very in your face.  But a little too close for me.  Nice Texture, and shadows.  But I find your teeth a little too bright.', '2003-06-18 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(329873, 24824, 2223, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2003-06-18 16:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(329874, 24843, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi there,<br/>I like this shot.  Nice tones, and the symmetry of your shadow on the wall.  Great composition, and highlights.  I don''t know why but it makes me smile.</td>', 'Hi there,I like this shot.  Nice tones, and the symmetry of your shadow on the wall.  Great composition, and highlights.  I don''t know why but it makes me smile.', '2003-06-18 16:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(329876, 24894, 7510, '<td valign="top">Greetings,<br/>Interesting idea.  But it seems a little out of proportion, which throws me a little.  Just a little too weird.</td>', 'Greetings,Interesting idea.  But it seems a little out of proportion, which throws me a little.  Just a little too weird.', '2003-06-18 16:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(329877, 24762, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi there,<br/>This photo has that old fashoned look to it.  Too bad the focus is a little soft.  I''m not sure that your hand there adds to this shot.  I would have cropped this one so there are more "Lead in" rather than have you centered in the middle.</td>', 'Hi there,This photo has that old fashoned look to it.  Too bad the focus is a little soft.  I''m not sure that your hand there adds to this shot.  I would have cropped this one so there are more "Lead in" rather than have you centered in the middle.', '2003-06-18 16:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(329878, 24656, 3959, '<td valign="top">Very, very, very good image. One of the very best here!!!</td>', 'Very, very, very good image. One of the very best here!!!', '2003-06-18 16:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(329881, 24894, 3959, '<td valign="top">WONDERFUL !!!!! One of the best here! great idea, very clever!!! I hope you win.</td>', 'WONDERFUL !!!!! One of the best here! great idea, very clever!!! I hope you win.', '2003-06-18 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(329882, 25195, 4224, '<td valign="top">I like your expression and pose a lot, however I wish the background wasn''t quite so washed out.</td>', 'I like your expression and pose a lot, however I wish the background wasn''t quite so washed out.', '2003-06-18 16:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(329884, 24747, 7778, '<td valign="top">I find this portrait difficult to rate and challenging to comment on.<br/> <br/>What appeals to me most, really, is the subject. The unassuming approach and fairly straightforward (except for the very appropiate soft focus) rendering delivers features of remarkable beauty and conscious expression. If seasons had a face, I imagine, this one would suit them very well. It speaks, to me, of both joy and the trials of life.<br/> <br/>&gt; 9</td>', 'I find this portrait difficult to rate and challenging to comment on. What appeals to me most, really, is the subject. The unassuming approach and fairly straightforward (except for the very appropiate soft focus) rendering delivers features of remarkable beauty and conscious expression. If seasons had a face, I imagine, this one would suit them very well. It speaks, to me, of both joy and the trials of life. > 9', '2003-06-18 16:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(329885, 25129, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>Very kool.  Is that your hair?  If it is, it must have taken a long time to do.  This shot is kind of sexy in a way.  It might have been interesting if you put another photo in the lap of the photo in your lap.  Do you follow me, because I''m not sure I do.  =o)  The infinity thing.<br/>The way your face is lit is kind of Sepia''ish.  Maybe if you did the whole photo in sepia (if your camra suports it), like your arms and legs, it would add more.</td>', 'Hi,Very kool.  Is that your hair?  If it is, it must have taken a long time to do.  This shot is kind of sexy in a way.  It might have been interesting if you put another photo in the lap of the photo in your lap.  Do you follow me, because I''m not sure I do.  =o)  The infinity thing.The way your face is lit is kind of Sepia''ish.  Maybe if you did the whole photo in sepia (if your camra suports it), like your arms and legs, it would add more.', '2003-06-18 16:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(329886, 24767, 3959, '<td valign="top">Perhaps not a *traditional* sefl-portrait, nonetheless a wonderful image. One of the best here, I hope you win. (*and* you''ve got a great butt, which is,  of course, MUCH more important...)</td>', 'Perhaps not a *traditional* sefl-portrait, nonetheless a wonderful image. One of the best here, I hope you win. (*and* you''ve got a great butt, which is,  of course, MUCH more important...)', '2003-06-18 16:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
