(329984, 25184, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not an amazing composition (or incredibly original) but this is a pleasing shot. It may have been worth holding the camera in the middle of your body (and snapping a few until you get the shot you want) so that you don''t see the hand holding the camera to your eye. It would make the image a little more evocative.</td>', 'Not an amazing composition (or incredibly original) but this is a pleasing shot. It may have been worth holding the camera in the middle of your body (and snapping a few until you get the shot you want) so that you don''t see the hand holding the camera to your eye. It would make the image a little more evocative.', '2003-06-18 18:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
