(329997, 25144, 8860, '<td valign="top">An interesting shot - it''s just a shame it wasn''t lower down to avoid the harsh lightbulb. You could have crouched down so that your hands came lower than the screen, then the image could be cropped at the screen edge. Try obscuring the bulb - it looks so much easier on the eye and draws you in to the shape of your body without so many clues as to what you''re looking at..<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-25 04:09:48.</i></td>', 'An interesting shot - it''s just a shame it wasn''t lower down to avoid the harsh lightbulb. You could have crouched down so that your hands came lower than the screen, then the image could be cropped at the screen edge. Try obscuring the bulb - it looks so much easier on the eye and draws you in to the shape of your body without so many clues as to what you''re looking at..', '2003-06-18 18:13:10.000000', '2003-06-25 05:09:48.000000', 1),
