(330032, 24676, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent stuff on a number of counts. It gets you thinking - very nice saturation of colours. I still can''t quite work out the mirror set up.</td>', 'Excellent stuff on a number of counts. It gets you thinking - very nice saturation of colours. I still can''t quite work out the mirror set up.', '2003-06-18 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(330033, 25105, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and mellow lighting. Brings your eyes out nicely!</td>', 'Nice tones and mellow lighting. Brings your eyes out nicely!', '2003-06-18 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330034, 25037, 7711, '<td valign="top">teeny bit grainy, but I like the tones. Skin is beautiful, as are bodies, male or female, and yours is a beautiful body with lovely tones. I like how you let your wee nipple poke out. This is exactly what all of us FEEL like when we take a picture of ourselves, like we are naked and waiting for the world to judge us based on the outside. I got a body a lot like yours...cocoa and ample, and most days, I''m pretty happy with it. Thank you for posting this and being brave. Now..for the lighting..its a little strange, where part of you is blown out and other part of you is very shadowed, but its dramatic. Not sure I would have chosen this angle for presentation either, but its art, and we all love it! I like the inclusion of your hand with the wedding ring, reminiscent of love. :)</td>', 'teeny bit grainy, but I like the tones. Skin is beautiful, as are bodies, male or female, and yours is a beautiful body with lovely tones. I like how you let your wee nipple poke out. This is exactly what all of us FEEL like when we take a picture of ourselves, like we are naked and waiting for the world to judge us based on the outside. I got a body a lot like yours...cocoa and ample, and most days, I''m pretty happy with it. Thank you for posting this and being brave. Now..for the lighting..its a little strange, where part of you is blown out and other part of you is very shadowed, but its dramatic. Not sure I would have chosen this angle for presentation either, but its art, and we all love it! I like the inclusion of your hand with the wedding ring, reminiscent of love. :)', '2003-06-18 18:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(330036, 25304, 8860, '<td valign="top">I must be the unluckiest man alive then. Don''t be so superstitious! Nice pic though a bit melancholy. (Everyone seems so serious in this challenge!)</td>', 'I must be the unluckiest man alive then. Don''t be so superstitious! Nice pic though a bit melancholy. (Everyone seems so serious in this challenge!)', '2003-06-18 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(330038, 24887, 8171, '<td valign="top">Great idea - warts and all (nothing personal;)0)!  I love the gaps through the curlers -10</td>', 'Great idea - warts and all (nothing personal;)0)!  I love the gaps through the curlers -10', '2003-06-18 18:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(330039, 25301, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful. :) I wish you didn''t cut your head off. Great job capturing skin tones though. bravo!</td>', 'beautiful. :) I wish you didn''t cut your head off. Great job capturing skin tones though. bravo!', '2003-06-18 18:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330040, 24831, 7711, '<td valign="top">serial killer look..I hope you answer your door that way when the JWs come by! :) Love the lighting..this is something I tried, but failed miserably at!</td>', 'serial killer look..I hope you answer your door that way when the JWs come by! :) Love the lighting..this is something I tried, but failed miserably at!', '2003-06-18 18:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330041, 25056, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice arrangement. Lovely tones too.</td>', 'Very nice arrangement. Lovely tones too.', '2003-06-18 18:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(330046, 25281, 7711, '<td valign="top">adore the lighting on this. Well done.</td>', 'adore the lighting on this. Well done.', '2003-06-18 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(330048, 24837, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure I like the lighting on this.  looks like a flashlight shining on your mouth.  which draws our attention to the light actually.  I wish that your eyes were a bit more highlighted, you have very nice eyes.  The pose is good, maybe a little better if you hadn''t cropped your chin, but still a nice angle.</td>', 'I''m not really sure I like the lighting on this.  looks like a flashlight shining on your mouth.  which draws our attention to the light actually.  I wish that your eyes were a bit more highlighted, you have very nice eyes.  The pose is good, maybe a little better if you hadn''t cropped your chin, but still a nice angle.', '2003-06-18 18:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(330049, 24801, 7711, '<td valign="top">you look like a corpse! Very morbid lighting and pose. Well done!!! I love it.</td>', 'you look like a corpse! Very morbid lighting and pose. Well done!!! I love it.', '2003-06-18 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330051, 24989, 7711, '<td valign="top">reminds me of those old bw photos of boxers in the 40s. Great pose!</td>', 'reminds me of those old bw photos of boxers in the 40s. Great pose!', '2003-06-18 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(330055, 24825, 3080, '<td valign="top">focus and clarity are really good, but we can''t really see either your face, or Gi''s face.  The main subject really seems to be your hair. specifically the top of your head.  Wish we could see your faces more. I think that would make for a more exciting photo.</td>', 'focus and clarity are really good, but we can''t really see either your face, or Gi''s face.  The main subject really seems to be your hair. specifically the top of your head.  Wish we could see your faces more. I think that would make for a more exciting photo.', '2003-06-18 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330057, 25247, 7711, '<td valign="top">awww..I saw this back to back with "holding him" sooo cute. :)</td>', 'awww..I saw this back to back with "holding him" sooo cute. :)', '2003-06-18 18:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(330058, 24824, 8860, '<td valign="top">Pull yourself together, man! A good concept, although I feel that there should be something clear and crisp in the shot as you rely entirely on the crispness of the printed pieces.</td>', 'Pull yourself together, man! A good concept, although I feel that there should be something clear and crisp in the shot as you rely entirely on the crispness of the printed pieces.', '2003-06-18 18:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(330059, 25212, 7711, '<td valign="top">what a great shot!! :) I love. Tones are nice and funny concept. I''m being generous on votes, so not gonna give you lower than a 5!</td>', 'what a great shot!! :) I love. Tones are nice and funny concept. I''m being generous on votes, so not gonna give you lower than a 5!', '2003-06-18 18:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(330062, 25246, 8860, '<td valign="top">Imagine the chances of that happening - getting run over and having your camera handy!</td>', 'Imagine the chances of that happening - getting run over and having your camera handy!', '2003-06-18 18:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(330063, 25185, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting.  lol.  Definately original.  the lighting is good for the most part, except on your back.  Assuming you''re the guy on the right. :)  Anyway, focus and clarity look good, and I like how you seperated the photo between you and the other guy.   you cropped the horn a bit, but I think that''s actually a good thing, otherwise you''d have too much cow.</td>', 'interesting.  lol.  Definately original.  the lighting is good for the most part, except on your back.  Assuming you''re the guy on the right. :)  Anyway, focus and clarity look good, and I like how you seperated the photo between you and the other guy.   you cropped the horn a bit, but I think that''s actually a good thing, otherwise you''d have too much cow.', '2003-06-18 18:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(330064, 25244, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice study. Good lighting and some lovely tones. Would have been a lovely shot apart from the subject matter. Just kidding obviously!!</td>', 'Nice study. Good lighting and some lovely tones. Would have been a lovely shot apart from the subject matter. Just kidding obviously!!', '2003-06-18 18:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(330065, 25207, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Absolutely.  Great job!<br/> <br/>Lighting:vg<br/> <br/>Exposure:vg<br/> <br/>Focus:vg<br/> <br/>Creativity:vg<br/> <br/>Composition:vg<br/> <br/>Background: vg<br/>Great job...good luck!</td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Absolutely.  Great job! Lighting:vg Exposure:vg Focus:vg Creativity:vg Composition:vg Background: vgGreat job...good luck!', '2003-06-18 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(330066, 24981, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like the composition. Very evocative.</td>', 'Like the composition. Very evocative.', '2003-06-18 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330070, 25281, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice study. Good lighting and tones.</td>', 'Nice study. Good lighting and tones.', '2003-06-18 18:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(330071, 25094, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wish we could see your face.  I think this photo would take the cake in the Black on Black challenge.  So, I hope you took extras. :)    I really hope to see one of these in that challenge as well.  Excellent use of lighting, focus and angle.  I like this shot a lot, just wish we could see that smile. :)</td>', 'Wish we could see your face.  I think this photo would take the cake in the Black on Black challenge.  So, I hope you took extras. :)    I really hope to see one of these in that challenge as well.  Excellent use of lighting, focus and angle.  I like this shot a lot, just wish we could see that smile. :)', '2003-06-18 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330073, 25290, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? yes<br/> <br/>Lighting:ok<br/> <br/>Exposure:ok<br/> <br/>Focus:ok<br/> <br/>Creativity:good<br/> <br/>Composition:good<br/> <br/>Background:ok</td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? yes Lighting:ok Exposure:ok Focus:ok Creativity:good Composition:good Background:ok', '2003-06-18 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(330074, 24684, 3080, '<td valign="top">the out of focus hand bothers me a bit here.  I find it to be a bit of a distraction.  I like how you have the black and white on the color reflection(?).  Focus and clarity of you is good.  lighting is also good on the subject, but again, not on the hand.</td>', 'the out of focus hand bothers me a bit here.  I find it to be a bit of a distraction.  I like how you have the black and white on the color reflection(?).  Focus and clarity of you is good.  lighting is also good on the subject, but again, not on the hand.', '2003-06-18 18:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(330075, 25286, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like this shot very much. Great textures and enigmatic set-up.</td>', 'Like this shot very much. Great textures and enigmatic set-up.', '2003-06-18 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330078, 25293, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very novel.</td>', 'Very novel.', '2003-06-18 19:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(330079, 25197, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Yes, it sure did.<br/> <br/>Lighting:pretty good....just a bit lighter or brighter would improve it.<br/> <br/>Exposure:good<br/> <br/>Focus:good<br/> <br/>Creativity:the hat adds a little fun here.<br/> <br/>Composition:good....eyes in the upper third<br/> <br/>Background: Would be better without the bar to your right.</td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Yes, it sure did. Lighting:pretty good....just a bit lighter or brighter would improve it. Exposure:good Focus:good Creativity:the hat adds a little fun here. Composition:good....eyes in the upper third Background: Would be better without the bar to your right.', '2003-06-18 19:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(330082, 24557, 3080, '<td valign="top">interesting shot.  good use of dramatic lighting and contrast.  the thing in front of your face though is bothering me cause I can''t figure out what the heck it is.  I like how you were able to get some highlights in your hair too.  overall a very nice shot.  I''m not usually fond of these kinds of shots, but this one appeals to me.</td>', 'interesting shot.  good use of dramatic lighting and contrast.  the thing in front of your face though is bothering me cause I can''t figure out what the heck it is.  I like how you were able to get some highlights in your hair too.  overall a very nice shot.  I''m not usually fond of these kinds of shots, but this one appeals to me.', '2003-06-18 19:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330083, 25213, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? Yes...even the location choice shows some character.<br/> <br/>Lighting:good<br/> <br/>Exposure:good<br/> <br/>Focus: a bit soft, but acceptable<br/> <br/>Creativity: better than average<br/> <br/>Composition:good<br/> <br/>Background:Very nice and natural</td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? Yes...even the location choice shows some character. Lighting:good Exposure:good Focus: a bit soft, but acceptable Creativity: better than average Composition:good Background:Very nice and natural', '2003-06-18 19:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(330084, 25309, 3080, '<td valign="top">i can see more of your hair than I can your face.  the lighting on your face is a little dark as well.  the sharpest focus seems to be on the left side of the photo and your hand.  I wish that your face were in focus a bit more.  I find the out of focus hair in front of your face a bit distracting.  nice to meet you though.</td>', 'i can see more of your hair than I can your face.  the lighting on your face is a little dark as well.  the sharpest focus seems to be on the left side of the photo and your hand.  I wish that your face were in focus a bit more.  I find the out of focus hair in front of your face a bit distracting.  nice to meet you though.', '2003-06-18 19:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(330085, 24791, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Yes Sir!  <br/> <br/>Lighting:good<br/> <br/>Exposure. good<br/> <br/>Focus:very good<br/> <br/>Creativity:above average, very good idea.<br/> <br/>Composition:good<br/> <br/>Background:good<br/> <br/>Nice clarity on the eyes, which is quite important. I also like that you are smiling...rare!<br/>Very good job!</td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that?  Yes Sir!   Lighting:good Exposure. good Focus:very good Creativity:above average, very good idea. Composition:good Background:good Nice clarity on the eyes, which is quite important. I also like that you are smiling...rare!Very good job!', '2003-06-18 19:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330086, 25202, 3080, '<td valign="top">this cracks me up.  focus and clarity are really good.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are just fine as well.  humor is way up there.  only thing bothering me is the shadow from your chin.  otherwise nice.</td>', 'this cracks me up.  focus and clarity are really good.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are just fine as well.  humor is way up there.  only thing bothering me is the shadow from your chin.  otherwise nice.', '2003-06-18 19:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330087, 25311, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot of your nostrils, unfortunately, that''s not really what I''d prefer looking at.  everything is leading straight to the nose, so that is definately the main focal point of the shot.  your focus and clarity are good, and the background works nicely for this.  nothing distracting there.  would have prefered a different angle though.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot of your nostrils, unfortunately, that''s not really what I''d prefer looking at.  everything is leading straight to the nose, so that is definately the main focal point of the shot.  your focus and clarity are good, and the background works nicely for this.  nothing distracting there.  would have prefered a different angle though.', '2003-06-18 19:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(330089, 25266, 8860, '<td valign="top">Like this. It''s evocative, unsentimental and says something about you. Good composition, lighting and tone.</td>', 'Like this. It''s evocative, unsentimental and says something about you. Good composition, lighting and tone.', '2003-06-18 19:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
