(330092, 25119, 8860, '<td valign="top">A good bit of compressed air will get rid of the muck on that! A great shot which says a lot about you. How long did it take you to build the giant lens?</td>', 'A good bit of compressed air will get rid of the muck on that! A great shot which says a lot about you. How long did it take you to build the giant lens?', '2003-06-18 19:11:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(330093, 24737, 3080, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I have looked and looked, and I see what looks to be a head shaped rock right in the middle, but I''m not seeing any human beings in this shot.  This doesn''t give me the impression of a portrait at all.  Wish we could have seen  you in this shot.  Sorry if I''m missing it, but not what I think of when I think Self portrait.  I can''t even find the ''self''.</td>', 'Sorry, but I have looked and looked, and I see what looks to be a head shaped rock right in the middle, but I''m not seeing any human beings in this shot.  This doesn''t give me the impression of a portrait at all.  Wish we could have seen  you in this shot.  Sorry if I''m missing it, but not what I think of when I think Self portrait.  I can''t even find the ''self''.', '2003-06-18 19:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
