(330096, 25249, 1280, '<td valign="top">I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? yes<br/> <br/></td>', 'I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? yes ', '2003-06-18 19:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(330099, 24955, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting and unique<br/>I think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? well....not really<br/> <br/>This focuses more on the rocks than you.  It shows good texture, and interest, but not a good portrait...per se.</td>', 'Interesting and uniqueI think a portrait should reveal some character, or emotion of the model, by showing expression in eyes or other facial features.   Did your picture accomplish that? well....not really This focuses more on the rocks than you.  It shows good texture, and interest, but not a good portrait...per se.', '2003-06-18 19:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(330100, 25199, 7778, '<td valign="top">Both subject ( interesting, appealing features) and manner (conservative framing/focal distance and subdued sharpness, side-lit, b &amp; w)) make for a sensitive and very satisfying portrait.<br/> <br/>Congratulations, also on your looks! ;-)</td>', 'Both subject ( interesting, appealing features) and manner (conservative framing/focal distance and subdued sharpness, side-lit, b & w)) make for a sensitive and very satisfying portrait. Congratulations, also on your looks! ;-)', '2003-06-18 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(330102, 25276, 2152, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, but I''m not crazy about the knee - it''s kinda coming out of nowhere and looks a little strange.  Would have liked to see this in color for the eyes.</td>', 'Nice framing, but I''m not crazy about the knee - it''s kinda coming out of nowhere and looks a little strange.  Would have liked to see this in color for the eyes.', '2003-06-18 19:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(330105, 25178, 3080, '<td valign="top">horrible red eye.  the posters in the back seem to be more of a focal point that you though.  You seemed to have barely squeeked into the shot.  tilted background, and upright face seem a little odd to me.  Would like to have seen the background stright, or the face tilted with the background.  focus and clarity are good though.</td>', 'horrible red eye.  the posters in the back seem to be more of a focal point that you though.  You seemed to have barely squeeked into the shot.  tilted background, and upright face seem a little odd to me.  Would like to have seen the background stright, or the face tilted with the background.  focus and clarity are good though.', '2003-06-18 19:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(330107, 24686, 7263, '<td valign="top">a solid profile well posed. I woudl crop some off the top though to tighten the image up.</td>', 'a solid profile well posed. I woudl crop some off the top though to tighten the image up.', '2003-06-18 19:23:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330108, 25095, 2152, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of pixellation here - not sure if it''s the camera, the crop, the editing or what, but it takes away from the photo.</td>', 'There''s a lot of pixellation here - not sure if it''s the camera, the crop, the editing or what, but it takes away from the photo.', '2003-06-18 19:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(330109, 24882, 7263, '<td valign="top">The tats make this look cool. I would get rid of the border though, it distracts from the image. better all balck in my humble opinion.</td>', 'The tats make this look cool. I would get rid of the border though, it distracts from the image. better all balck in my humble opinion.', '2003-06-18 19:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330111, 25180, 7263, '<td valign="top">Really vibrant colours, excellent! Best pic yet. Shame the fence posts are not straight.</td>', 'Really vibrant colours, excellent! Best pic yet. Shame the fence posts are not straight.', '2003-06-18 19:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
