(330359, 25037, 2792, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait!  Like the lighting, tone, and the grainy look.  Not sure if I like the jewelry being in the photo or not; somewhat of a distraction IMHO.  I also wonder if another angle would work better.  Still, a very good shot.  7</td>', 'Nice portrait!  Like the lighting, tone, and the grainy look.  Not sure if I like the jewelry being in the photo or not; somewhat of a distraction IMHO.  I also wonder if another angle would work better.  Still, a very good shot.  7', '2003-06-18 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
