(330367, 25197, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>Halfway up the stairs?  Strange location.  Makes me think, does this have any meaning?  I not particularly fond of the yellow cast here.  Maybe if your Camera has some kind of white balance to compensate for the type of lighting.  I also would have like to have seen the highlighted part of your face a little brighter  The cropping is good..</td>', 'Hello,Halfway up the stairs?  Strange location.  Makes me think, does this have any meaning?  I not particularly fond of the yellow cast here.  Maybe if your Camera has some kind of white balance to compensate for the type of lighting.  I also would have like to have seen the highlighted part of your face a little brighter  The cropping is good..', '2003-06-18 22:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(330368, 24811, 5112, '<td valign="top">Bunny, you look beautiful!</td>', 'Bunny, you look beautiful!', '2003-06-18 22:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330370, 24633, 2011, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  My son says" Why do all you people have to get naked"  He dosent get how we go about expressing ourselves artisticly.</td>', 'Very cool.  My son says" Why do all you people have to get naked"  He dosent get how we go about expressing ourselves artisticly.', '2003-06-18 22:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
