(330373, 24747, 6464, '<td valign="top">Colors seem slightly washed out.</td>', 'Colors seem slightly washed out.', '2003-06-18 22:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(330374, 24625, 7556, '<td valign="top">Lovely, nice composition, love your hair...&amp; the shadows are nice, too...</td>', 'Lovely, nice composition, love your hair...& the shadows are nice, too...', '2003-06-18 22:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330375, 24791, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  Very original.  nice use of black and white.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  Very original.  nice use of black and white.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-18 22:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(330378, 24557, 2716, '<td valign="top">Great lighting job.  Super use of black and white.  Keep up the god work.  Jacko.</td>', 'Great lighting job.  Super use of black and white.  Keep up the god work.  Jacko.', '2003-06-18 22:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330379, 25282, 2716, '<td valign="top">Moce lighting job and detail.  Jacko. 9</td>', 'Moce lighting job and detail.  Jacko. 9', '2003-06-18 22:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330381, 24994, 2792, '<td valign="top">Unique!  Great abstract.  It''s so nice to see a photo a little different from the rest.  The black dot by itself is a tiny distraction.  High marks for creativity!   8  =-)</td>', 'Unique!  Great abstract.  It''s so nice to see a photo a little different from the rest.  The black dot by itself is a tiny distraction.  High marks for creativity!   8  =-)', '2003-06-18 22:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(330383, 25229, 2011, '<td valign="top">Strange stuff here.  Dont know exactly what to say....I like it...I think....</td>', 'Strange stuff here.  Dont know exactly what to say....I like it...I think....', '2003-06-18 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(330384, 25211, 2011, '<td valign="top">very revealing.  I like it</td>', 'very revealing.  I like it', '2003-06-18 22:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(330386, 25097, 2716, '<td valign="top">wowsers.  What beautiful eyes and lips.  Nice color contrast (lips and background).  Jacko.  10</td>', 'wowsers.  What beautiful eyes and lips.  Nice color contrast (lips and background).  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-18 22:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(330387, 25262, 7510, '<td valign="top">Greetings,<br/>Hmmm.  One of the first things my eyes were drawn to is the shirt.  Especially across your midsection.  The lines look unnaturally even.  maybe not the best shirt for this composition.  A cute shot, but something aboutt he cropping here doesn''t seem to sit right with me.  It almost seems incomplete.  If I was to nit-pick, I would say there is a slight smerk on your face (assuming you are the older gentlemen in the photo), but if you are like me, it would be hard to hold it in.</td>', 'Greetings,Hmmm.  One of the first things my eyes were drawn to is the shirt.  Especially across your midsection.  The lines look unnaturally even.  maybe not the best shirt for this composition.  A cute shot, but something aboutt he cropping here doesn''t seem to sit right with me.  It almost seems incomplete.  If I was to nit-pick, I would say there is a slight smerk on your face (assuming you are the older gentlemen in the photo), but if you are like me, it would be hard to hold it in.', '2003-06-18 22:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(330388, 24589, 2716, '<td valign="top">very nice tones.  I really like this one.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'very nice tones.  I really like this one.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-18 22:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(330389, 25247, 2011, '<td valign="top">sweet, dont know alot of guys that would show this romantic side of themselves.</td>', 'sweet, dont know alot of guys that would show this romantic side of themselves.', '2003-06-18 22:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(330390, 24818, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  It''s demented man.  I didn''t know they let cameras in insane asylums.  Very dramatic shot.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol.  It''s demented man.  I didn''t know they let cameras in insane asylums.  Very dramatic shot.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-18 22:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(330392, 24887, 2011, '<td valign="top">You are so BRAVE.  ANd I mean that in the best damn way.  This is great.</td>', 'You are so BRAVE.  ANd I mean that in the best damn way.  This is great.', '2003-06-18 22:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(330393, 24800, 6202, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, thanks for letting all us women dream a little...nice bracelet by the way =o) You''re  a 10....ooops I mean the photos a 10.  Now can ya do an encore for the black on black challenge afterall this is one fantastic low key image.</td>', 'Fantastic shot, thanks for letting all us women dream a little...nice bracelet by the way =o) You''re  a 10....ooops I mean the photos a 10.  Now can ya do an encore for the black on black challenge afterall this is one fantastic low key image.', '2003-06-18 22:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(330395, 25269, 7556, '<td valign="top">nice silhouette...</td>', 'nice silhouette...', '2003-06-18 22:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(330396, 25290, 2716, '<td valign="top">OMG.  I laughed and laughed and laughed and laughed.   lol.  Ah man ...  you know what .   10      Jacko.  :) thanks man, I needed that</td>', 'OMG.  I laughed and laughed and laughed and laughed.   lol.  Ah man ...  you know what .   10      Jacko.  :) thanks man, I needed that', '2003-06-18 22:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330397, 24889, 6202, '<td valign="top">Great title and ain''t it the truth!</td>', 'Great title and ain''t it the truth!', '2003-06-18 22:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330399, 25217, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>Interesting Do.  Makes me want to see more.  Actually I just caught myself scrolling the mouse up and down to see if there was more.  LoL.  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Hi,Interesting Do.  Makes me want to see more.  Actually I just caught myself scrolling the mouse up and down to see if there was more.  LoL.  Nice lighting.', '2003-06-18 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330402, 25258, 1280, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it''s not very clear.</td>', 'Unfortunately it''s not very clear.', '2003-06-18 22:46:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(330403, 24684, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello DPCer,<br/>I like the way your ''real'' hand in the photo seems to tie the photgrapher in with the two images.  I think this is a great idea for a photo.  I''ll have to try and remember it.  If I were to nit-pick, I would say that this one is cropped slightly too narrow.  Maybe more along the lines of the Golden ratio.</td>', 'Hello DPCer,I like the way your ''real'' hand in the photo seems to tie the photgrapher in with the two images.  I think this is a great idea for a photo.  I''ll have to try and remember it.  If I were to nit-pick, I would say that this one is cropped slightly too narrow.  Maybe more along the lines of the Golden ratio.', '2003-06-18 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330406, 25275, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Your little girl seems to be touching the landscape as if in wonderment! (I''m assuming that the adult is the one who submitted the picture!) Good composition but the board takes up a lot of room ... might have been better to use a tripod if you have one.</td>', 'Nice photo. Your little girl seems to be touching the landscape as if in wonderment! (I''m assuming that the adult is the one who submitted the picture!) Good composition but the board takes up a lot of room ... might have been better to use a tripod if you have one.', '2003-06-18 22:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(330408, 25202, 6284, '<td valign="top">You spoiled a beautiful photo with those teeth</td>', 'You spoiled a beautiful photo with those teeth', '2003-06-18 22:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(330409, 24889, 6284, '<td valign="top">LOL aint that the truth!</td>', 'LOL aint that the truth!', '2003-06-18 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(330411, 25229, 1280, '<td valign="top">No detail.  Interesting but not really a portrait.</td>', 'No detail.  Interesting but not really a portrait.', '2003-06-18 23:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330413, 25257, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi There,<br/>I just came back from a walk in the park.  =o)  This in a nice serene image.  Great texture.  I feel almost drawn in with the desire to walk around and have a look at your face.  Great Colout.  I like the off center subject.  Very appealing and so is the Photo.  =o)</td>', 'Hi There,I just came back from a walk in the park.  =o)  This in a nice serene image.  Great texture.  I feel almost drawn in with the desire to walk around and have a look at your face.  Great Colout.  I like the off center subject.  Very appealing and so is the Photo.  =o)', '2003-06-18 23:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(330414, 25059, 3080, '<td valign="top">Too much noise for my personal liking.  Realizing you were trying to make this cartoonish, but i''d probably prefer just a regular "un noisy" version.  Also, the background doesn''t help much.  Nice rendition of silver surfer though.    Love the board. :)</td>', 'Too much noise for my personal liking.  Realizing you were trying to make this cartoonish, but i''d probably prefer just a regular "un noisy" version.  Also, the background doesn''t help much.  Nice rendition of silver surfer though.    Love the board. :)', '2003-06-18 23:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330415, 25047, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good clear photo but too bright in my opinion.</td>', 'Good clear photo but too bright in my opinion.', '2003-06-18 23:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(330416, 24964, 1280, '<td valign="top">good job.  Vg bg.</td>', 'good job.  Vg bg.', '2003-06-18 23:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(330417, 25229, 6100, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept for a self-portrait. I like the lighting in the background --- can''t judge the portrait lighting, though.</td>', 'Interesting concept for a self-portrait. I like the lighting in the background --- can''t judge the portrait lighting, though.', '2003-06-18 23:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330418, 25307, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job!  Good pose, good lighting, good bg.</td>', 'Beautiful job!  Good pose, good lighting, good bg.', '2003-06-18 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(330419, 24718, 3080, '<td valign="top">It''s a different take on the challenge.  I can appreciate that.  I do with that we could see this a bit better though. it''s a little small.  Focus is good though from what I can tell, on both pics.  I do not like the shadow created by your hand.  You can help reduce that by moving a bit away from the wall, and not using harsh lighting.  Probably flash?  Anyway, nice to meet you.</td>', 'It''s a different take on the challenge.  I can appreciate that.  I do with that we could see this a bit better though. it''s a little small.  Focus is good though from what I can tell, on both pics.  I do not like the shadow created by your hand.  You can help reduce that by moving a bit away from the wall, and not using harsh lighting.  Probably flash?  Anyway, nice to meet you.', '2003-06-18 23:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330421, 25199, 7510, '<td valign="top">Greetings DPCer,<br/>This one looks like some famous musician.  Like something you might see on a CD cover.  Nice texture.  Hmm  The first one so far that I feel is beyond my ability to critique.  10</td>', 'Greetings DPCer,This one looks like some famous musician.  Like something you might see on a CD cover.  Nice texture.  Hmm  The first one so far that I feel is beyond my ability to critique.  10', '2003-06-18 23:09:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(330422, 24625, 6100, '<td valign="top">Good detail and DOF. I think the face comes up too light which blocks detail but it''s still a very good job.</td>', 'Good detail and DOF. I think the face comes up too light which blocks detail but it''s still a very good job.', '2003-06-18 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330424, 24843, 1280, '<td valign="top">I wish there was a bit of detail.  It''s very dark. Good moodiness though.<br/></td>', 'I wish there was a bit of detail.  It''s very dark. Good moodiness though.', '2003-06-18 23:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(330426, 25207, 6100, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. The type of "portrait lighting" you''ve used here is known as "horror lighting" --- the nose shadow projecting upward --- and is rarely used. It DID, however, show off your eyes to a nice advantage.</td>', 'Interesting concept. The type of "portrait lighting" you''ve used here is known as "horror lighting" --- the nose shadow projecting upward --- and is rarely used. It DID, however, show off your eyes to a nice advantage.', '2003-06-18 23:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(330429, 25055, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hey,<br/>Interesting B/W shot.  I think that the contrast on this one is a too high, but it seems like that is what you were trying to do.  A lot of the image is lost in this one, and parts like your shoulder are washed out.</td>', 'Hey,Interesting B/W shot.  I think that the contrast on this one is a too high, but it seems like that is what you were trying to do.  A lot of the image is lost in this one, and parts like your shoulder are washed out.', '2003-06-18 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330430, 25235, 6100, '<td valign="top">The lighting is excellent! I would still like to see some detail in the face though.</td>', 'The lighting is excellent! I would still like to see some detail in the face though.', '2003-06-18 23:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(330431, 25162, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good job.  Good focus, and exposure, and bg  I like the head tilt!</td>', 'Very good job.  Good focus, and exposure, and bg  I like the head tilt!', '2003-06-18 23:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330433, 25296, 6100, '<td valign="top">You''ve really used perspective to an advantage here. I think the left side of the picture needs to be toned down some but, in general, the tonal range is very good.</td>', 'You''ve really used perspective to an advantage here. I think the left side of the picture needs to be toned down some but, in general, the tonal range is very good.', '2003-06-18 23:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(330434, 25238, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see this as a portrait....too small to see detail or character.</td>', 'I don''t really see this as a portrait....too small to see detail or character.', '2003-06-18 23:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330435, 24922, 6100, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I think this is a very "calming" picture. Maybe it''s the mountaintop feeling. Nice work!</td>', 'For some reason, I think this is a very "calming" picture. Maybe it''s the mountaintop feeling. Nice work!', '2003-06-18 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330436, 25101, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hey man,<br/>Interesting Idea.  Is that you in the three Photos?  I get the impression the the person in the photos and the person wearing the pants aren''t the same.  The jeans, the belt, and even the shirt seem very feminine.  I can''t image the guy in the photo wearing a red shirt like that.<br/>Anyway.  I like the lighting, especially the highlights on the belt.  Nice crop.  I like the flow of the lines.</td>', 'Hey man,Interesting Idea.  Is that you in the three Photos?  I get the impression the the person in the photos and the person wearing the pants aren''t the same.  The jeans, the belt, and even the shirt seem very feminine.  I can''t image the guy in the photo wearing a red shirt like that.Anyway.  I like the lighting, especially the highlights on the belt.  Nice crop.  I like the flow of the lines.', '2003-06-18 23:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330437, 25269, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice sillhouette and good exposure. Lucky you to be in such a beautiful setting!</td>', 'Nice sillhouette and good exposure. Lucky you to be in such a beautiful setting!', '2003-06-18 23:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(330440, 25296, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hi,<br/>A full moon out tonight.  Technically good.  I liked the angle of this shot. Nice Highlights and shadows.  They really give the photo depth.  But personally this one doesn''t do it for me.  I''m not really into the whole naked photo thing.</td>', 'Hi,A full moon out tonight.  Technically good.  I liked the angle of this shot. Nice Highlights and shadows.  They really give the photo depth.  But personally this one doesn''t do it for me.  I''m not really into the whole naked photo thing.', '2003-06-18 23:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(330441, 24683, 6100, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit off and I''d like to see something show up as either a pure white or almost white rather than just having black and gray tones. Good concept for a self-portrait, though.</td>', 'Focus is a bit off and I''d like to see something show up as either a pure white or almost white rather than just having black and gray tones. Good concept for a self-portrait, though.', '2003-06-18 23:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(330442, 25284, 1280, '<td valign="top">quite creative!!!</td>', 'quite creative!!!', '2003-06-18 23:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(330443, 24709, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent positioning to capture the character in the face! Good composition.</td>', 'Excellent positioning to capture the character in the face! Good composition.', '2003-06-18 23:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330444, 25092, 1280, '<td valign="top">very creative work.<br/></td>', 'very creative work.', '2003-06-18 23:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330446, 25094, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is reminicent of the work of Yoshuf Karsh. You''ve captured a beautiful range of skin tones while keeping nice highlights and shadows. Excellent!</td>', 'This is reminicent of the work of Yoshuf Karsh. You''ve captured a beautiful range of skin tones while keeping nice highlights and shadows. Excellent!', '2003-06-18 23:23:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(330447, 24656, 6100, '<td valign="top">I am so impressed by this photograph. You''ve held the detail in the white while still capturing skin details! I AM impressed.</td>', 'I am so impressed by this photograph. You''ve held the detail in the white while still capturing skin details! I AM impressed.', '2003-06-18 23:25:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(330448, 25213, 6100, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft.</td>', 'Focus is too soft.', '2003-06-18 23:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(330449, 24837, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job.  Interesting angle.</td>', 'Good job.  Interesting angle.', '2003-06-18 23:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(330450, 25236, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouette</td>', 'Excellent silhouette', '2003-06-18 23:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330452, 25196, 1280, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2003-06-18 23:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330456, 25247, 7510, '<td valign="top">Oh Hey there,<br/>Ahhh!  I see.  Now it makes more sense.  I saw the "Holding Him" photo quite a while ago.  (I''m slow)  Too bad your two photos can''t be linked during Voting.  I wonder if both photos will recieve the same score.  Don''t take this personally, but I think the "Holding Him" photo will score higher, because I find her more attractive than you.  =o)<br/>That aside.  I guess this comment is more of an add on to the other comment.  Well if I was picky, I''d say that there aren''t as many flowers pointed toward the Camera in this shot.  The extra green camouflages them against the background.  A shorter DoF might have helped with that a bit, or a different background.  Althought I see that you want to keep the flowers in the frame and still have the same aspect ratio, I would have tried to center the two of you more, with your face off center.</td>', 'Oh Hey there,Ahhh!  I see.  Now it makes more sense.  I saw the "Holding Him" photo quite a while ago.  (I''m slow)  Too bad your two photos can''t be linked during Voting.  I wonder if both photos will recieve the same score.  Don''t take this personally, but I think the "Holding Him" photo will score higher, because I find her more attractive than you.  =o)That aside.  I guess this comment is more of an add on to the other comment.  Well if I was picky, I''d say that there aren''t as many flowers pointed toward the Camera in this shot.  The extra green camouflages them against the background.  A shorter DoF might have helped with that a bit, or a different background.  Althought I see that you want to keep the flowers in the frame and still have the same aspect ratio, I would have tried to center the two of you more, with your face off center.', '2003-06-18 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(330457, 24801, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very good the way the black suit blends into the bg.</td>', 'Very good the way the black suit blends into the bg.', '2003-06-18 23:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(330460, 24682, 9363, '<td valign="top">would have loved for the focus to have been on your eye instead ofyour nose, great shot though...</td>', 'would have loved for the focus to have been on your eye instead ofyour nose, great shot though...', '2003-06-18 23:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(330461, 25184, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice shadow pic, but not really a portrait.</td>', 'Nice shadow pic, but not really a portrait.', '2003-06-18 23:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(330462, 25226, 6100, '<td valign="top">This is a very sexy pose. Shows off both "backgrounds"! Your choice of location is very good. I would think this might show better in a vertical format especially if you leave more room above your head. Focus is a little soft but is not distracting.</td>', 'This is a very sexy pose. Shows off both "backgrounds"! Your choice of location is very good. I would think this might show better in a vertical format especially if you leave more room above your head. Focus is a little soft but is not distracting.', '2003-06-18 23:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(330464, 25140, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow...interesting pic.  Not a portrait though</td>', 'Wow...interesting pic.  Not a portrait though', '2003-06-18 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(330465, 25261, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good job!</td>', 'Good job!', '2003-06-18 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330468, 25034, 6100, '<td valign="top">Excellent skin tones capturing the full range from light to dark! I like that the eye on the right of the photo still has a catchlight.</td>', 'Excellent skin tones capturing the full range from light to dark! I like that the eye on the right of the photo still has a catchlight.', '2003-06-18 23:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
