(330721, 25199, 7920, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting in this one.  I prefer this to those in which you cannot see half of the face at all.  Handsome model.</td>', 'I like the lighting in this one.  I prefer this to those in which you cannot see half of the face at all.  Handsome model.', '2003-06-19 02:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(330722, 25119, 8953, '<td valign="top">clever shot! one of my favorites. the dust on the lens is a little distracting but over all I like</td>', 'clever shot! one of my favorites. the dust on the lens is a little distracting but over all I like', '2003-06-19 02:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(330724, 25020, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the caricature here. Very good idea. I hope you didn''t hurt yourself uprighting the bike.  Photographically, I wish you had waited to shoot this picture on a day without such harsh lighting. Your face is too blown out and lacks detail, where we need it most, and the bottom of the picture is way too dark.</td>', 'I like the caricature here. Very good idea. I hope you didn''t hurt yourself uprighting the bike.  Photographically, I wish you had waited to shoot this picture on a day without such harsh lighting. Your face is too blown out and lacks detail, where we need it most, and the bottom of the picture is way too dark.', '2003-06-19 02:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(330725, 24811, 7920, '<td valign="top">Nice colors. Very pretty.</td>', 'Nice colors. Very pretty.', '2003-06-19 02:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330726, 25110, 8953, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast and depth that comes with it</td>', 'I like the contrast and depth that comes with it', '2003-06-19 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(330728, 24633, 8953, '<td valign="top">black and white would have been a nice touch to a great shot</td>', 'black and white would have been a nice touch to a great shot', '2003-06-19 02:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(330730, 25262, 8953, '<td valign="top">You must have set the automatic shutter on this to "wait til were all asleep" it is a fun shot thanks!</td>', 'You must have set the automatic shutter on this to "wait til were all asleep" it is a fun shot thanks!', '2003-06-19 02:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(330731, 24791, 7920, '<td valign="top">I''m a geneticist (with an undergrad degree related to neurology), so I''m partial...but this is definitely my favorite.  Very creative, thought provoking, striking contrast, perfect focus!  10!!</td>', 'I''m a geneticist (with an undergrad degree related to neurology), so I''m partial...but this is definitely my favorite.  Very creative, thought provoking, striking contrast, perfect focus!  10!!', '2003-06-19 02:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(330732, 25092, 8953, '<td valign="top">different...different is good</td>', 'different...different is good', '2003-06-19 02:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(330733, 25192, 7920, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. The mirror worked very, very well for you.  9  =)</td>', 'Beautiful photo. The mirror worked very, very well for you.  9  =)', '2003-06-19 02:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330735, 25074, 8953, '<td valign="top">your title helps me get there. Thanks</td>', 'your title helps me get there. Thanks', '2003-06-19 02:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(330737, 25199, 8953, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...I like the mood it portrays <br/></td>', 'Nice shot...I like the mood it portrays ', '2003-06-19 02:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(330739, 25261, 6405, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait,I would like it sharper more 9 from me!</td>', 'Nice portrait,I would like it sharper more 9 from me!', '2003-06-19 02:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(330740, 24569, 8953, '<td valign="top">Bazaar...but I Like</td>', 'Bazaar...but I Like', '2003-06-19 02:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(330742, 25290, 7920, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty crazy. (And I can appreciate that.)</td>', 'That''s pretty crazy. (And I can appreciate that.)', '2003-06-19 02:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(330743, 25075, 8953, '<td valign="top">nice use of depth of field</td>', 'nice use of depth of field', '2003-06-19 02:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(330744, 24767, 8953, '<td valign="top">nice lighting...helps set the mood</td>', 'nice lighting...helps set the mood', '2003-06-19 02:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(330745, 24824, 8953, '<td valign="top">would have liked more if the shatter was real</td>', 'would have liked more if the shatter was real', '2003-06-19 02:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(330746, 25136, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but probably for the wrong reason. The buildings and setting is absolutely beautiful and very interesting to look at but completely overwhelms you to the point where I would think this to be a shot taken by  tourist aiming more to cature the setting. But you should be the main event in a portrait. Tones are very pleasing to look at, but you get lost and blend in to the point of becoming part of the background. Also, you needed to rotate this picture as it appears to be leaning right.  BTW...is "Back to the Old Days" the name of a magazine?</td>', 'I love this shot, but probably for the wrong reason. The buildings and setting is absolutely beautiful and very interesting to look at but completely overwhelms you to the point where I would think this to be a shot taken by  tourist aiming more to cature the setting. But you should be the main event in a portrait. Tones are very pleasing to look at, but you get lost and blend in to the point of becoming part of the background. Also, you needed to rotate this picture as it appears to be leaning right.  BTW...is "Back to the Old Days" the name of a magazine?', '2003-06-19 02:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(330747, 24763, 7920, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful landscape.  Very cool composition.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful landscape.  Very cool composition.', '2003-06-19 02:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330748, 25257, 8953, '<td valign="top">the hint of knee is distracting....no just kidding. I like the concept thanks</td>', 'the hint of knee is distracting....no just kidding. I like the concept thanks', '2003-06-19 02:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(330750, 24577, 8953, '<td valign="top">to the soul  thanks</td>', 'to the soul  thanks', '2003-06-19 02:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(330753, 24828, 8953, '<td valign="top">I can almost see the fear. nice idea</td>', 'I can almost see the fear. nice idea', '2003-06-19 02:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330755, 25188, 8953, '<td valign="top">how about we shake with our left hands instead.</td>', 'how about we shake with our left hands instead.', '2003-06-19 02:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(330756, 24980, 5822, '<td valign="top">Such a pretty face needs more detail. Lighting is way too bright. Also, smudge or scratch on right sided glasses is distracting.</td>', 'Such a pretty face needs more detail. Lighting is way too bright. Also, smudge or scratch on right sided glasses is distracting.', '2003-06-19 02:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(330757, 25133, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like very much the light here and subject to the left... good work!</td>', 'I like very much the light here and subject to the left... good work!', '2003-06-19 02:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(330761, 25176, 5822, '<td valign="top">Is this a color cast that you intentionally left in or did you color the photo that way? Also, focus could be sharper. I love your delicate features.</td>', 'Is this a color cast that you intentionally left in or did you color the photo that way? Also, focus could be sharper. I love your delicate features.', '2003-06-19 02:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(330763, 24693, 8953, '<td valign="top">Nice detail</td>', 'Nice detail', '2003-06-19 02:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(330765, 24906, 8953, '<td valign="top">maybe a flash?</td>', 'maybe a flash?', '2003-06-19 02:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330766, 24981, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones in this photo. Nice angle, IMO just a little too much light on your face. It looks a little blown out. In my top 3 for the week.</td>', 'Very nice tones in this photo. Nice angle, IMO just a little too much light on your face. It looks a little blown out. In my top 3 for the week.', '2003-06-19 02:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(330767, 24818, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very comical. Expression is great, lighting is great. Almost looks fake to me. In my top 3 for the week.</td>', 'Very comical. Expression is great, lighting is great. Almost looks fake to me. In my top 3 for the week.', '2003-06-19 02:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(330769, 24800, 8953, '<td valign="top">works for me...nice shot. I like your use of light and shadow</td>', 'works for me...nice shot. I like your use of light and shadow', '2003-06-19 02:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(330771, 24894, 2279, '<td valign="top">Very creative and you matched it up just right. Looks like you could use a little more light on your face but since im such a sucker for B&amp;W and sepia I won''t change my score.</td>', 'Very creative and you matched it up just right. Looks like you could use a little more light on your face but since im such a sucker for B&W and sepia I won''t change my score.', '2003-06-19 02:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(330774, 25272, 2279, '<td valign="top">Love the frame. Nice lighting, nice pose, and nice model.</td>', 'Love the frame. Nice lighting, nice pose, and nice model.', '2003-06-19 02:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(330775, 25270, 2279, '<td valign="top">Such intense hair and eyes. I think a dark red shirt would have been a better choice since its the brightest thing in the photo and it distracts from the main focal point of your face. Good overall shot though.</td>', 'Such intense hair and eyes. I think a dark red shirt would have been a better choice since its the brightest thing in the photo and it distracts from the main focal point of your face. Good overall shot though.', '2003-06-19 02:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(330776, 25212, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really great idea and a very well executed photo but to me its just not a self portrait so I gotta minus some points for that.</td>', 'This is a really great idea and a very well executed photo but to me its just not a self portrait so I gotta minus some points for that.', '2003-06-19 02:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(330777, 25058, 5822, '<td valign="top">Even with the cheap looking background,  the harsh lighting, and  the disgusting colors, there is something very compelling about this image.  Maybe it''s your pose and cute face that does it.</td>', 'Even with the cheap looking background,  the harsh lighting, and  the disgusting colors, there is something very compelling about this image.  Maybe it''s your pose and cute face that does it.', '2003-06-19 02:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(330778, 25257, 2279, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot but I wish I could see either more of you or maybe more of what you are looking at.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot but I wish I could see either more of you or maybe more of what you are looking at.', '2003-06-19 02:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(330779, 24661, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice shot John. Seems you have this thing for your bathroom. Im wondering if thats really a window behind your head? Almost looks like something is hanging there to block the light. Great shot though and love the book. I have a bunch of stuff by him.</td>', 'Nice shot John. Seems you have this thing for your bathroom. Im wondering if thats really a window behind your head? Almost looks like something is hanging there to block the light. Great shot though and love the book. I have a bunch of stuff by him.', '2003-06-19 02:58:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(330780, 25199, 2279, '<td valign="top">Nice. Very simple but with great lighting and this definately shows character. Looks like a well dressed, well groomed man with purpose in his life. Good shot.</td>', 'Nice. Very simple but with great lighting and this definately shows character. Looks like a well dressed, well groomed man with purpose in his life. Good shot.', '2003-06-19 02:59:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(330783, 25057, 2279, '<td valign="top">You know I always feel like I need to comment on the photos I rate towards the bottom and this ones down there because its NOT A SELF PORTRAIT. Happy shooting.</td>', 'You know I always feel like I need to comment on the photos I rate towards the bottom and this ones down there because its NOT A SELF PORTRAIT. Happy shooting.', '2003-06-19 03:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330784, 25286, 2279, '<td valign="top">Im assuming that you hit the timer and ran around the parking structure before the timer finished but at least you could have stopped and at least been in focus for the shot.</td>', 'Im assuming that you hit the timer and ran around the parking structure before the timer finished but at least you could have stopped and at least been in focus for the shot.', '2003-06-19 03:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(330786, 25050, 2279, '<td valign="top">I guess technically this is a self portrait but all this says to me is a crooked building at night with a strange blur towards the bottom which resembles a person walking by the camera during a slow shutter speed.</td>', 'I guess technically this is a self portrait but all this says to me is a crooked building at night with a strange blur towards the bottom which resembles a person walking by the camera during a slow shutter speed.', '2003-06-19 03:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(330789, 24737, 2279, '<td valign="top">Im looking and looking but I can''t see you in this photo anywhere. This just doesn''t look like a self portrait to me.</td>', 'Im looking and looking but I can''t see you in this photo anywhere. This just doesn''t look like a self portrait to me.', '2003-06-19 03:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(330791, 24624, 2279, '<td valign="top">This isnt a picture of you, its a picture of your shadow.</td>', 'This isnt a picture of you, its a picture of your shadow.', '2003-06-19 03:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330793, 24709, 7869, '<td valign="top">what a weird expression, do u just wake up? good luck</td>', 'what a weird expression, do u just wake up? good luck', '2003-06-19 03:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(330800, 25258, 5822, '<td valign="top">Way too out of focus</td>', 'Way too out of focus', '2003-06-19 03:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(330801, 25192, 7570, '<td valign="top">Clever use of mirror and reflection. A pretty face too. 8</td>', 'Clever use of mirror and reflection. A pretty face too. 8', '2003-06-19 03:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(330804, 25029, 7570, '<td valign="top">looks like an overly large bird''s nest... hey looks near. where from?</td>', 'looks like an overly large bird''s nest... hey looks near. where from?', '2003-06-19 03:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330806, 25297, 5892, '<td valign="top">I like the message beneath the photo...the idea that the image that you project is different that the real you. The photo has a great sense of flow.</td>', 'I like the message beneath the photo...the idea that the image that you project is different that the real you. The photo has a great sense of flow.', '2003-06-19 03:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(330809, 25276, 5892, '<td valign="top">Everything about this is great. Your eyes are so haunting...the texture of your knee that is pulled into the bottom of the frame...the softness, the simplicity. Great job.</td>', 'Everything about this is great. Your eyes are so haunting...the texture of your knee that is pulled into the bottom of the frame...the softness, the simplicity. Great job.', '2003-06-19 03:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(330810, 24889, 4767, '<td valign="top">LOL - probably most guys DO!  (But they think you don''t notice that that''s what they are looking at!!)</td>', 'LOL - probably most guys DO!  (But they think you don''t notice that that''s what they are looking at!!)', '2003-06-19 03:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(330811, 25290, 5892, '<td valign="top">I love the costume! It would be a great picture if it were even just one of those images!</td>', 'I love the costume! It would be a great picture if it were even just one of those images!', '2003-06-19 03:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(330812, 25037, 5892, '<td valign="top">This picture has stayed with me since I first viewed it yesterday... achingly real. You took a big risk and I commend you. I find the necklace to be distracting though.Good stuff.</td>', 'This picture has stayed with me since I first viewed it yesterday... achingly real. You took a big risk and I commend you. I find the necklace to be distracting though.Good stuff.', '2003-06-19 03:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(330813, 25211, 5892, '<td valign="top">The emotion that comes across, from your face, your hands and the space around you is beautiful. Fantastic picture.</td>', 'The emotion that comes across, from your face, your hands and the space around you is beautiful. Fantastic picture.', '2003-06-19 03:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(330814, 25084, 5892, '<td valign="top">My favorite part of your picture is the way that your shoulders seem to fade into the background. Beautiful eyes, perfect expression. Feels haunting but elegant.</td>', 'My favorite part of your picture is the way that your shoulders seem to fade into the background. Beautiful eyes, perfect expression. Feels haunting but elegant.', '2003-06-19 03:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(330815, 25304, 5822, '<td valign="top">What a lovely face! Even a broken mirror couldn''t mar it. I like the soft tones and lighting here.</td>', 'What a lovely face! Even a broken mirror couldn''t mar it. I like the soft tones and lighting here.', '2003-06-19 03:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(330818, 25288, 5892, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent a lot of time looking at it... and I think that I would like it even better if it were turned 90 degrees to the right (if that makes sense). Regardless, A nice clear, well-lit shot, that really gives me some sense of who you are.</td>', 'I''ve spent a lot of time looking at it... and I think that I would like it even better if it were turned 90 degrees to the right (if that makes sense). Regardless, A nice clear, well-lit shot, that really gives me some sense of who you are.', '2003-06-19 03:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(330820, 25179, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, like the movement in the left arm.</td>', 'Very good photo, like the movement in the left arm.', '2003-06-19 03:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(330821, 25071, 5892, '<td valign="top">Is that fog on the mirror at the bottom? I found it distracting at first, but now I almost feel like it adds to the shot. Nice pic, interesting use of reflection.</td>', 'Is that fog on the mirror at the bottom? I found it distracting at first, but now I almost feel like it adds to the shot. Nice pic, interesting use of reflection.', '2003-06-19 03:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(330822, 25281, 7086, '<td valign="top">Nice image but too bright for my liking.</td>', 'Nice image but too bright for my liking.', '2003-06-19 03:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330823, 25274, 5892, '<td valign="top">You look great to me! I like the angle...</td>', 'You look great to me! I like the angle...', '2003-06-19 03:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330824, 25215, 7086, '<td valign="top">Are you deliberately hiding in the shadows? Possibly a little too much black on the left which could have been cropped</td>', 'Are you deliberately hiding in the shadows? Possibly a little too much black on the left which could have been cropped', '2003-06-19 03:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(330825, 25237, 5892, '<td valign="top">A great twist on the overused eye shot.... your portrait is fresh and original. I wish there were more light on you, but it''s just a personal thing! Good job.</td>', 'A great twist on the overused eye shot.... your portrait is fresh and original. I wish there were more light on you, but it''s just a personal thing! Good job.', '2003-06-19 03:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(330826, 24684, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, the mirror causes a slight doubling of the reflection which I find off-putting though.</td>', 'Very good idea, the mirror causes a slight doubling of the reflection which I find off-putting though.', '2003-06-19 03:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(330827, 25213, 7086, '<td valign="top">Too much jpeg compression</td>', 'Too much jpeg compression', '2003-06-19 03:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(330829, 24762, 7086, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well. Unfortunately I find the earring too bright and my eye keeps getting drawm to it.</td>', 'The soft focus works well. Unfortunately I find the earring too bright and my eye keeps getting drawm to it.', '2003-06-19 03:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(330830, 24764, 5892, '<td valign="top">where''s your body!?!?!? LOL. Neat shot. Not older, just wiser!</td>', 'where''s your body!?!?!? LOL. Neat shot. Not older, just wiser!', '2003-06-19 03:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(330831, 25181, 7086, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea</td>', 'Very nice idea', '2003-06-19 03:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(330832, 25108, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice mysterious pose.  Beautiful model.  Like the b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice mysterious pose.  Beautiful model.  Like the b&w.', '2003-06-19 03:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(330833, 24980, 7086, '<td valign="top">I like the way the picture is dominated by the glasses, but I don''t like the lack of detail from the overexposure</td>', 'I like the way the picture is dominated by the glasses, but I don''t like the lack of detail from the overexposure', '2003-06-19 03:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330834, 25189, 5822, '<td valign="top">While I do like the grain in the shot, I find the rest of your picture to be unappealing. It''s too dark and this pose has been done too many times before.   The camera and your hands are blown up and enlarged and obscure your interesting looking face. In addition, I find the border to suggest just a snapshot type of picture.</td>', 'While I do like the grain in the shot, I find the rest of your picture to be unappealing. It''s too dark and this pose has been done too many times before.   The camera and your hands are blown up and enlarged and obscure your interesting looking face. In addition, I find the border to suggest just a snapshot type of picture.', '2003-06-19 03:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(330835, 25144, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt.  Just two problems - 1. the section of the door breaks up the line of your back. 2. That light at the top is very distracting.</td>', 'Nice attempt.  Just two problems - 1. the section of the door breaks up the line of your back. 2. That light at the top is very distracting.', '2003-06-19 03:54:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(330836, 24843, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice effect.  One of the more imaginative of this challenge.</td>', 'Very nice effect.  One of the more imaginative of this challenge.', '2003-06-19 03:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(330837, 24769, 5822, '<td valign="top">Focus is lacking and I don''t like the "in your face" shot.  Also, your expression, or lack of one, is not warm and does not match your photo''s title.</td>', 'Focus is lacking and I don''t like the "in your face" shot.  Also, your expression, or lack of one, is not warm and does not match your photo''s title.', '2003-06-19 03:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(330838, 24671, 6172, '<td valign="top">The worst part is the pan is covering part of your face.  I like the rest of the photo.</td>', 'The worst part is the pan is covering part of your face.  I like the rest of the photo.', '2003-06-19 03:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(330839, 25269, 5892, '<td valign="top">My housemate walked in just a second ago and said "wow, what a great photo" and I think that just about sums it up. Good job.</td>', 'My housemate walked in just a second ago and said "wow, what a great photo" and I think that just about sums it up. Good job.', '2003-06-19 03:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(330840, 25192, 7086, '<td valign="top">Like the idea, have to quote the title to the wife next time she''s staring in the mirror! Very nicely done &amp; good exposure.</td>', 'Like the idea, have to quote the title to the wife next time she''s staring in the mirror! Very nicely done & good exposure.', '2003-06-19 04:00:21.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(330843, 24887, 5892, '<td valign="top">Not only are you gorgeous, but your portrait is stunning... I love the hair...very creative. The eyes are gripping. Negative space is effective, and creates a simple clean image of who you are. My pic of the competition. 10.</td>', 'Not only are you gorgeous, but your portrait is stunning... I love the hair...very creative. The eyes are gripping. Negative space is effective, and creates a simple clean image of who you are. My pic of the competition. 10.', '2003-06-19 04:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(330844, 25266, 7086, '<td valign="top">I love this, overexposure on the fingers detracts slightly from a great image.</td>', 'I love this, overexposure on the fingers detracts slightly from a great image.', '2003-06-19 04:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(330845, 25305, 5892, '<td valign="top">great title</td>', 'great title', '2003-06-19 04:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(330846, 24718, 7086, '<td valign="top">I''ll give you 5 for the title alone! Well thought out image with good focus and exposure. The only ''fault'' I see is the light reflecting across the photo you''re holding.</td>', 'I''ll give you 5 for the title alone! Well thought out image with good focus and exposure. The only ''fault'' I see is the light reflecting across the photo you''re holding.', '2003-06-19 04:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330847, 24718, 5892, '<td valign="top">I really like your idea...a childhood shot. There may have been more ''artistic'' ways to execute it, but this is a good starting point.</td>', 'I really like your idea...a childhood shot. There may have been more ''artistic'' ways to execute it, but this is a good starting point.', '2003-06-19 04:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(330848, 25237, 5822, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this to be an abstract at all.  I think that your eye is more interesting than your nose here, yet it''s in darkenss and the uninteresting nose is more illuminated.</td>', 'I don''t find this to be an abstract at all.  I think that your eye is more interesting than your nose here, yet it''s in darkenss and the uninteresting nose is more illuminated.', '2003-06-19 04:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(330849, 25066, 5892, '<td valign="top">ohh... creepy looking! I like it. Cute idea.</td>', 'ohh... creepy looking! I like it. Cute idea.', '2003-06-19 04:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(330850, 24894, 5892, '<td valign="top">This is just amazing... I''d love to see a ''how''d they do that'' after the competition because I can''t even imagine how hard it was to match up perfectly like that.... fantastic shot, and top marks for originality.</td>', 'This is just amazing... I''d love to see a ''how''d they do that'' after the competition because I can''t even imagine how hard it was to match up perfectly like that.... fantastic shot, and top marks for originality.', '2003-06-19 04:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
