(330853, 25043, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit too strong here and I''m not sure I like your expression either.  I think dramatic lighting would have worked better here especially if you had brought attention to your hand covering your face and your eye instead of a wash of very bright light illuminating everything in the picture.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit too strong here and I''m not sure I like your expression either.  I think dramatic lighting would have worked better here especially if you had brought attention to your hand covering your face and your eye instead of a wash of very bright light illuminating everything in the picture.', '2003-06-19 04:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
