(330859, 24625, 5792, '<td valign="top">A self-portrait shows how you want to be percieved by others. This duotone is creative and interestingly composed. You purposely overexposed your face but give proper contrast to your hair. It makes the viewer curious about who you really are.</td>', 'A self-portrait shows how you want to be percieved by others. This duotone is creative and interestingly composed. You purposely overexposed your face but give proper contrast to your hair. It makes the viewer curious about who you really are.', '2003-06-19 04:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
