(330862, 24887, 5792, '<td valign="top">Interesting self-portrait. Nice duotone and I like how you kept color in the eyes. That is a nice touch. Nice use of the ROT and good technical quality. This also revels that you don''t take yourself too seriously</td>', 'Interesting self-portrait. Nice duotone and I like how you kept color in the eyes. That is a nice touch. Nice use of the ROT and good technical quality. This also revels that you don''t take yourself too seriously', '2003-06-19 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
