(331001, 25164, 7086, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on why but I really like this pic. There''s things to be picky about - noise around the neck/shoulders, blown highlights, but it doesn''t matter- it works. 8 (and that''s high for me)</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on why but I really like this pic. There''s things to be picky about - noise around the neck/shoulders, blown highlights, but it doesn''t matter- it works. 8 (and that''s high for me)', '2003-06-19 08:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
