(331007, 25095, 7086, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but unfortunately the image doesn''t hold my attention</td>', 'I like the idea but unfortunately the image doesn''t hold my attention', '2003-06-19 08:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(331009, 25286, 9295, '<td valign="top">This may be a photo of you, but to me, it doesn''t really fit the definition of a portrait.  Even if I weren''t considering that in my rating, the picture as a whole doesn''t do much for me.  It seems out of focus and since the focal point (you) is so small, dark and undefined, there''s not much to look at.</td>', 'This may be a photo of you, but to me, it doesn''t really fit the definition of a portrait.  Even if I weren''t considering that in my rating, the picture as a whole doesn''t do much for me.  It seems out of focus and since the focal point (you) is so small, dark and undefined, there''s not much to look at.', '2003-06-19 08:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(331010, 24644, 9295, '<td valign="top">Looking through the thumbnail gallery, this shot captured my attention.  I like the lighting and the close-up and the thoughtful look of your expression. I wish you had been able to reduce a little more of the glare on your glasses so we could see your eyes better.</td>', 'Looking through the thumbnail gallery, this shot captured my attention.  I like the lighting and the close-up and the thoughtful look of your expression. I wish you had been able to reduce a little more of the glare on your glasses so we could see your eyes better.', '2003-06-19 08:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(331011, 25191, 9295, '<td valign="top">Though it is apparent that you intended to keep yourself in shadow, this seems to be more of a portrait of your camera than of you.</td>', 'Though it is apparent that you intended to keep yourself in shadow, this seems to be more of a portrait of your camera than of you.', '2003-06-19 08:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(331014, 25179, 8533, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the motion of the hanging arm, but otherwise this is a brilliant pic.</td>', 'I don''t like the motion of the hanging arm, but otherwise this is a brilliant pic.', '2003-06-19 08:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(331016, 25234, 7086, '<td valign="top">I feel this image has been over-sold - where''s the grin? :)</td>', 'I feel this image has been over-sold - where''s the grin? :)', '2003-06-19 08:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(331019, 24762, 9295, '<td valign="top">A classic look. When I saw this, I immediately thought of the commissioned paintings of royalty you might see over the fireplace in some elite home. I''m torn on whether I find the softness of the focus a distraction or whether it evokes a romantic feel. Remember the old-time movies when the close-ups of the starlette were slightly out of focus? That''s what this looks like and it''s not altogether a bad technique.</td>', 'A classic look. When I saw this, I immediately thought of the commissioned paintings of royalty you might see over the fireplace in some elite home. I''m torn on whether I find the softness of the focus a distraction or whether it evokes a romantic feel. Remember the old-time movies when the close-ups of the starlette were slightly out of focus? That''s what this looks like and it''s not altogether a bad technique.', '2003-06-19 08:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(331020, 24824, 7086, '<td valign="top">Like the jigsaw one - nice idea but it just doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'Like the jigsaw one - nice idea but it just doesn''t grab me.', '2003-06-19 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(331023, 24894, 9491, '<td valign="top">Cracking idea. Could have been funnier with a vertical split and eyes looking in opposite directions though.</td>', 'Cracking idea. Could have been funnier with a vertical split and eyes looking in opposite directions though.', '2003-06-19 09:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(331024, 25238, 9295, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea. Mirrors are a common tool used in a self-portrait, and this is a unique concept. But it would have been nicer if your camera had a timer or remote so that your picture wasn''t of you taking your picture.</td>', 'Not a bad idea. Mirrors are a common tool used in a self-portrait, and this is a unique concept. But it would have been nicer if your camera had a timer or remote so that your picture wasn''t of you taking your picture.', '2003-06-19 09:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(331027, 24676, 7086, '<td valign="top">Cleverly done - did you consider trying to hide the tripod/camera with your body so it only appeared in your hands in the mirror?</td>', 'Cleverly done - did you consider trying to hide the tripod/camera with your body so it only appeared in your hands in the mirror?', '2003-06-19 09:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(331028, 25253, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is really a cute shot.  I would have preferred lighting that might have eliminated the shadow. It''s a little distracting but other than that, I love it.</td>', 'This is really a cute shot.  I would have preferred lighting that might have eliminated the shadow. It''s a little distracting but other than that, I love it.', '2003-06-19 09:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(331029, 25224, 9295, '<td valign="top">Just a little too dark.</td>', 'Just a little too dark.', '2003-06-19 09:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(331030, 25295, 7086, '<td valign="top">But you''re not a blonde</td>', 'But you''re not a blonde', '2003-06-19 09:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(331031, 24834, 9295, '<td valign="top">No glare on the glasses!  Good for you!</td>', 'No glare on the glasses!  Good for you!', '2003-06-19 09:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(331032, 24889, 7086, '<td valign="top">I''m sure my wife agrees with you</td>', 'I''m sure my wife agrees with you', '2003-06-19 09:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(331033, 25283, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''m no expert, but I personally would have liked a little more light on you. The backdrop seems brighter than the subject. I like that you are a tad off-center in the framing.</td>', 'I''m no expert, but I personally would have liked a little more light on you. The backdrop seems brighter than the subject. I like that you are a tad off-center in the framing.', '2003-06-19 09:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(331034, 24569, 9295, '<td valign="top">Interesting. A little more light on the center shot would have been better I think, but all in all, I like it a lot.</td>', 'Interesting. A little more light on the center shot would have been better I think, but all in all, I like it a lot.', '2003-06-19 09:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(331036, 25086, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is really nice.  It''s a picture that could tell a story.  Where are you? What''s are you looking at? Is there something outside that window or are you daydreaming and the window is merely where your eyes are turned? Are you waiting for a beau, all dressed up with your hat on, ready for a spring picnic? I love pictures that foster the imagination.  This is just lovely.</td>', 'This is really nice.  It''s a picture that could tell a story.  Where are you? What''s are you looking at? Is there something outside that window or are you daydreaming and the window is merely where your eyes are turned? Are you waiting for a beau, all dressed up with your hat on, ready for a spring picnic? I love pictures that foster the imagination.  This is just lovely.', '2003-06-19 09:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(331038, 24656, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is so nicely done, it looks like it could be an advertisement in a magazine. I like your choice of white on white because it makes YOU stand out all the more.</td>', 'This is so nicely done, it looks like it could be an advertisement in a magazine. I like your choice of white on white because it makes YOU stand out all the more.', '2003-06-19 09:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(331039, 25218, 9295, '<td valign="top">I''m told the problem may be my monitor but truly, all I see in this is what looks like it might be an earring. Everything else is so dark, I can barely even see any shape or form.</td>', 'I''m told the problem may be my monitor but truly, all I see in this is what looks like it might be an earring. Everything else is so dark, I can barely even see any shape or form.', '2003-06-19 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(331041, 25202, 9295, '<td valign="top">I know you were going for humor, but had you chosen to make this just a classic portrait, it would have been even better. I love your framing and the lighting. It highlights your hair and the way your bangs fall across your face exposing only one eye is very attractive.  Speaking of your eye, you beautifully captured the color.</td>', 'I know you were going for humor, but had you chosen to make this just a classic portrait, it would have been even better. I love your framing and the lighting. It highlights your hair and the way your bangs fall across your face exposing only one eye is very attractive.  Speaking of your eye, you beautifully captured the color.', '2003-06-19 09:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331042, 24716, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  I think it''s because of the concept, but also the lighting you used. It reminds me of a silent-movie startlette. Could have been centered just a little bit more. There seems to be a bit more space on the left than the right and in a composition shot like this, it''s symmetry is important.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  I think it''s because of the concept, but also the lighting you used. It reminds me of a silent-movie startlette. Could have been centered just a little bit more. There seems to be a bit more space on the left than the right and in a composition shot like this, it''s symmetry is important.', '2003-06-19 09:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(331044, 25309, 9295, '<td valign="top">I would like this more if it your face was just a tad bit brighter. You get lost in the shadows. But I like the close-up framing and your hand on your forehead is a nice touch.</td>', 'I would like this more if it your face was just a tad bit brighter. You get lost in the shadows. But I like the close-up framing and your hand on your forehead is a nice touch.', '2003-06-19 09:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(331046, 25295, 9295, '<td valign="top">In my most humble opinion, a portrait shot should be just a little bit brighter than this.  I try to imagine it as something a family member would want to frame and hang on their wall or display on their desk. A little more brightness would have done you more justice, especially since you have warm eyes.  Show them off.</td>', 'In my most humble opinion, a portrait shot should be just a little bit brighter than this.  I try to imagine it as something a family member would want to frame and hang on their wall or display on their desk. A little more brightness would have done you more justice, especially since you have warm eyes.  Show them off.', '2003-06-19 09:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(331049, 25258, 9295, '<td valign="top">Using mirrors is a fairly common technique for a self-portrait, but the focus is quite soft on this and it''s not quite level.</td>', 'Using mirrors is a fairly common technique for a self-portrait, but the focus is quite soft on this and it''s not quite level.', '2003-06-19 09:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
