(331177, 24671, 6870, '<td valign="top">You tell me the restaurant--I''m coming! Very nice work here. I think the photo is very true to itself. The lighting, focus and pose/composition all work well together to reveal you. 9</td>', 'You tell me the restaurant--I''m coming! Very nice work here. I think the photo is very true to itself. The lighting, focus and pose/composition all work well together to reveal you. 9', '2003-06-19 12:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
