(331407, 25281, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very creative pose reminiscent from the 30''s and 40''s. I think the lighting may be a bit too strong though. Would prefer to see more detail  and texture of your skin.</td>', 'Very creative pose reminiscent from the 30''s and 40''s. I think the lighting may be a bit too strong though. Would prefer to see more detail  and texture of your skin.', '2003-06-19 14:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331408, 25212, 6565, '<td valign="top">The shoe placement is what makes this work.  It DOES tell me something about you, but not much... frankly, I like the way it''s composed.  Pillows are a bit dark on the couch, but that''s it.</td>', 'The shoe placement is what makes this work.  It DOES tell me something about you, but not much... frankly, I like the way it''s composed.  Pillows are a bit dark on the couch, but that''s it.', '2003-06-19 14:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(331410, 24922, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the expression, and it looks like the wind is blowing.  This photo has a lot of interest in it, from the blurred-out valley to wondering what you might be looking at.  Only concern is that the sky is VERY blown-out, maybe too white.</td>', 'I like the expression, and it looks like the wind is blowing.  This photo has a lot of interest in it, from the blurred-out valley to wondering what you might be looking at.  Only concern is that the sky is VERY blown-out, maybe too white.', '2003-06-19 14:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(331412, 25298, 7436, '<td valign="top">A little soft.  Looking off to the right ... at what?  I want to see.  Perhaps a landscape crop with space to the right... so you''re not so crammed in.  Good attempt.</td>', 'A little soft.  Looking off to the right ... at what?  I want to see.  Perhaps a landscape crop with space to the right... so you''re not so crammed in.  Good attempt.', '2003-06-19 14:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
