(331414, 24633, 6912, '<td valign="top">finally some girls can say DROL DROL DROL!!! Nice idea - 9</td>', 'finally some girls can say DROL DROL DROL!!! Nice idea - 9', '2003-06-19 14:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(331416, 24750, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites. I like the contrast you used to many of the standard black and white shots where black is the dominant color. You did the exact opposite and it is quite a nice effect.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites. I like the contrast you used to many of the standard black and white shots where black is the dominant color. You did the exact opposite and it is quite a nice effect.', '2003-06-19 14:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(331417, 25278, 4224, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of color.  The scuba gear and water are definitely nice.  It''d be kinda nice if the right side of your face wasn''t completely encased in darkness.</td>', 'Interesting use of color.  The scuba gear and water are definitely nice.  It''d be kinda nice if the right side of your face wasn''t completely encased in darkness.', '2003-06-19 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(331419, 24894, 4224, '<td valign="top">Excellent picture, great idea and execution.  Kinda surprised the border of the actual picture isn''t identical to the border of the picture in the picture however :)</td>', 'Excellent picture, great idea and execution.  Kinda surprised the border of the actual picture isn''t identical to the border of the picture in the picture however :)', '2003-06-19 14:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(331421, 25189, 9295, '<td valign="top">Too dark. I can''t make out anything.</td>', 'Too dark. I can''t make out anything.', '2003-06-19 14:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(331422, 24887, 4224, '<td valign="top">The white background combined with your neutral facial expression makes this feel like a rather sterile photograph to me.  Still, the rollers are great, and I like the white space...  I''m just not sure what it''s saying.  And even though the name indicates you''re getting ready, the ''location'' of the picture indicates more of a prepared shot.  Perhaps if there was a mirror or something?  some other prop.  still, I like it :)</td>', 'The white background combined with your neutral facial expression makes this feel like a rather sterile photograph to me.  Still, the rollers are great, and I like the white space...  I''m just not sure what it''s saying.  And even though the name indicates you''re getting ready, the ''location'' of the picture indicates more of a prepared shot.  Perhaps if there was a mirror or something?  some other prop.  still, I like it :)', '2003-06-19 14:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(331424, 25196, 7778, '<td valign="top">What appeals to me about this portrait is the cool lighting, the natural hues and... the title. Particularly because of the title choice, I ''feel'' that I might extract a sense of intent. <br/> <br/>I would have loved to see the subject ''subordinated'' to its environment, i.e. by increasing the focal distance (small figure - expansive greens) to emphasize an order of things. The shot, as is, also feels to me a little ''timid'' with such ''partial'' nudity. I would have preferred a bolder approach, which, considering the (given) integrity of the facial expression, would have made a powerful ''proliferation'' of the title , and one in good taste as well.</td>', 'What appeals to me about this portrait is the cool lighting, the natural hues and... the title. Particularly because of the title choice, I ''feel'' that I might extract a sense of intent.  I would have loved to see the subject ''subordinated'' to its environment, i.e. by increasing the focal distance (small figure - expansive greens) to emphasize an order of things. The shot, as is, also feels to me a little ''timid'' with such ''partial'' nudity. I would have preferred a bolder approach, which, considering the (given) integrity of the facial expression, would have made a powerful ''proliferation'' of the title , and one in good taste as well.', '2003-06-19 14:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(331425, 25272, 4224, '<td valign="top">Great idea with the frame.  I personally think there is a little too much light on your left breast, but it doesn''t detract from the shot much.  Nice facial expression and pose...  well done.  Maybe lose the watch, and I''d like it if the whole background looked how it looks at the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'Great idea with the frame.  I personally think there is a little too much light on your left breast, but it doesn''t detract from the shot much.  Nice facial expression and pose...  well done.  Maybe lose the watch, and I''d like it if the whole background looked how it looks at the bottom of the picture.', '2003-06-19 14:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(331427, 25164, 8860, '<td valign="top">A striking image which says a lot about you, which is what I rate in this challenge - how an image relates to an individual and gives a viewer an insight to the character.</td>', 'A striking image which says a lot about you, which is what I rate in this challenge - how an image relates to an individual and gives a viewer an insight to the character.', '2003-06-19 15:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
