(331577, 24843, 6565, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting here, especially on your face!  The loose wisp of hair adds a lot to the interest of this image, too.  The bottom is SO dark, though, it looks almost all black on my monitor, and I had to lean in to see what I was looking at.  I''m still not sure.</td>', 'I really like the lighting here, especially on your face!  The loose wisp of hair adds a lot to the interest of this image, too.  The bottom is SO dark, though, it looks almost all black on my monitor, and I had to lean in to see what I was looking at.  I''m still not sure.', '2003-06-19 16:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(331579, 24814, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea!  I love how every other reflection looks as though it''s looking in an entirely different direction.  I''d lose the bevel on the right edge, though -- to me it only ruins the magic. :)</td>', 'Very cool idea!  I love how every other reflection looks as though it''s looking in an entirely different direction.  I''d lose the bevel on the right edge, though -- to me it only ruins the magic. :)', '2003-06-19 16:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
