(331584, 25309, 6565, '<td valign="top">The tone of the hair highlights blends perfectly with the light showing through from the background.  Wish the wispy hairs weren''t in the way, though, makes it not frame your face as much as hide it.</td>', 'The tone of the hair highlights blends perfectly with the light showing through from the background.  Wish the wispy hairs weren''t in the way, though, makes it not frame your face as much as hide it.', '2003-06-19 16:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
