(331619, 24981, 7242, '<td valign="top">Very cool lines and angles. Nice work.</td>', 'Very cool lines and angles. Nice work.', '2003-06-19 17:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(331620, 24882, 7242, '<td valign="top">Love it! The best in the challenge, IMO. 10</td>', 'Love it! The best in the challenge, IMO. 10', '2003-06-19 17:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(331628, 24746, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi there, this is David (Levin), right?  I like how your face is to one side of the photo.  I think the pict might be better if you hadn''t cropped off your one ear.  Also, you need to focus more on the eyes, and, if possible, make them more prominent - you have beautiful eyes, but they''re not showing enough.  Another thing is that the background, even though blurry, competes for attention with your face.  ~6</td>', 'Hi there, this is David (Levin), right?  I like how your face is to one side of the photo.  I think the pict might be better if you hadn''t cropped off your one ear.  Also, you need to focus more on the eyes, and, if possible, make them more prominent - you have beautiful eyes, but they''re not showing enough.  Another thing is that the background, even though blurry, competes for attention with your face.  ~6', '2003-06-19 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(331629, 24650, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice, I like the flowers in your hand.  ~7</td>', 'Nice, I like the flowers in your hand.  ~7', '2003-06-19 17:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(331630, 24847, 5112, '<td valign="top">Is this Sonya?  Love the scarf!  The greys of the skin are very beautiful.  You look like you have a dancer''s posture.  ~9</td>', 'Is this Sonya?  Love the scarf!  The greys of the skin are very beautiful.  You look like you have a dancer''s posture.  ~9', '2003-06-19 17:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(331632, 25281, 5112, '<td valign="top">You don''t look "old" to me at all!  Very nice!</td>', 'You don''t look "old" to me at all!  Very nice!', '2003-06-19 17:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(331634, 25104, 8178, '<td valign="top">Beautiful expression on a beautiful face.  I like the cropping, you allowed room for the viewer to follow the direction of the eyes. The wood in the background is a little distracting. This would look really nice with a white or grey backdrop, or just a blurred background.</td>', 'Beautiful expression on a beautiful face.  I like the cropping, you allowed room for the viewer to follow the direction of the eyes. The wood in the background is a little distracting. This would look really nice with a white or grey backdrop, or just a blurred background.', '2003-06-19 17:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(331637, 25226, 9427, '<td valign="top">captured my attention.</td>', 'captured my attention.', '2003-06-19 17:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(331638, 24887, 8178, '<td valign="top">I am not sure why you cropped it the way you did. I am guessing, it was to make the composition more interesting. I would turn your head and look to the right a little instead of into the camera. That way, the viewer will follow the direction of your eyes and your cropping will be justified. What do you think?</td>', 'I am not sure why you cropped it the way you did. I am guessing, it was to make the composition more interesting. I would turn your head and look to the right a little instead of into the camera. That way, the viewer will follow the direction of your eyes and your cropping will be justified. What do you think?', '2003-06-19 17:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(331639, 24964, 9493, '<td valign="top">what os that in the backroundis it a leaf?  very nice lighting</td>', 'what os that in the backroundis it a leaf?  very nice lighting', '2003-06-19 17:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(331640, 25281, 9427, '<td valign="top">a classic....nice</td>', 'a classic....nice', '2003-06-19 17:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(331642, 24989, 8178, '<td valign="top">Hot guy, lucky me!</td>', 'Hot guy, lucky me!', '2003-06-19 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(331643, 25075, 5994, '<td valign="top">Creative angle, warm and bright, and an appealing depth of field.  Cheers!</td>', 'Creative angle, warm and bright, and an appealing depth of field.  Cheers!', '2003-06-19 17:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(331644, 25178, 9493, '<td valign="top">i  really like that hat,  nice creativity  9</td>', 'i  really like that hat,  nice creativity  9', '2003-06-19 17:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(331645, 25179, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi there.  You wouldn''t have a brother who wants to be a carpenter, eh?  I like it how you got your face really nice and clear, and in the light, in this photo.  I like the tone on your face and hair, and the white of the t-shirt.  And, in particular, I like it how this picture shows not only what you look like, but tells something about what you like to do.  Good job!  ~8</td>', 'Hi there.  You wouldn''t have a brother who wants to be a carpenter, eh?  I like it how you got your face really nice and clear, and in the light, in this photo.  I like the tone on your face and hair, and the white of the t-shirt.  And, in particular, I like it how this picture shows not only what you look like, but tells something about what you like to do.  Good job!  ~8', '2003-06-19 17:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(331647, 24625, 5994, '<td valign="top">This is a really warm and appealing shot!  I adore the detail and shine on your curls, but wish more of that detail were available on your face.  Looks like you have freckles; I would love to see more visible freckles!  :-)</td>', 'This is a really warm and appealing shot!  I adore the detail and shine on your curls, but wish more of that detail were available on your face.  Looks like you have freckles; I would love to see more visible freckles!  :-)', '2003-06-19 17:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(331648, 24568, 5112, '<td valign="top">Excellent self-portrait!  My favourite in this challenge.  Nothing to complain about (love the movement in the cigarrillo).  ~10</td>', 'Excellent self-portrait!  My favourite in this challenge.  Nothing to complain about (love the movement in the cigarrillo).  ~10', '2003-06-19 17:44:47.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(331650, 25105, 5112, '<td valign="top">Is this Jodie Coston?  I hope it is, otherwise I\''ll be (kinda) embarrased :)  Good self-portrait, the eyes in particular are really nice.  One of my favourites.</td>', 'Is this Jodie Coston?  I hope it is, otherwise I\''ll be (kinda) embarrased :)  Good self-portrait, the eyes in particular are really nice.  One of my favourites.', '2003-06-19 17:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(331651, 25280, 8756, '<td valign="top">wow!!!  10 for your beautiful eyes...</td>', 'wow!!!  10 for your beautiful eyes...', '2003-06-19 17:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(331654, 25180, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hi!  You look so serious!  I like the way the blue eyes contrast with the orange sweatshirt.  I like it that you are holding some carpenter''s tools, and not just said, "I want to be a carpenter" with no tools.  You did a very good job in focusing on your face.  I think it would have been nice if you could have gotten the leaves (towards the top right) out of the picture.  Good job!  ~7</td>', 'Hi!  You look so serious!  I like the way the blue eyes contrast with the orange sweatshirt.  I like it that you are holding some carpenter''s tools, and not just said, "I want to be a carpenter" with no tools.  You did a very good job in focusing on your face.  I think it would have been nice if you could have gotten the leaves (towards the top right) out of the picture.  Good job!  ~7', '2003-06-19 17:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(331655, 25269, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like this portrait.  ~9</td>', 'Very nice!  I like this portrait.  ~9', '2003-06-19 17:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(331663, 24800, 5994, '<td valign="top">I think this is a perfectly executed photograph - the angle of your torso which extends from the dark toward the light, the simple bright adornment on your wrist that pulls the viewers eye downward, and the truly inspired expression on your face.  (I certainly hope no one is offended by this tasteful display of artistic nudity, because I think they will be overlooking a very well done photograph.)  Cheers.</td>', 'I think this is a perfectly executed photograph - the angle of your torso which extends from the dark toward the light, the simple bright adornment on your wrist that pulls the viewers eye downward, and the truly inspired expression on your face.  (I certainly hope no one is offended by this tasteful display of artistic nudity, because I think they will be overlooking a very well done photograph.)  Cheers.', '2003-06-19 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(331667, 25244, 5994, '<td valign="top">I think this photograph is neat.  It raises the viewers curiosity - what are you looking at offscreen?  What thoughts are you pondering?  The slight smile gives me a relaxed &amp; pleasant feeling.  I also really appreciate the clarity of focus; the texture of your skin in the foreground area is visible and not blurred.  Nice job.</td>', 'I think this photograph is neat.  It raises the viewers curiosity - what are you looking at offscreen?  What thoughts are you pondering?  The slight smile gives me a relaxed & pleasant feeling.  I also really appreciate the clarity of focus; the texture of your skin in the foreground area is visible and not blurred.  Nice job.', '2003-06-19 18:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(331677, 25217, 2716, '<td valign="top">That is awesome.  Great perspective.  made me smile.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'That is awesome.  Great perspective.  made me smile.  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-19 18:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(331682, 25297, 7706, '<td valign="top">Hmm do I know you? lol The shadowing trail is a cool effect. I like how you went for the "all black" look, it just really makes this image work. In a way tis photo reminds me of a movie, like ghost or something, as it does have a ghostly feel, but it works. Well done, and good luck.</td>', 'Hmm do I know you? lol The shadowing trail is a cool effect. I like how you went for the "all black" look, it just really makes this image work. In a way tis photo reminds me of a movie, like ghost or something, as it does have a ghostly feel, but it works. Well done, and good luck.', '2003-06-19 18:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(331683, 25043, 2130, '<td valign="top">24 days until my wedding...I know the feeling :)  great image</td>', '24 days until my wedding...I know the feeling :)  great image', '2003-06-19 18:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(331697, 25296, 5994, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Excellently done.</td>', 'Love it!  Excellently done.', '2003-06-19 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(331703, 24887, 3959, '<td valign="top">great lighting. well done. Grat framing, Funny. Lovely model. One of the best here!! Good job. I hope you win.</td>', 'great lighting. well done. Grat framing, Funny. Lovely model. One of the best here!! Good job. I hope you win.', '2003-06-19 18:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(331735, 25134, 3959, '<td valign="top">You''re a hottie....</td>', 'You''re a hottie....', '2003-06-19 18:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(331739, 25202, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol very hillarious.  beautiful face and great teeth.  who''s your dentist.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'lol very hillarious.  beautiful face and great teeth.  who''s your dentist.  Thanks for the chuckles.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-19 18:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(331742, 25094, 5994, '<td valign="top">Out of every great photo in this challenge, this is the one that immediately struck me as wholly perfect.  The texture of your skin is apparent, yet it has such a soft quality.  A great deal of emotion is expressed through your hands.  The feeling I get is of despair, yet hope.  Exceptionally done, in my opinion.  Cheers!</td>', 'Out of every great photo in this challenge, this is the one that immediately struck me as wholly perfect.  The texture of your skin is apparent, yet it has such a soft quality.  A great deal of emotion is expressed through your hands.  The feeling I get is of despair, yet hope.  Exceptionally done, in my opinion.  Cheers!', '2003-06-19 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(331744, 25176, 6565, '<td valign="top">The red and yellow tones in the lighting are a bit strong for my taste....</td>', 'The red and yellow tones in the lighting are a bit strong for my taste....', '2003-06-19 19:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(331748, 24889, 9051, '<td valign="top">You sure about that?...<br/> <br/>I personaly would rather want to see your face ....but what do I know I´m from freaking Iceland..lol</td>', 'You sure about that?... I personaly would rather want to see your face ....but what do I know I´m from freaking Iceland..lol', '2003-06-19 19:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(331749, 25218, 6565, '<td valign="top">I think this one is just too dark to really work for me.</td>', 'I think this one is just too dark to really work for me.', '2003-06-19 19:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(331751, 25057, 9051, '<td valign="top">Well if thats you in that picture I feel terribly sorry for you my friend<br/>You get a plus for the humour though</td>', 'Well if thats you in that picture I feel terribly sorry for you my friendYou get a plus for the humour though', '2003-06-19 19:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(331752, 24828, 6565, '<td valign="top">It''s the tiniest bit blurry, but I like the journalistic feel of this one.  Timely, too.</td>', 'It''s the tiniest bit blurry, but I like the journalistic feel of this one.  Timely, too.', '2003-06-19 19:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(331753, 25258, 6565, '<td valign="top">The lack of sharpness hurts this pic, I think... and the fact that you''re small enough a part of it to not feel entirely like the "subject" of it.</td>', 'The lack of sharpness hurts this pic, I think... and the fact that you''re small enough a part of it to not feel entirely like the "subject" of it.', '2003-06-19 19:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331755, 24838, 9292, '<td valign="top">Amazing. I´m waiting your tutorial. Congratulations, 10.</td>', 'Amazing. I´m waiting your tutorial. Congratulations, 10.', '2003-06-19 19:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(331760, 25035, 6565, '<td valign="top">Slightly blurry, and there''s not enough contrast between the hair and the background, in my opinion.</td>', 'Slightly blurry, and there''s not enough contrast between the hair and the background, in my opinion.', '2003-06-19 19:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(331761, 25305, 9292, '<td valign="top">Simply perfect. 10 for you.</td>', 'Simply perfect. 10 for you.', '2003-06-19 19:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(331763, 25202, 5994, '<td valign="top">Hee hee, I really do like this, even though the teeth are just ghastly.  I like the clear focus, the warm and vibrant, but not oversaturated, colors...  The way your face and hair fills the entire frame.  The way my focus is drawn to your visible eye.  That eye has such a non-chalant, flippant attitude, I just adore it.  I appreciate your sense of humor in using the ugly teeth.  It''s a surprising and unexpected thing to see on an obviously attractive woman.</td>', 'Hee hee, I really do like this, even though the teeth are just ghastly.  I like the clear focus, the warm and vibrant, but not oversaturated, colors...  The way your face and hair fills the entire frame.  The way my focus is drawn to your visible eye.  That eye has such a non-chalant, flippant attitude, I just adore it.  I appreciate your sense of humor in using the ugly teeth.  It''s a surprising and unexpected thing to see on an obviously attractive woman.', '2003-06-19 19:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(331764, 25293, 6565, '<td valign="top">An unusual take on the assignment!  Interesting, though I''d like to see a more dramatic background, maybe in blue or green.</td>', 'An unusual take on the assignment!  Interesting, though I''d like to see a more dramatic background, maybe in blue or green.', '2003-06-19 19:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(331765, 25084, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the expressiveness, the graininess from the high contrast, and the selective color!  This is a great photo!</td>', 'I love the expressiveness, the graininess from the high contrast, and the selective color!  This is a great photo!', '2003-06-19 19:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(331767, 25257, 9292, '<td valign="top">Congratulations. This is a wonderful photo, light, composition, everuthing. It´s like a painting. You deserve a 10.</td>', 'Congratulations. This is a wonderful photo, light, composition, everuthing. It´s like a painting. You deserve a 10.', '2003-06-19 19:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(331768, 24718, 6565, '<td valign="top">Gotta mark you down unless you actually took the photo in your hand as well.  The image HERE is not all that captivating to me, though the snapshot in your hand I like a lot. :)</td>', 'Gotta mark you down unless you actually took the photo in your hand as well.  The image HERE is not all that captivating to me, though the snapshot in your hand I like a lot. :)', '2003-06-19 19:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(331769, 24762, 6565, '<td valign="top">Blurry, which is a minus, and not enough contrast between the hair and the background, but I like the almost painterly pose.</td>', 'Blurry, which is a minus, and not enough contrast between the hair and the background, but I like the almost painterly pose.', '2003-06-19 19:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(331770, 25101, 2716, '<td valign="top">That is so cool.  Very original.  Don''t know where you come up with this stuff.   a perfect 10.  Jacko.</td>', 'That is so cool.  Very original.  Don''t know where you come up with this stuff.   a perfect 10.  Jacko.', '2003-06-19 19:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331771, 25180, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good composition, I like the defiant pose, too!  This is a self-portrait?  I''m very impressed!</td>', 'Nice colors, good composition, I like the defiant pose, too!  This is a self-portrait?  I''m very impressed!', '2003-06-19 19:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(331776, 25188, 6565, '<td valign="top">Okay, aside from the "EEWWW!" pose, I like this pic.  Might work better in sepia than straight B&amp;W.</td>', 'Okay, aside from the "EEWWW!" pose, I like this pic.  Might work better in sepia than straight B&W.', '2003-06-19 19:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(331778, 25178, 6565, '<td valign="top">Minus for redeye and a flash that''s too strong.  Plus for bravery and originality.</td>', 'Minus for redeye and a flash that''s too strong.  Plus for bravery and originality.', '2003-06-19 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(331783, 24723, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I like the use of the contrast to add even more to an already dynamic composition!  This is awesome!</td>', 'Wow!  I like the use of the contrast to add even more to an already dynamic composition!  This is awesome!', '2003-06-19 19:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(331784, 24764, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very nice, straightforward... not sure about the black shirt on black background, kinda creates this floating-head-in-space effect.  Wonder what the same shot would look like in a white shirt.</td>', 'Very nice, straightforward... not sure about the black shirt on black background, kinda creates this floating-head-in-space effect.  Wonder what the same shot would look like in a white shirt.', '2003-06-19 19:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(331786, 25037, 9051, '<td valign="top">Nice nipple you got there misses;)</td>', 'Nice nipple you got there misses;)', '2003-06-19 19:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(331787, 24818, 5994, '<td valign="top">Ack!  This is just great!  However did I overlook this in the thumbnails??  10+</td>', 'Ack!  This is just great!  However did I overlook this in the thumbnails??  10+', '2003-06-19 19:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(331793, 24887, 7242, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! And gutsy. Don''t think I''d have the nerve to submit one of myself in curlers. LOL</td>', 'Fun shot! And gutsy. Don''t think I''d have the nerve to submit one of myself in curlers. LOL', '2003-06-19 19:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(331802, 25113, 5994, '<td valign="top">I just adore the myriad of ways this photograph tells us about you.  Makes one feel as if they''ve known you forever.  Your sense of humor puts me at ease, and I have a ready smile on my face looking at this!  Really fantastic prints you''ve got there, btw...</td>', 'I just adore the myriad of ways this photograph tells us about you.  Makes one feel as if they''ve known you forever.  Your sense of humor puts me at ease, and I have a ready smile on my face looking at this!  Really fantastic prints you''ve got there, btw...', '2003-06-19 19:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(331812, 25211, 5994, '<td valign="top">Boy I can feel this photo.  I feel just beat!  Nicely done!</td>', 'Boy I can feel this photo.  I feel just beat!  Nicely done!', '2003-06-19 19:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(331818, 25236, 4007, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea of a self-portrait of taking a self portrait.. however, the shadow only choice here is a little too rough for me.  For this style to work well, I think the framing or some other element would need to make the image more interesting.</td>', 'I do like the idea of a self-portrait of taking a self portrait.. however, the shadow only choice here is a little too rough for me.  For this style to work well, I think the framing or some other element would need to make the image more interesting.', '2003-06-19 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(331827, 25303, 9136, '<td valign="top">Funny photo! Great shot.. 9.</td>', 'Funny photo! Great shot.. 9.', '2003-06-19 19:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(331831, 24831, 2780, '<td valign="top">I didn''t know Kieffer Sutherland was a member of DPC! ;) And with Tom Hanks as a pet, that''s quite a fame-filled household</td>', 'I didn''t know Kieffer Sutherland was a member of DPC! ;) And with Tom Hanks as a pet, that''s quite a fame-filled household', '2003-06-19 19:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(331843, 25162, 4007, '<td valign="top">The head tilt seems a little unnatural, and the black shirt has a mixed effect for me.  When the neck is already shadowed a bit (right side) it works nicely, but when it is an abrupt change (left side) it seems awkward.  The capture on the face is very nice, with the lighting and detail working out very well.  I get the feeling that it captures the person well.</td>', 'The head tilt seems a little unnatural, and the black shirt has a mixed effect for me.  When the neck is already shadowed a bit (right side) it works nicely, but when it is an abrupt change (left side) it seems awkward.  The capture on the face is very nice, with the lighting and detail working out very well.  I get the feeling that it captures the person well.', '2003-06-19 20:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(331845, 24889, 3080, '<td valign="top">They are probably looking cause you''re boiling over the sides of your shirt.  I can honestly say that this (as a photo) doesn''t appeal much at all to me.  The shadow from your chin really creates a distraction.  The focus is soft.  You can see this mainly on the shirt, the shirt straps, and in your cleavage.  the light also looks like it''s getting a bit bright on the tops of your boobs, and distracting shadow under your boobs.  I think had this been done in some kind of artistic way at all, it could have been interesting.  Just looks like a quick snap of your boobs and nothing more.</td>', 'They are probably looking cause you''re boiling over the sides of your shirt.  I can honestly say that this (as a photo) doesn''t appeal much at all to me.  The shadow from your chin really creates a distraction.  The focus is soft.  You can see this mainly on the shirt, the shirt straps, and in your cleavage.  the light also looks like it''s getting a bit bright on the tops of your boobs, and distracting shadow under your boobs.  I think had this been done in some kind of artistic way at all, it could have been interesting.  Just looks like a quick snap of your boobs and nothing more.', '2003-06-19 20:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331848, 25309, 4007, '<td valign="top">I really like the framing and the way the hair fills the shot and frames the face.  The colors are a problem here though.  With some better skin tones (I think it needs some better lighting) this would be an excellent shot.</td>', 'I really like the framing and the way the hair fills the shot and frames the face.  The colors are a problem here though.  With some better skin tones (I think it needs some better lighting) this would be an excellent shot.', '2003-06-19 20:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(331849, 25201, 4007, '<td valign="top">I admire the attempt at uniqueness, but the green skin tone (and magenta fringed eye) just don''t seem to serve any function or produce a particularly interesting or visually appealing shot.</td>', 'I admire the attempt at uniqueness, but the green skin tone (and magenta fringed eye) just don''t seem to serve any function or produce a particularly interesting or visually appealing shot.', '2003-06-19 20:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(331850, 25279, 4007, '<td valign="top">A little more clarity on the face would have been nice, but regardless of that (and certainly that would be a challenge given the circumstances) I like this idea a lot, and you produced a unique and enjoyable shot.</td>', 'A little more clarity on the face would have been nice, but regardless of that (and certainly that would be a challenge given the circumstances) I like this idea a lot, and you produced a unique and enjoyable shot.', '2003-06-19 20:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(331851, 24763, 4007, '<td valign="top">The background and foreground, despite the pointing finger, just don''t seem to connect to each other very well.  I feel kinda like I''m looking at the windows xp wallpaper with someone tacked onto the side of it.</td>', 'The background and foreground, despite the pointing finger, just don''t seem to connect to each other very well.  I feel kinda like I''m looking at the windows xp wallpaper with someone tacked onto the side of it.', '2003-06-19 20:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(331854, 25289, 8533, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I find myself intrigued by the blue on your hand.</td>', 'Interesting. I find myself intrigued by the blue on your hand.', '2003-06-19 20:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(331855, 25304, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the way you''ve captured the face here.  The skin tones are wonderful and I really like how those eyes look.  The only thing I''d question here is how the mirror crack lines up.. something just seems off about it, how it follows the bridge of the nose so perfectly and then veers off the face.. I think I''d like if it either continued on down through the mouth or if it didn''t follow the nose so closely in the first place.  That is getting pretty picky though.  I really like the capture here.  Good work. 8</td>', 'I like the way you''ve captured the face here.  The skin tones are wonderful and I really like how those eyes look.  The only thing I''d question here is how the mirror crack lines up.. something just seems off about it, how it follows the bridge of the nose so perfectly and then veers off the face.. I think I''d like if it either continued on down through the mouth or if it didn''t follow the nose so closely in the first place.  That is getting pretty picky though.  I really like the capture here.  Good work. 8', '2003-06-19 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(331856, 25290, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''ll admit, it made me chuckle.. but... there are some obvious problems here.  Nice title though.. it fits the shot.</td>', 'I''ll admit, it made me chuckle.. but... there are some obvious problems here.  Nice title though.. it fits the shot.', '2003-06-19 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(331857, 25043, 6630, '<td valign="top">I wonder.....is are you Claire Danes?????/  ;)</td>', 'I wonder.....is are you Claire Danes?????/  ;)', '2003-06-19 20:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(331858, 25282, 4007, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the face.</td>', 'Great detail on the face.', '2003-06-19 20:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(331862, 25284, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here.. but.. it''s hard to make a good portrait when the viewers eyes are drawn to looking up your nostrils.  Perhaps a different angle would have been preferable for this.  The shadowing and the blue tone are good ideas but that nose kinda throws this shot off for me.</td>', 'I like the idea here.. but.. it''s hard to make a good portrait when the viewers eyes are drawn to looking up your nostrils.  Perhaps a different angle would have been preferable for this.  The shadowing and the blue tone are good ideas but that nose kinda throws this shot off for me.', '2003-06-19 20:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(331863, 24624, 4007, '<td valign="top">A little more space above the top of the shadow would have helped I think.</td>', 'A little more space above the top of the shadow would have helped I think.', '2003-06-19 20:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(331866, 24593, 4007, '<td valign="top">Daring shot.  I''m sure you''re getting killed for this, but I love it.  The colors are wild but they contrast the figure great.. and the blur fits well.  Great work. 9</td>', 'Daring shot.  I''m sure you''re getting killed for this, but I love it.  The colors are wild but they contrast the figure great.. and the blur fits well.  Great work. 9', '2003-06-19 20:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(331868, 25074, 4007, '<td valign="top">The title is a bit excessive, but I think this is a really great portrait.</td>', 'The title is a bit excessive, but I think this is a really great portrait.', '2003-06-19 20:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(331870, 25263, 4007, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many times you did this shot to get it right.. = )</td>', 'I wonder how many times you did this shot to get it right.. = )', '2003-06-19 20:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(331873, 25274, 5822, '<td valign="top">i like the crop here</td>', 'i like the crop here', '2003-06-19 20:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(331876, 25057, 5822, '<td valign="top">I think the DOF here is too narrow and because the pawn is so large, you can''t really tell where you are from.  The glare in the background is also distracting.</td>', 'I think the DOF here is too narrow and because the pawn is so large, you can''t really tell where you are from.  The glare in the background is also distracting.', '2003-06-19 20:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(331879, 24825, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a tender scene, and I love the posing from you and your friend. This intimate scene could use some intimate lighting, too, to enhance the mood further. Nice.</td>', 'This is a tender scene, and I love the posing from you and your friend. This intimate scene could use some intimate lighting, too, to enhance the mood further. Nice.', '2003-06-19 20:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(331880, 25127, 3724, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast graphic qualities you have chosen to implement.  Your tri colour blinding black and blue  palette works well within the outline, and detail in the eyes remains to privide focus and impact to otherwise stark and ambiguous facial features.   Analogous imagery to Warhol,  and well done.  The background with the picket fence gives a homey feeling to  otherwise blighted detail.</td>', 'I like the high contrast graphic qualities you have chosen to implement.  Your tri colour blinding black and blue  palette works well within the outline, and detail in the eyes remains to privide focus and impact to otherwise stark and ambiguous facial features.   Analogous imagery to Warhol,  and well done.  The background with the picket fence gives a homey feeling to  otherwise blighted detail.', '2003-06-19 20:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(331881, 25104, 4007, '<td valign="top">Good crisp shot.  The hair and the wood texture surround the face nicely.. The skin tone seems a little pale.  It does produce an interesting contrast though.</td>', 'Good crisp shot.  The hair and the wood texture surround the face nicely.. The skin tone seems a little pale.  It does produce an interesting contrast though.', '2003-06-19 20:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(331882, 25202, 4007, '<td valign="top">I''m not a fan of the concept.</td>', 'I''m not a fan of the concept.', '2003-06-19 20:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(331883, 25202, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun stuff! I think your pose and composition/cropping work well here with the tight close up. Lighting to match your attitude would help enhance the mood even further.</td>', 'Fun stuff! I think your pose and composition/cropping work well here with the tight close up. Lighting to match your attitude would help enhance the mood even further.', '2003-06-19 20:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(331885, 25295, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sunny smile, that''s for sure! I like the tight cropping and composition. Lighting to meet and match the mood of your face would enhance this photo, too. Nice.</td>', 'Sunny smile, that''s for sure! I like the tight cropping and composition. Lighting to meet and match the mood of your face would enhance this photo, too. Nice.', '2003-06-19 20:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(331888, 25127, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. I''m sure some have mentioned that it''s "digital art," but I think it captures some kind of essence of you and creates an interesting mood that seems to match the gorgeous model!</td>', 'I like this photo. I''m sure some have mentioned that it''s "digital art," but I think it captures some kind of essence of you and creates an interesting mood that seems to match the gorgeous model!', '2003-06-19 21:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(331889, 25311, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very attractive model; I''m not sure I want to look up her nose, though. Still, I think it''s a fun and unique perspective, so it grabs my attention. Does this say "you?"</td>', 'Very attractive model; I''m not sure I want to look up her nose, though. Still, I think it''s a fun and unique perspective, so it grabs my attention. Does this say "you?"', '2003-06-19 21:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
