(331892, 24583, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea! To me, your expression is full of mischief and fun. Lighting and focus to match that attitude would enhance the shot, I feel. Nice work.</td>', 'Fun idea! To me, your expression is full of mischief and fun. Lighting and focus to match that attitude would enhance the shot, I feel. Nice work.', '2003-06-19 21:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
