(331906, 24733, 4007, '<td valign="top">I think putting "LOL" in conversation is sometimes tolerable, but putting it in the title of a photo is always a bad idea. = )   The idea of an overtly over-serious shot isn''t bad though, and I like the look you chose to convey that.</td>', 'I think putting "LOL" in conversation is sometimes tolerable, but putting it in the title of a photo is always a bad idea. = )   The idea of an overtly over-serious shot isn''t bad though, and I like the look you chose to convey that.', '2003-06-19 21:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
