(331909, 24769, 7510, '<td valign="top">Nice to meet you to,<br/>Interesting choice of framing.  Looks like you face is slightly out of focus, or maybe a motion blur.  The very blackness of the background is nice, but I think part of your sholder is a little too saturated.</td>', 'Nice to meet you to,Interesting choice of framing.  Looks like you face is slightly out of focus, or maybe a motion blur.  The very blackness of the background is nice, but I think part of your sholder is a little too saturated.', '2003-06-19 21:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(331912, 25286, 5235, '<td valign="top">I like a lot your picture. Good work on paralel lines here. Even horizontal, vertical or diagonal, the composition remains neat. The colours, although a bit improbable, give me a feeling of comfort. It seems you work very well with abstract images. <br/>Good luck. <br/></td>', 'I like a lot your picture. Good work on paralel lines here. Even horizontal, vertical or diagonal, the composition remains neat. The colours, although a bit improbable, give me a feeling of comfort. It seems you work very well with abstract images. Good luck. ', '2003-06-19 21:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
