(331918, 25097, 5822, '<td valign="top">What a lovely woman! I do however, think that the lighting is too bright here and that it''s washed out your beautiful creamy white skin.  It appears it was your intention to have your skin contrasted with the background and your lips and I think that was a good strategy, just not carried out effectively.<br/> <br/>Also, I think the photo effectively displays your essence in that the choice of a chartruse background and your stare into the camera tells me you are bold and spirited. If this was your intention, then you have accomplished that goal.<br/> <br/>That said, this is one of my favorite photos of the challenge and I am rooting for you to finish highly. Good luck to you.</td>', 'What a lovely woman! I do however, think that the lighting is too bright here and that it''s washed out your beautiful creamy white skin.  It appears it was your intention to have your skin contrasted with the background and your lips and I think that was a good strategy, just not carried out effectively. Also, I think the photo effectively displays your essence in that the choice of a chartruse background and your stare into the camera tells me you are bold and spirited. If this was your intention, then you have accomplished that goal. That said, this is one of my favorite photos of the challenge and I am rooting for you to finish highly. Good luck to you.', '2003-06-19 21:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
