(332038, 25099, 806, '<td valign="top">nice clear photo. I like the setting. I don''t think the inclusion of the reflection of your arm and camera adds to this.. It takes away they mystery.</td>', 'nice clear photo. I like the setting. I don''t think the inclusion of the reflection of your arm and camera adds to this.. It takes away they mystery.', '2003-06-20 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
