(332077, 25276, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very good shot...  This looks mystical in some way, maybe because of the blur on the arm, not sure.  Maybe should have shown more of your forehead.</td>', 'Very good shot...  This looks mystical in some way, maybe because of the blur on the arm, not sure.  Maybe should have shown more of your forehead.', '2003-06-20 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
