(332293, 25261, 7369, '<td valign="top">Most of the time I don''t like soft focus. However the way you have done it is fantastic! I also like the duotone and the border. Good job! (9)</td>', 'Most of the time I don''t like soft focus. However the way you have done it is fantastic! I also like the duotone and the border. Good job! (9)', '2003-06-20 04:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(332294, 24838, 7369, '<td valign="top">You achieved a slightly eerie but spectacular effect. It reminds me a little of a game I played on the Amiga years ago: Supremacy. The detail in the bulb is fantastic. The choice of colors is wonderful. This is definitely one of my favorite pictures of this challenge. (9)</td>', 'You achieved a slightly eerie but spectacular effect. It reminds me a little of a game I played on the Amiga years ago: Supremacy. The detail in the bulb is fantastic. The choice of colors is wonderful. This is definitely one of my favorite pictures of this challenge. (9)', '2003-06-20 04:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(332297, 24769, 6388, '<td valign="top">oddly enough, it''s the title that sets this apart.  i rated this in my top 10 of the challenge.  something very personal about it, and I can''t tell if it''s the title, or your expression. either way, good on ya.</td>', 'oddly enough, it''s the title that sets this apart.  i rated this in my top 10 of the challenge.  something very personal about it, and I can''t tell if it''s the title, or your expression. either way, good on ya.', '2003-06-20 04:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(332298, 25229, 6388, '<td valign="top">i went from a 5 to a seven to a six in the three times I''ve looked at this. I finally figured out that it''s the rigid background lines vs. the rounded human lines of the silhouette that throw me off.  love the backlit concept, but the lines throw the balance off.  great idea either way.</td>', 'i went from a 5 to a seven to a six in the three times I''ve looked at this. I finally figured out that it''s the rigid background lines vs. the rounded human lines of the silhouette that throw me off.  love the backlit concept, but the lines throw the balance off.  great idea either way.', '2003-06-20 04:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(332301, 24625, 6388, '<td valign="top">it''d be nice to see more of you (in ref to your title) :)<br/> <br/>harsh lighting on your face - hot spots and shadows can hide both good and bad things.  the brightness takes away some of the definition in your lips, and (i think) what would be gorgeous freckles.  in my top 10 either way.</td>', 'it''d be nice to see more of you (in ref to your title) :) harsh lighting on your face - hot spots and shadows can hide both good and bad things.  the brightness takes away some of the definition in your lips, and (i think) what would be gorgeous freckles.  in my top 10 either way.', '2003-06-20 04:32:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(332302, 25056, 6388, '<td valign="top">unique presentation of a common idea (the ''just my eyes'' thing).  border works for me, as does the soft focus.</td>', 'unique presentation of a common idea (the ''just my eyes'' thing).  border works for me, as does the soft focus.', '2003-06-20 04:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332304, 25284, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to drop this from 7 to 6 three times and can''t do it.  the thumbnail looks awful, but the pic is really quite nice.  shows lots of character (what you really need are some good ol'' scars - kidding).  it will remain a 7 (which is in my top 10)</td>', 'I''ve tried to drop this from 7 to 6 three times and can''t do it.  the thumbnail looks awful, but the pic is really quite nice.  shows lots of character (what you really need are some good ol'' scars - kidding).  it will remain a 7 (which is in my top 10)', '2003-06-20 04:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
