(332306, 25144, 6388, '<td valign="top">lovely pose.  i only wish the light at the top wasn''t there.  the diffuse light is very powerful...methinks you spend more than a little time doing yoga.</td>', 'lovely pose.  i only wish the light at the top wasn''t there.  the diffuse light is very powerful...methinks you spend more than a little time doing yoga.', '2003-06-20 04:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
