(332308, 24589, 6388, '<td valign="top">I''d have colled it ''Crop'' myself. :)<br/> <br/>a little deeper DOF and make it all clear...the blur in the hands detracts I think, since you have your face and the wall crisp.  If you use shallow depth of focus, I think either ONLY one part or all parts should be crisp.</td>', 'I''d have colled it ''Crop'' myself. :) a little deeper DOF and make it all clear...the blur in the hands detracts I think, since you have your face and the wall crisp.  If you use shallow depth of focus, I think either ONLY one part or all parts should be crisp.', '2003-06-20 04:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
