(332316, 24885, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the high-key approach, but think you may have overdone it (I''m guilty of this all the time).  I lose parts of that sweet little pumpkin''s face inthe flare.  beautiful composition; drop the contrast as soon as the competition is done and get a frame on it.</td>', 'i like the high-key approach, but think you may have overdone it (I''m guilty of this all the time).  I lose parts of that sweet little pumpkin''s face inthe flare.  beautiful composition; drop the contrast as soon as the competition is done and get a frame on it.', '2003-06-20 04:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(332319, 25226, 6388, '<td valign="top">it''s hard to talk to the camera like this for a self portrait.  nice job.  you managed to have captured all your nice parts all by yourself. :)  I might up the contrast a little to separate you from the rocks in the back.</td>', 'it''s hard to talk to the camera like this for a self portrait.  nice job.  you managed to have captured all your nice parts all by yourself. :)  I might up the contrast a little to separate you from the rocks in the back.', '2003-06-20 04:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(332331, 24625, 8860, '<td valign="top">A very sensual, moody shot. Great lighting and tones. The subject matter''s not bad either!</td>', 'A very sensual, moody shot. Great lighting and tones. The subject matter''s not bad either!', '2003-06-20 05:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(332371, 25164, 8987, '<td valign="top">I don''t completely get the title, but I like the picture!</td>', 'I don''t completely get the title, but I like the picture!', '2003-06-20 06:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(332373, 25059, 6958, '<td valign="top">Lol! Fun idea. I love tones and the mood of your shot. 8</td>', 'Lol! Fun idea. I love tones and the mood of your shot. 8', '2003-06-20 06:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(332381, 25229, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice drama in this with good lighting. The top of your head has a strange softness which I can''t quite work out though.</td>', 'Nice drama in this with good lighting. The top of your head has a strange softness which I can''t quite work out though.', '2003-06-20 06:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
