(332385, 24955, 3087, '<td valign="top">That mirror mosaic is beautiful. This is a subtle portrait and I like that it shows your environment, whether or not it''s "home". Would like just a touch more light on your face or less on your shirt.</td>', 'That mirror mosaic is beautiful. This is a subtle portrait and I like that it shows your environment, whether or not it''s "home". Would like just a touch more light on your face or less on your shirt.', '2003-06-20 06:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
