(332387, 25056, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice! I''ve seen similar framing and cropping in some magazines recently and I think this is a great example. I really like the grainy feel. Not at all keen on border.</td>', 'Nice! I''ve seen similar framing and cropping in some magazines recently and I think this is a great example. I really like the grainy feel. Not at all keen on border.', '2003-06-20 06:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
