(332394, 24764, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea! I like this overall though find the eyes too much in shadow and focus a little soft.</td>', 'Nice idea! I like this overall though find the eyes too much in shadow and focus a little soft.', '2003-06-20 06:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
