(332444, 25166, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice one - like the idea to show your life rather than just your looks - this one grows on me the more I look at it. I could see it in a gallery. Yes I know the window is blown out but that doesn''t bother me.<br/>9</td>', 'Nice one - like the idea to show your life rather than just your looks - this one grows on me the more I look at it. I could see it in a gallery. Yes I know the window is blown out but that doesn''t bother me.9', '2003-06-20 07:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
