(332475, 24746, 917, '<td valign="top">I see spot cream, hair gel, shampoo and conditioner there. This photo says more about you than you think it does. Unless you meant to indicate your teenage obsessions.</td>', 'I see spot cream, hair gel, shampoo and conditioner there. This photo says more about you than you think it does. Unless you meant to indicate your teenage obsessions.', '2003-06-20 08:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
