(332513, 24922, 2798, '<td valign="top">Placement is a little too central for my tastes. Good light and lovely out of focus background. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Placement is a little too central for my tastes. Good light and lovely out of focus background. 7 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(332515, 24743, 6025, '<td valign="top">The image is oversharpened significantly (see the top edge of the cucumber in particular). Also, a self portrait is something that tries to give a message of some kind, illustrate to the world what your personality is like. Do you really want to convey the message of being a superficial health-freak? That is what the image conveys to me, in any case. One final thing; I know it is pointless and has nothing to do with the challenge, but "nite" is spelt "night". (2)</td>', 'The image is oversharpened significantly (see the top edge of the cucumber in particular). Also, a self portrait is something that tries to give a message of some kind, illustrate to the world what your personality is like. Do you really want to convey the message of being a superficial health-freak? That is what the image conveys to me, in any case. One final thing; I know it is pointless and has nothing to do with the challenge, but "nite" is spelt "night". (2)', '2003-06-20 09:12:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(332516, 25281, 2798, '<td valign="top">Very glam! Light seems a little harsh though. Good arrangement and cropping. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Very glam! Light seems a little harsh though. Good arrangement and cropping. 7 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(332518, 24791, 2798, '<td valign="top">Super, personal work. I like your concept and it''s a well taken photo. I think the only thing I would have liked to see is perhaps a little more contrast across your face. You''ve captured the form well, though. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Super, personal work. I like your concept and it''s a well taken photo. I think the only thing I would have liked to see is perhaps a little more contrast across your face. You''ve captured the form well, though. 8 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(332519, 24656, 2798, '<td valign="top">All the white makes you look a little sunburned to me. Perhaps that''s why you look so unhappy. Seriously, though, this is a great concept for your shot - pointing at the contrast between your supposedly white features and the white of your clothes and background. A great angle on the challenge and that always scores well with me. I just wish you didnt look so miserable. :) 9 - floyd</td>', 'All the white makes you look a little sunburned to me. Perhaps that''s why you look so unhappy. Seriously, though, this is a great concept for your shot - pointing at the contrast between your supposedly white features and the white of your clothes and background. A great angle on the challenge and that always scores well with me. I just wish you didnt look so miserable. :) 9 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(332520, 25261, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great light and soft focus. The atmosphere is excellent. I think just your expression is wrong. I think laughing would have suited the atmosphere better. Love the duotones too. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Great light and soft focus. The atmosphere is excellent. I think just your expression is wrong. I think laughing would have suited the atmosphere better. Love the duotones too. 8 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(332522, 25074, 2798, '<td valign="top">Picture much better than title. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Picture much better than title. 7 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(332524, 25101, 2798, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution. Great work! 9 - floyd</td>', 'Great idea and execution. Great work! 9 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(332526, 25304, 7864, '<td valign="top">Excellent, great idea, beautifully taken</td>', 'Excellent, great idea, beautifully taken', '2003-06-20 09:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(332527, 25282, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely light and form. 8 - floyd</td>', 'Lovely light and form. 8 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
