(332530, 25284, 2798, '<td valign="top">Your nose is the essence of yourself? You must have really bad hayfever or something. Seriously, though, nice study of form but a little too tight a crop I think. Also a very unflattering light angle. Totally obscuring your eyes which greatly dehumanises the shot. 6 - floyd.</td>', 'Your nose is the essence of yourself? You must have really bad hayfever or something. Seriously, though, nice study of form but a little too tight a crop I think. Also a very unflattering light angle. Totally obscuring your eyes which greatly dehumanises the shot. 6 - floyd.', '2003-06-20 09:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(332531, 25093, 714, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to find any grain at all in this photo.  Excellent camera use and the lighting is right on.  I love the shadowing...could have been a good one in the b/b challenge.  vote 10</td>', 'I can''t seem to find any grain at all in this photo.  Excellent camera use and the lighting is right on.  I love the shadowing...could have been a good one in the b/b challenge.  vote 10', '2003-06-20 09:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(332532, 25105, 2798, '<td valign="top">Lovely pose and focus. Perhaps a little more light and warmth would have helped. Perhaps also push the blue in your eyes and the red in your lips up a touch more. Soft focus would also make you seem to glow. 7 - floyd</td>', 'Lovely pose and focus. Perhaps a little more light and warmth would have helped. Perhaps also push the blue in your eyes and the red in your lips up a touch more. Soft focus would also make you seem to glow. 7 - floyd', '2003-06-20 09:31:49.000000', NULL, 1),
