(332549, 25105, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The lighting is good but maybe a little to harsh.  Try toning it down just a tad. Great pose and very pretty smile.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The lighting is good but maybe a little to harsh.  Try toning it down just a tad. Great pose and very pretty smile.', '2003-06-20 09:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(332550, 25162, 714, '<td valign="top">You look like a professor!  Great lighting! I love the look. &lt;I did my homework but the dog ate it, really&gt;  hehehehe...good luck!</td>', 'You look like a professor!  Great lighting! I love the look. <I did my homework but the dog ate it, really>  hehehehe...good luck!', '2003-06-20 09:51:45.000000', NULL, 1),
