(332564, 24762, 714, '<td valign="top">Great post. It almost looks like an old photo.  The picture seems a bit out of focus. not sure what could have happened because it looks like the timer was set.  maybe you moved when the shutter when off.  Nice lighting. good luck.</td>', 'Great post. It almost looks like an old photo.  The picture seems a bit out of focus. not sure what could have happened because it looks like the timer was set.  maybe you moved when the shutter when off.  Nice lighting. good luck.', '2003-06-20 09:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
