(332576, 25075, 7263, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot</td>', 'I like this a lot', '2003-06-20 10:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(332577, 25096, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the look but I don''t like the shirt with it. Maybe something black or white.  The pink really takes away from your face.  Great lighting. Good luck</td>', 'I like the look but I don''t like the shirt with it. Maybe something black or white.  The pink really takes away from your face.  Great lighting. Good luck', '2003-06-20 10:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(332582, 24801, 714, '<td valign="top">You know, you look very short in this picture.  hehehehehee...<br/>Great lighting and nice clear shot.  I love the pose.  Title fits the picture well.  Good luck! Vote 9</td>', 'You know, you look very short in this picture.  hehehehehee...Great lighting and nice clear shot.  I love the pose.  Title fits the picture well.  Good luck! Vote 9', '2003-06-20 10:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(332590, 25122, 714, '<td valign="top">The lighting is way to harsh and the shower curtain has to go.  It take my eyes off the subject.  I like the mist adds a great effect to the photo.  The bubbles are good too.  Good luck</td>', 'The lighting is way to harsh and the shower curtain has to go.  It take my eyes off the subject.  I like the mist adds a great effect to the photo.  The bubbles are good too.  Good luck', '2003-06-20 10:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(332609, 24769, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and lighting.  One thing bugs me is your shirt seems to be more in focus then your face.  You must have moved.  I always take at least 20 pictures just to make sure I get the perfect shot.  good luck.</td>', 'Nice angle and lighting.  One thing bugs me is your shirt seems to be more in focus then your face.  You must have moved.  I always take at least 20 pictures just to make sure I get the perfect shot.  good luck.', '2003-06-20 10:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332612, 25097, 714, '<td valign="top">I love the background color with the very pretty white skin.  I love the pose.  The lighting might be a tad harsh but it could work with me if it is what you intended.  High-key photography.  ;-)  Good luck.</td>', 'I love the background color with the very pretty white skin.  I love the pose.  The lighting might be a tad harsh but it could work with me if it is what you intended.  High-key photography.  ;-)  Good luck.', '2003-06-20 10:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(332625, 24709, 714, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the use of the candle.  Have you tried using the exposure settings on your camera?  Might try a lower exposure so the light from the candle doesn''t look blown out.  Good luck</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the use of the candle.  Have you tried using the exposure settings on your camera?  Might try a lower exposure so the light from the candle doesn''t look blown out.  Good luck', '2003-06-20 10:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(332637, 24818, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice skin!  The look is very scarey!  Great lighting and the effect is definitly unique.  No other like it!  hehehehee. Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice skin!  The look is very scarey!  Great lighting and the effect is definitly unique.  No other like it!  hehehehee. Good luck!', '2003-06-20 10:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(332638, 24894, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good going!</td>', 'Good going!', '2003-06-20 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(332639, 24838, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This is fantastic.  Highly original and well executed.  Congrats on a really great image. 10</td>', 'Wow!  This is fantastic.  Highly original and well executed.  Congrats on a really great image. 10', '2003-06-20 10:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(332649, 24887, 714, '<td valign="top">hahahahaa...this is to funny!  I love it.  I hope you at least get the top 3.  I would rather see this then a nude.  Great shot and lighting..perfect!</td>', 'hahahahaa...this is to funny!  I love it.  I hope you at least get the top 3.  I would rather see this then a nude.  Great shot and lighting..perfect!', '2003-06-20 11:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(332652, 25110, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good job!</td>', 'I like it.  Good job!', '2003-06-20 11:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(332653, 24831, 714, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. I love the light and grey tones.  They almost look blue.  Great look but would like to see a smile. :-)  I love the lighting on the hair.  very cool. good luck</td>', 'Excellent shot. I love the light and grey tones.  They almost look blue.  Great look but would like to see a smile. :-)  I love the lighting on the hair.  very cool. good luck', '2003-06-20 11:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(332654, 25280, 1280, '<td valign="top">I know the feeling....I feel the same way.  The score on my self-portrait proves I should stay "behind" the camera.<br/>You got nice focus on your eys.  Best of luck!</td>', 'I know the feeling....I feel the same way.  The score on my self-portrait proves I should stay "behind" the camera.You got nice focus on your eys.  Best of luck!', '2003-06-20 11:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(332657, 25034, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot.  I love the low-key look.  Angle is excellent and the lighting is perfect.  vote 10</td>', 'Awesome shot.  I love the low-key look.  Angle is excellent and the lighting is perfect.  vote 10', '2003-06-20 11:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
