(332718, 24676, 7293, '<td valign="top">One of the most original shots submitted--nicely done!</td>', 'One of the most original shots submitted--nicely done!', '2003-06-20 12:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(332725, 25185, 7293, '<td valign="top">The tall stand of grass/reeds/flora almost growing out of your forehead is a bit disctracting, but otherwise I like the composition</td>', 'The tall stand of grass/reeds/flora almost growing out of your forehead is a bit disctracting, but otherwise I like the composition', '2003-06-20 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(332729, 25144, 7293, '<td valign="top">A little hard to figure out which way you''re facing and what position your body is in. Maybe that was part of the concept--sorry if so. Also, it might have been nicer if the bulb had been hidden by the screen... I do like the silhouette idea though.</td>', 'A little hard to figure out which way you''re facing and what position your body is in. Maybe that was part of the concept--sorry if so. Also, it might have been nicer if the bulb had been hidden by the screen... I do like the silhouette idea though.', '2003-06-20 12:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(332732, 25303, 7293, '<td valign="top">wow, can''t wait to read about how you did this...</td>', 'wow, can''t wait to read about how you did this...', '2003-06-20 12:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(332736, 24644, 7293, '<td valign="top">Love the composition except for the distracting tree reflections in the glasses. They may have been part of the point but I guess I''d rather see your eyes. :)</td>', 'Love the composition except for the distracting tree reflections in the glasses. They may have been part of the point but I guess I''d rather see your eyes. :)', '2003-06-20 12:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(332737, 25056, 7293, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the part I really like (images in the border) may be outside the rules... so I think I''ve gotta score as if that part didn''t exist.  6 instead of 7 or 8, I guess. Sorry if this is being too pedantic--I''m pretty new to the site.</td>', 'I''m afraid the part I really like (images in the border) may be outside the rules... so I think I''ve gotta score as if that part didn''t exist.  6 instead of 7 or 8, I guess. Sorry if this is being too pedantic--I''m pretty new to the site.', '2003-06-20 12:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(332739, 25164, 7293, '<td valign="top">Reflection off the shiny wall doesn''t work too well (I have this problem a lot at my place too--what were those painters THINKING!?). Hanging up a cloth is one way around the problem.</td>', 'Reflection off the shiny wall doesn''t work too well (I have this problem a lot at my place too--what were those painters THINKING!?). Hanging up a cloth is one way around the problem.', '2003-06-20 12:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(332751, 24683, 9493, '<td valign="top">a little out of focous but a great shot</td>', 'a little out of focous but a great shot', '2003-06-20 12:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(332752, 24801, 3087, '<td valign="top">It will make you go blind. How many identical comments have you got like that?<br/>I really like the way that your suit is just part of the blackness - one of the few SPs that''s using lots of darkness to hide some of the subject without it being an exercise in modesty/ shyness/ fear.<br/>Great expression too.<br/>8</td>', 'It will make you go blind. How many identical comments have you got like that?I really like the way that your suit is just part of the blackness - one of the few SPs that''s using lots of darkness to hide some of the subject without it being an exercise in modesty/ shyness/ fear.Great expression too.8', '2003-06-20 12:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(332755, 24656, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the (perceived) play on caucasian/ white.<br/>You''re darker than me and I''m Indian (from India not Native American).<br/>Made me think and made me come back and look again.<br/>But why so somber/ grumpy looking?<br/>7</td>', 'Love the (perceived) play on caucasian/ white.You''re darker than me and I''m Indian (from India not Native American).Made me think and made me come back and look again.But why so somber/ grumpy looking?7', '2003-06-20 12:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(332759, 24894, 9493, '<td valign="top">how did you come up with that idea nice work    9</td>', 'how did you come up with that idea nice work    9', '2003-06-20 12:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(332760, 25119, 9493, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good work        9</td>', 'nice idea, good work        9', '2003-06-20 12:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(332761, 24764, 8130, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo, from one oldie to another.  I would have liked to see a hint of shoulder, though, rather than the head kind of floating in space.  Or, do I need to recalibrate my monitor?  High marks anyhow, good job!</td>', 'I think this is a great photo, from one oldie to another.  I would have liked to see a hint of shoulder, though, rather than the head kind of floating in space.  Or, do I need to recalibrate my monitor?  High marks anyhow, good job!', '2003-06-20 12:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(332763, 25123, 8130, '<td valign="top">Great!  Thanks for taking the creative route.</td>', 'Great!  Thanks for taking the creative route.', '2003-06-20 12:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(332764, 25058, 9493, '<td valign="top">very true...</td>', 'very true...', '2003-06-20 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(332767, 24843, 9504, '<td valign="top">I just love this photo.  Great emotions are conveyed, lovely shadowing which gives great interest.  Nice textured wall.  WOW!</td>', 'I just love this photo.  Great emotions are conveyed, lovely shadowing which gives great interest.  Nice textured wall.  WOW!', '2003-06-20 12:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(332768, 25212, 9504, '<td valign="top">Very clever.  You are creative.</td>', 'Very clever.  You are creative.', '2003-06-20 12:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(332769, 25097, 7966, '<td valign="top">i like the colors, the lime background, the lipstick. It''s a little washed out lokking though, the light is a little too strong. good shot. 7.</td>', 'i like the colors, the lime background, the lipstick. It''s a little washed out lokking though, the light is a little too strong. good shot. 7.', '2003-06-20 12:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(332770, 25285, 9504, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of you, but I feel like I am looking at a portrait taken by a photographer -- not a self-portrait.  It''s not creative enough for my tastes.</td>', 'Nice photo of you, but I feel like I am looking at a portrait taken by a photographer -- not a self-portrait.  It''s not creative enough for my tastes.', '2003-06-20 12:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(332771, 24801, 9504, '<td valign="top">Great job. Simply fabulous.</td>', 'Great job. Simply fabulous.', '2003-06-20 12:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(332772, 25185, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten the horizon</td>', 'straighten the horizon', '2003-06-20 12:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(332773, 25296, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great angle and perspective through reduction in size. Lighting OK though I''d prefer a little more on the side of the face.<br/>I''m not commenting on the nice buns. Ok I am. Nice buns. (Sorry).<br/>8</td>', 'Great angle and perspective through reduction in size. Lighting OK though I''d prefer a little more on the side of the face.I''m not commenting on the nice buns. Ok I am. Nice buns. (Sorry).8', '2003-06-20 12:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(332774, 25189, 9504, '<td valign="top">It''s grainy, though good.</td>', 'It''s grainy, though good.', '2003-06-20 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(332775, 25020, 9504, '<td valign="top">Simple awesome!  WOW!</td>', 'Simple awesome!  WOW!', '2003-06-20 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(332776, 25094, 9504, '<td valign="top">You convey a great message of being shy.  Very creative.</td>', 'You convey a great message of being shy.  Very creative.', '2003-06-20 12:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(332778, 24889, 9504, '<td valign="top">Is that your self-image? All bust...?</td>', 'Is that your self-image? All bust...?', '2003-06-20 12:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(332779, 24723, 7293, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting--bright teeth are scary!</td>', 'I like the lighting--bright teeth are scary!', '2003-06-20 12:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
