(332790, 24764, 6100, '<td valign="top">Ok, you may be getting old ... but you''re in good company! I would change only two things about this photo -- 1. I would like a slight bit more light in the eyes to  generate catchlights, and 2. I would like to eliminate the reflections on the glasses. Other than that, you''ve done a superior job!</td>', 'Ok, you may be getting old ... but you''re in good company! I would change only two things about this photo -- 1. I would like a slight bit more light in the eyes to  generate catchlights, and 2. I would like to eliminate the reflections on the glasses. Other than that, you''ve done a superior job!', '2003-06-20 13:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(332791, 24828, 4380, '<td valign="top">very timely image...</td>', 'very timely image...', '2003-06-20 13:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(332792, 25084, 4380, '<td valign="top">happy image, so relax posing, classic composition..yup...you''ve got a beautiful eyes...i also like the grainy effect.  excellent image...10!</td>', 'happy image, so relax posing, classic composition..yup...you''ve got a beautiful eyes...i also like the grainy effect.  excellent image...10!', '2003-06-20 13:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
