(332872, 25136, 6477, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, the environment and the sepia tones here, but I think you need to work more on your focus. Good work.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-27 13:51:38.</i></td>', 'I like the concept, the environment and the sepia tones here, but I think you need to work more on your focus. Good work.', '2003-06-20 14:18:45.000000', '2003-06-27 14:51:38.000000', 1),
(332877, 24767, 9523, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-06-20 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(332880, 24838, 8522, '<td valign="top">You should score very highly with this one, maybe #1. Having waded through all the portraits, many stunningly good, yours stands out as being the most creative and inventive. My favourite this challenge! Brilliant dof, it''s incredible how sharp everything is, while still being fairly dark. Great concept. Impressive lighting. 10</td>', 'You should score very highly with this one, maybe #1. Having waded through all the portraits, many stunningly good, yours stands out as being the most creative and inventive. My favourite this challenge! Brilliant dof, it''s incredible how sharp everything is, while still being fairly dark. Great concept. Impressive lighting. 10', '2003-06-20 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(332884, 24723, 8522, '<td valign="top">The teeth are what makes this shot particularly effective for me. Very effective shot, I admire it''s ''edginess''. Effective lighting and shadows. 9</td>', 'The teeth are what makes this shot particularly effective for me. Very effective shot, I admire it''s ''edginess''. Effective lighting and shadows. 9', '2003-06-20 14:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(332895, 25037, 3015, '<td valign="top">I do like the body form as art. I DO see this as art, I like the soft color. The jewelry does help to balance the shot, but the cross is almost too soft for me.</td>', 'I do like the body form as art. I DO see this as art, I like the soft color. The jewelry does help to balance the shot, but the cross is almost too soft for me.', '2003-06-20 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(332897, 25304, 8522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, this one really appeals to me. The sepia toning is very effective, and adds to the wistful expression in the eyes. I''m sure the crack running across the face has some kind of deep psychological symbolism here, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Perhaps like a kind of heartbreak or loss. Shame about the distracting background in the mirror. The white background works very well. It''s also a shame that the border is  not an even width at the bottom. 9</td>', 'A beautiful picture, this one really appeals to me. The sepia toning is very effective, and adds to the wistful expression in the eyes. I''m sure the crack running across the face has some kind of deep psychological symbolism here, but I can''t quite put my finger on it. Perhaps like a kind of heartbreak or loss. Shame about the distracting background in the mirror. The white background works very well. It''s also a shame that the border is  not an even width at the bottom. 9', '2003-06-20 14:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(332899, 25104, 8522, '<td valign="top">A beautiful picture, the texture of the wood contrasts nicely with the light tones in the face. The wood grain is also mirrored nicely by the texture of your hair, the fact that these have lines running parallel heighten their textures. Nicely cropped. 9</td>', 'A beautiful picture, the texture of the wood contrasts nicely with the light tones in the face. The wood grain is also mirrored nicely by the texture of your hair, the fact that these have lines running parallel heighten their textures. Nicely cropped. 9', '2003-06-20 14:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(332905, 24800, 8522, '<td valign="top">Yikes, a bit testosterone laden and self-indulgent for me! Nice lighting though. 8</td>', 'Yikes, a bit testosterone laden and self-indulgent for me! Nice lighting though. 8', '2003-06-20 14:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(332938, 24746, 7966, '<td valign="top">this photo is a kinda fuzzy, it could have been in better focus.  I like that you''re off center, it gives it a different feeling, but it''s a little too much, I would have cropped a little off the left side. Good job though</td>', 'this photo is a kinda fuzzy, it could have been in better focus.  I like that you''re off center, it gives it a different feeling, but it''s a little too much, I would have cropped a little off the left side. Good job though', '2003-06-20 15:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(332951, 25270, 7966, '<td valign="top">Great shot, nice and clear. I love the colors, the red hair and blue shirt, even the eyes and the ring. It has a very casual feel and doesn''t seem staged. I like photos like that. Goood job and good luck</td>', 'Great shot, nice and clear. I love the colors, the red hair and blue shirt, even the eyes and the ring. It has a very casual feel and doesn''t seem staged. I like photos like that. Goood job and good luck', '2003-06-20 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
