(333042, 25272, 7369, '<td valign="top">The wooden (?) frame is a nice feature and adds even more interest to the picture than it already has. The light could be just a little brighter. Furthermore a little sharpening wouldn''t hurt either. Overall I think you have made a very good and appealing self-portrait. (8)</td>', 'The wooden (?) frame is a nice feature and adds even more interest to the picture than it already has. The light could be just a little brighter. Furthermore a little sharpening wouldn''t hurt either. Overall I think you have made a very good and appealing self-portrait. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333044, 25191, 7369, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this image is underexposed. Then the background ''started working''. Now the more I view the picture, the more I like it: the light is just fabulous just like the composition. All in all it is a very clever photo and one of my favorites this week. (8)</td>', 'At first I thought this image is underexposed. Then the background ''started working''. Now the more I view the picture, the more I like it: the light is just fabulous just like the composition. All in all it is a very clever photo and one of my favorites this week. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333045, 25074, 9027, '<td valign="top">very cool shot. i liked the subtlety. the person doesn''t catch u right away, but sneaks up on u.</td>', 'very cool shot. i liked the subtlety. the person doesn''t catch u right away, but sneaks up on u.', '2003-06-20 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(333046, 24764, 7369, '<td valign="top">What a great portrait picture. I just love the way how you ''separate your head'' from the surroundings. While the reflection on the glasses might be a little distracting I think they also add some depth to the photo. (8)</td>', 'What a great portrait picture. I just love the way how you ''separate your head'' from the surroundings. While the reflection on the glasses might be a little distracting I think they also add some depth to the photo. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333048, 24791, 7369, '<td valign="top">You have made a fascinating picture. Good choice of colors BTW. (8)</td>', 'You have made a fascinating picture. Good choice of colors BTW. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333050, 24656, 7369, '<td valign="top">You achieved a nice contrast between yourself, your clothes and the background. Well done. (8)</td>', 'You achieved a nice contrast between yourself, your clothes and the background. Well done. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(333052, 25058, 7369, '<td valign="top">Very stylish! The choice of colors is great just like the light. They provide an appealing contrast. What could be improved? The wrinkles in the red cloth are a little distracting and I don''t understand the pencil (maybe a real cigarette would have been better?) (8)</td>', 'Very stylish! The choice of colors is great just like the light. They provide an appealing contrast. What could be improved? The wrinkles in the red cloth are a little distracting and I don''t understand the pencil (maybe a real cigarette would have been better?) (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(333053, 24633, 7369, '<td valign="top">While nude males don''t attract me at all,  I do think that you have made a very good and tasteful image. The choice of colors is great. The composition is wonderful. It almost looks as though you''re trapped between the borders of the photo. One of my favorites this week. (8)</td>', 'While nude males don''t attract me at all,  I do think that you have made a very good and tasteful image. The choice of colors is great. The composition is wonderful. It almost looks as though you''re trapped between the borders of the photo. One of my favorites this week. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333055, 25301, 7369, '<td valign="top">The way how you blend in the background is very nice. The expression, light, focus and composition makes this one of the better photo this challenge. (8)</td>', 'The way how you blend in the background is very nice. The expression, light, focus and composition makes this one of the better photo this challenge. (8)', '2003-06-20 16:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
