(333310, 25179, 7339, '<td valign="top">Unique, I like it. Blur on your left arm is cool and I love indoor climbing. I gave it a 7</td>', 'Unique, I like it. Blur on your left arm is cool and I love indoor climbing. I gave it a 7', '2003-06-20 19:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(333311, 25034, 5235, '<td valign="top">i like a lot the way you dealt with shadow &amp; light. simple and beautiful.  good luck</td>', 'i like a lot the way you dealt with shadow & light. simple and beautiful.  good luck', '2003-06-20 19:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333312, 25095, 7339, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was done in photoshop, then realized it must be a photo puzzle. Good Idea, I like the placement of the pices and overall image.</td>', 'At first I thought this was done in photoshop, then realized it must be a photo puzzle. Good Idea, I like the placement of the pices and overall image.', '2003-06-20 19:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(333316, 25297, 7339, '<td valign="top">Very cool. I am a big fan of long exposure shots and try them frequently. I assume thats how you did this. Either way I would welcome an e-mail on how it was done. I gave it an 8 Congrats</td>', 'Very cool. I am a big fan of long exposure shots and try them frequently. I assume thats how you did this. Either way I would welcome an e-mail on how it was done. I gave it an 8 Congrats', '2003-06-20 19:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333317, 25059, 5235, '<td valign="top">very very nice :-)  the tone, the grains, and it made me laugh.  Congrats and good luck!</td>', 'very very nice :-)  the tone, the grains, and it made me laugh.  Congrats and good luck!', '2003-06-20 19:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333319, 24955, 5235, '<td valign="top">beautifully done!  congratulations!</td>', 'beautifully done!  congratulations!', '2003-06-20 19:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333328, 24737, 5235, '<td valign="top">let´s say i am a bit disappointed...</td>', 'let´s say i am a bit disappointed...', '2003-06-20 19:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333339, 25057, 5235, '<td valign="top">again, let´s say I am a bit disappointed.</td>', 'again, let´s say I am a bit disappointed.', '2003-06-20 19:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(333346, 25181, 5235, '<td valign="top">interesting and colorful composition.  I like it!  good luck!</td>', 'interesting and colorful composition.  I like it!  good luck!', '2003-06-20 19:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333402, 25237, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but don''t feel there was enough light on your face.</td>', 'I like the composition, but don''t feel there was enough light on your face.', '2003-06-20 20:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(333415, 24964, 4811, '<td valign="top">Very original idea, lighting very good, a little too much on the red side, but some way should have been found to avoid seeing wires and weird lines in the fabric.</td>', 'Very original idea, lighting very good, a little too much on the red side, but some way should have been found to avoid seeing wires and weird lines in the fabric.', '2003-06-20 21:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(333420, 24814, 3976, '<td valign="top">Great Idea.  My only suggestion would be to crop out the right hand side where we see a piece of your face.  Otherwise this looks like a lot of fun.</td>', 'Great Idea.  My only suggestion would be to crop out the right hand side where we see a piece of your face.  Otherwise this looks like a lot of fun.', '2003-06-20 21:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333424, 24555, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the intensity, but the DOF doesn''t work for me -- would like to see the nose in focus as well.</td>', 'I like the intensity, but the DOF doesn''t work for me -- would like to see the nose in focus as well.', '2003-06-20 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333426, 25298, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the peacefulness of this photo, brought on by the expression and the muted colors.</td>', 'I like the peacefulness of this photo, brought on by the expression and the muted colors.', '2003-06-20 21:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(333427, 24644, 6565, '<td valign="top">Really interesting, having the glasses in color!  Didn''t notice it in the thumbnail.  I like the sharpness and intensity of this photo.</td>', 'Really interesting, having the glasses in color!  Didn''t notice it in the thumbnail.  I like the sharpness and intensity of this photo.', '2003-06-20 21:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333428, 25189, 6565, '<td valign="top">The graininess doesn''t work for me, but I like the sort of Matrix Agent thing going on with the formal shirt and sunglasses. :)</td>', 'The graininess doesn''t work for me, but I like the sort of Matrix Agent thing going on with the formal shirt and sunglasses. :)', '2003-06-20 21:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(333429, 24693, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s really cool!  Love the sharpness of the eye, as well as the reflection in the pupil!  Will be curious to hear how you did this, especially how you got the pupil dialated with that much light on the face!  Nice!</td>', 'Wow, that''s really cool!  Love the sharpness of the eye, as well as the reflection in the pupil!  Will be curious to hear how you did this, especially how you got the pupil dialated with that much light on the face!  Nice!', '2003-06-20 21:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333430, 24747, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''d have cropped the top down some, since that white space at the top doesn''t seem to add anything.  I like the softness of the image.</td>', 'I''d have cropped the top down some, since that white space at the top doesn''t seem to add anything.  I like the softness of the image.', '2003-06-20 21:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(333431, 24763, 3976, '<td valign="top">Nice Picture - you fuck!!!  How did you set the camera up like this?  You sure it wasn''t some dope-ass professional camera man who shot this?<br/>- j<br/>p.s. you best believe I''m giving this picture a 10.</td>', 'Nice Picture - you fuck!!!  How did you set the camera up like this?  You sure it wasn''t some dope-ass professional camera man who shot this?- jp.s. you best believe I''m giving this picture a 10.', '2003-06-20 21:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333432, 25202, 3976, '<td valign="top">Funny.  My only suggestion is to have your upper lip farther down, so we don''t see your real gums.</td>', 'Funny.  My only suggestion is to have your upper lip farther down, so we don''t see your real gums.', '2003-06-20 21:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(333433, 24661, 3976, '<td valign="top">dope!</td>', 'dope!', '2003-06-20 21:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333434, 25034, 6565, '<td valign="top">NIce dramatic lighting -- on my monitor, it almost looks like the photo was fuzzy and sharpened artificially instead of coming off the camera sharp.  Not sure why I get this impression.</td>', 'NIce dramatic lighting -- on my monitor, it almost looks like the photo was fuzzy and sharpened artificially instead of coming off the camera sharp.  Not sure why I get this impression.', '2003-06-20 21:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333435, 25207, 8298, '<td valign="top">very interesting</td>', 'very interesting', '2003-06-20 21:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(333436, 25078, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose, but the composition doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'Interesting pose, but the composition doesn''t do much for me.', '2003-06-20 21:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333437, 25176, 3976, '<td valign="top">you look distraught.</td>', 'you look distraught.', '2003-06-20 21:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(333439, 25103, 8298, '<td valign="top">party on raver</td>', 'party on raver', '2003-06-20 21:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333441, 24583, 3976, '<td valign="top">Cute pic.  Too bad it isn''t in focus.</td>', 'Cute pic.  Too bad it isn''t in focus.', '2003-06-20 21:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333442, 25285, 6565, '<td valign="top">I find the border a little distracting here, like it''s competing with other elements of the photo.  Nice pose, though. :)</td>', 'I find the border a little distracting here, like it''s competing with other elements of the photo.  Nice pose, though. :)', '2003-06-20 21:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(333443, 25296, 3976, '<td valign="top">how high was your camera off the ground.  i like the angle.</td>', 'how high was your camera off the ground.  i like the angle.', '2003-06-20 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(333444, 25093, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose -- takes the darkness a little too far for my taste, but that''s just a subjective thing.  I expect this photo to do pretty well!</td>', 'Interesting pose -- takes the darkness a little too far for my taste, but that''s just a subjective thing.  I expect this photo to do pretty well!', '2003-06-20 21:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333445, 25304, 8298, '<td valign="top">very well done</td>', 'very well done', '2003-06-20 21:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333446, 25163, 6565, '<td valign="top">The expressiveness in this photo is great!  Might have liked to see a plain background to give it a more studio feel.</td>', 'The expressiveness in this photo is great!  Might have liked to see a plain background to give it a more studio feel.', '2003-06-20 21:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(333447, 24625, 8298, '<td valign="top">very very nice</td>', 'very very nice', '2003-06-20 21:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333448, 25101, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very clever way to interpret the challenge!  Questions arise as to what is you, what photos you took, and whether it''s really technically a self-portrait.  But I like the composition and the artistic choices you''ve made!</td>', 'Very clever way to interpret the challenge!  Questions arise as to what is you, what photos you took, and whether it''s really technically a self-portrait.  But I like the composition and the artistic choices you''ve made!', '2003-06-20 21:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333450, 24818, 3976, '<td valign="top">Good stuff.  I''d like it more if the area by your right eye was completely dark, same with the hair behind your left hair.</td>', 'Good stuff.  I''d like it more if the area by your right eye was completely dark, same with the hair behind your left hair.', '2003-06-20 21:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333451, 25099, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice setting, but I don''t like the reflection of the camera in your sunglasses.</td>', 'Nice setting, but I don''t like the reflection of the camera in your sunglasses.', '2003-06-20 21:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(333452, 24593, 6565, '<td valign="top">Dramatic!  Love the choices of color, and because it''s done almost as an abstract, the darkness on the right is acceptable as an element.  I like!</td>', 'Dramatic!  Love the choices of color, and because it''s done almost as an abstract, the darkness on the right is acceptable as an element.  I like!', '2003-06-20 21:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(333453, 24676, 3976, '<td valign="top">huh?!</td>', 'huh?!', '2003-06-20 21:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(333454, 25303, 6565, '<td valign="top">Really creative interpretation!  I''d almost like to see the left edge cropped in, so that it''s completely without context.</td>', 'Really creative interpretation!  I''d almost like to see the left edge cropped in, so that it''s completely without context.', '2003-06-20 21:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333455, 25234, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of setting, how your hair mimics the plants next to you.  Or how the plants are mimicing your hair, whichever you prefer. :)</td>', 'I like your choice of setting, how your hair mimics the plants next to you.  Or how the plants are mimicing your hair, whichever you prefer. :)', '2003-06-20 21:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333456, 25227, 6565, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do a lot for me, primarily because of the distracting stuff on the upper right edge and the light artifacts on the left.  Will be interested to see the explanation of what the camera is pointing at, because I can''t tell if it''s a photo, a painting, a mirror or what.</td>', 'This doesn''t do a lot for me, primarily because of the distracting stuff on the upper right edge and the light artifacts on the left.  Will be interested to see the explanation of what the camera is pointing at, because I can''t tell if it''s a photo, a painting, a mirror or what.', '2003-06-20 21:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333457, 24625, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the ringlets!  Face is a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'Great capture of the ringlets!  Face is a bit over-exposed.', '2003-06-20 21:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(333460, 25229, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract!  Love the shapes and light effects!  Very nice!</td>', 'Nice abstract!  Love the shapes and light effects!  Very nice!', '2003-06-20 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333461, 25086, 6565, '<td valign="top">Good expression, but I find the white on the right too over-exposed.</td>', 'Good expression, but I find the white on the right too over-exposed.', '2003-06-20 21:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333463, 25059, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very retro!  Graininess I can''t decide if I like or not in this image.  Might work better with a retro style processing as well, B&amp;W with really high contrast but no graininess.</td>', 'Very retro!  Graininess I can''t decide if I like or not in this image.  Might work better with a retro style processing as well, B&W with really high contrast but no graininess.', '2003-06-20 21:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333464, 25232, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is an unusal way to crop it, not sure it''s working because the amount of white space on the left is almost equal to what''s missing on the right, therefore making it look like it COULD have been a mistake rather than deliberate.</td>', 'This is an unusal way to crop it, not sure it''s working because the amount of white space on the left is almost equal to what''s missing on the right, therefore making it look like it COULD have been a mistake rather than deliberate.', '2003-06-20 21:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333465, 25122, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great expression!  Very captivating.  Might want to see the saturation or something pumped up, because the softness of the image doesn''t match the intensity of the expression to me.</td>', 'Great expression!  Very captivating.  Might want to see the saturation or something pumped up, because the softness of the image doesn''t match the intensity of the expression to me.', '2003-06-20 21:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(333466, 25167, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of light and dark, almost yin-yang in form.</td>', 'Interesting use of light and dark, almost yin-yang in form.', '2003-06-20 21:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333467, 25290, 6565, '<td valign="top">Cute, if a little unsettling... the darks aren''t dark enough, in my opinion.</td>', 'Cute, if a little unsettling... the darks aren''t dark enough, in my opinion.', '2003-06-20 21:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(333468, 25284, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow, great lighting.  Ominous feeling!</td>', 'Wow, great lighting.  Ominous feeling!', '2003-06-20 21:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(333470, 25177, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of the white in the lower-right and the black in the upper-left.  Feels like it might be a tiny bit too muted -- more contrast?</td>', 'I like the contrast of the white in the lower-right and the black in the upper-left.  Feels like it might be a tiny bit too muted -- more contrast?', '2003-06-20 21:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333471, 25262, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice, but feels a bit snapshotty to me.  Would like to see it zoomed in on your face and the baby, cut off just under your arms (no offense to the other kid!) because this has too much information in it, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice, but feels a bit snapshotty to me.  Would like to see it zoomed in on your face and the baby, cut off just under your arms (no offense to the other kid!) because this has too much information in it, in my opinion.', '2003-06-20 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333472, 24746, 6565, '<td valign="top">A bit blurry, and I don''t know what the stuff on the left adds.  Maybe crop to just your face?</td>', 'A bit blurry, and I don''t know what the stuff on the left adds.  Maybe crop to just your face?', '2003-06-20 21:50:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(333473, 25140, 6565, '<td valign="top">Creative, definitely.  Nice color and everything, not sure whether it counts as a self-portrait or not -- guess that''s up to the voters.</td>', 'Creative, definitely.  Nice color and everything, not sure whether it counts as a self-portrait or not -- guess that''s up to the voters.', '2003-06-20 21:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333474, 24684, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting!  Would have liked to see the hand in focus as well, to get an extra point. :)</td>', 'Interesting!  Would have liked to see the hand in focus as well, to get an extra point. :)', '2003-06-20 21:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333475, 24604, 6565, '<td valign="top">Blurry, and the composition doesn''t do a lot for me.  Can''t tell if it''s a stud under your lip, or something behind you.  If it''s a stud, why not focus more on that aspect of yourself and shoot to feature it directly!</td>', 'Blurry, and the composition doesn''t do a lot for me.  Can''t tell if it''s a stud under your lip, or something behind you.  If it''s a stud, why not focus more on that aspect of yourself and shoot to feature it directly!', '2003-06-20 21:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333476, 25166, 6565, '<td valign="top">Light at the window is washed out, but the movement is great and I love the spectator!</td>', 'Light at the window is washed out, but the movement is great and I love the spectator!', '2003-06-20 21:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333483, 25110, 6565, '<td valign="top">Foreground feels a touch blurry, and in my opinion the shirt is too informal for such a formal pose and lighting setup.  But I like the overall composition!</td>', 'Foreground feels a touch blurry, and in my opinion the shirt is too informal for such a formal pose and lighting setup.  But I like the overall composition!', '2003-06-20 22:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333485, 24638, 6565, '<td valign="top">Feels like there''s not enough contrast to me -- no full white and the blacks near the bottom blend together.</td>', 'Feels like there''s not enough contrast to me -- no full white and the blacks near the bottom blend together.', '2003-06-20 22:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333488, 25123, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love it!  When it was loading I was thinking "please make the words say something and not just be random!  The color in the print is great, the expression, everything!  Nice!</td>', 'I love it!  When it was loading I was thinking "please make the words say something and not just be random!  The color in the print is great, the expression, everything!  Nice!', '2003-06-20 22:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333489, 24667, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the expression -- looks like you''re in conversation with someone.  It''s a little snapshotty, the lighting and background look kind of unremarkable, but it''s overall a clean shot.</td>', 'I like the expression -- looks like you''re in conversation with someone.  It''s a little snapshotty, the lighting and background look kind of unremarkable, but it''s overall a clean shot.', '2003-06-20 22:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(333491, 25237, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, would have looked for it to be a bit sharper.</td>', 'I love the composition, would have looked for it to be a bit sharper.', '2003-06-20 22:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333492, 25055, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light, if a bit over-exposed on that side.</td>', 'Nice use of light, if a bit over-exposed on that side.', '2003-06-20 22:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333493, 25282, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of it, and the fact that the light doesn''t feel artificial.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of it, and the fact that the light doesn''t feel artificial.', '2003-06-20 22:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333494, 25192, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and concept!  Not sure if the tilted angle is necessary.</td>', 'Nice pose and concept!  Not sure if the tilted angle is necessary.', '2003-06-20 22:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(333495, 25257, 6565, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that Wyeth painting (wasn''t that Wyeth?) with the woman in the field and the house in the distance.  I think it would really add something to be able to see the horizon.</td>', 'Reminds me of that Wyeth painting (wasn''t that Wyeth?) with the woman in the field and the house in the distance.  I think it would really add something to be able to see the horizon.', '2003-06-20 22:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333496, 25247, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wait a minute - this is the other side!!!  I still like the flowers, and I like the closed eyes.  I love seeing real people in pictures!</td>', 'Wait a minute - this is the other side!!!  I still like the flowers, and I like the closed eyes.  I love seeing real people in pictures!', '2003-06-20 22:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(333498, 25103, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Nice smile too.  ~7</td>', 'Very nice!  Nice smile too.  ~7', '2003-06-20 22:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(333499, 25181, 6565, '<td valign="top">I guess my question would be did you take those photos?  If not, I''m not sure how much it counts as a "self-portrait"</td>', 'I guess my question would be did you take those photos?  If not, I''m not sure how much it counts as a "self-portrait"', '2003-06-20 22:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333500, 25197, 6565, '<td valign="top">Feels like the hat is cut off too much, needs to be cropped higher.</td>', 'Feels like the hat is cut off too much, needs to be cropped higher.', '2003-06-20 22:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333501, 24994, 5112, '<td valign="top">"Blue" as in "sad"?  I kinda wish I could see the face a bit.</td>', '"Blue" as in "sad"?  I kinda wish I could see the face a bit.', '2003-06-20 22:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333502, 25144, 6565, '<td valign="top">Love the pose, would love to lose the lightbulb from the top but it would crop your hands out to do that.  Maybe shoot from lower to fix that?</td>', 'Love the pose, would love to lose the lightbulb from the top but it would crop your hands out to do that.  Maybe shoot from lower to fix that?', '2003-06-20 22:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333503, 24667, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice self-portrait!  Blue and silver really suit you well.  I like the smile.  ~7</td>', 'Nice self-portrait!  Blue and silver really suit you well.  I like the smile.  ~7', '2003-06-20 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(333504, 24596, 6565, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t do a lot for me, because I don''t feel like it really tells me much about you.</td>', 'This doesn''t do a lot for me, because I don''t feel like it really tells me much about you.', '2003-06-20 22:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(333506, 24769, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting texture in the negative space, adds something.  Shoulder''s a little bit washed out.</td>', 'Interesting texture in the negative space, adds something.  Shoulder''s a little bit washed out.', '2003-06-20 22:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333507, 25262, 5112, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like it how all three of you have your eyes closed.  The baby is beautiful!  I like self-portraits that give an idea of what the person is like, and this one does.</td>', 'Nice!  I like it how all three of you have your eyes closed.  The baby is beautiful!  I like self-portraits that give an idea of what the person is like, and this one does.', '2003-06-20 22:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333508, 25214, 6565, '<td valign="top">Can''t really tell (other from the title) what''s reflected in your eye -- would crop with more of the upper lid showing.</td>', 'Can''t really tell (other from the title) what''s reflected in your eye -- would crop with more of the upper lid showing.', '2003-06-20 22:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(333509, 25042, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the expression and the fall of your hair, but the left edge looks too overexposed to me.</td>', 'I like the expression and the fall of your hair, but the left edge looks too overexposed to me.', '2003-06-20 22:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333514, 24737, 6565, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what I''m looking at here... it might make sense, but not to me.</td>', 'I have no idea what I''m looking at here... it might make sense, but not to me.', '2003-06-20 22:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333515, 25289, 6565, '<td valign="top">Good expression.</td>', 'Good expression.', '2003-06-20 22:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333517, 24743, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, and the towel looks clean and sharp, but the other elements look blurry.</td>', 'Nice idea, and the towel looks clean and sharp, but the other elements look blurry.', '2003-06-20 22:26:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333519, 25276, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the softness of this, how it looks almost like a charcoal drawing.  That one wisp of hair out of place is my only gripe.  Very nice image!</td>', 'I like the softness of this, how it looks almost like a charcoal drawing.  That one wisp of hair out of place is my only gripe.  Very nice image!', '2003-06-20 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(333521, 25296, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective and composition!</td>', 'Interesting perspective and composition!', '2003-06-20 22:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333523, 24818, 6565, '<td valign="top">Creative use of light and expression!  Would crop in from the right, since that area doesn''t appear to add anything.</td>', 'Creative use of light and expression!  Would crop in from the right, since that area doesn''t appear to add anything.', '2003-06-20 22:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333524, 25119, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, but the lens is dirty! LOL</td>', 'interesting shot, but the lens is dirty! LOL', '2003-06-20 22:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333525, 25272, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the use of frame.</td>', 'I like the pose and the use of frame.', '2003-06-20 22:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
