(333559, 25243, 9331, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - but I found that the face with the glasses was more prominent than the reflection, so not making it clear that the reflection was the self portrait</td>', 'Interesting shot - but I found that the face with the glasses was more prominent than the reflection, so not making it clear that the reflection was the self portrait', '2003-06-20 23:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
