(333565, 25057, 9331, '<td valign="top">I do like the idea of this photo, but not really sure it fits the "self portrait" title (not in the traditional sense anyway). The top of the pawn being out of focus detracted a bit as well</td>', 'I do like the idea of this photo, but not really sure it fits the "self portrait" title (not in the traditional sense anyway). The top of the pawn being out of focus detracted a bit as well', '2003-06-20 23:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333566, 25199, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well done. The collor as a highlight is very nice. Lighting is very good.</td>', 'Well done. The collor as a highlight is very nice. Lighting is very good.', '2003-06-20 23:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333567, 24733, 9331, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I find because of the slight angle of the head, that the shadow across the top doesn''t look quite right. Maybe I would have lowered the light or change the angle a little, to get a nice symmetrical shadow</td>', 'Nice shot, but I find because of the slight angle of the head, that the shadow across the top doesn''t look quite right. Maybe I would have lowered the light or change the angle a little, to get a nice symmetrical shadow', '2003-06-20 23:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333570, 25229, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very interesting use of light and shadow</td>', 'Very interesting use of light and shadow', '2003-06-20 23:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(333571, 24723, 6325, '<td valign="top">Stunning effect with the high contrast. Lots of stuff to look at. But please don''t bite me.</td>', 'Stunning effect with the high contrast. Lots of stuff to look at. But please don''t bite me.', '2003-06-20 23:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333572, 24604, 9331, '<td valign="top">I found this photo was taken a bit too close. The focus wasn''t quite right and the over exposed area to the right of the face detracted from the image</td>', 'I found this photo was taken a bit too close. The focus wasn''t quite right and the over exposed area to the right of the face detracted from the image', '2003-06-20 23:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333573, 25249, 9331, '<td valign="top">Bizzare :) But very effective</td>', 'Bizzare :) But very effective', '2003-06-20 23:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333574, 25123, 765, '<td valign="top">I like this. Very creative.</td>', 'I like this. Very creative.', '2003-06-20 23:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333575, 24882, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good job of the lighting to emphasize the tattoos. Very good.</td>', 'Good job of the lighting to emphasize the tattoos. Very good.', '2003-06-20 23:26:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(333576, 25047, 9331, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but there''s nothing that makes this photo stand out from the others. Would have been nice to see the background a bit more level as well</td>', 'A nice shot, but there''s nothing that makes this photo stand out from the others. Would have been nice to see the background a bit more level as well', '2003-06-20 23:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333578, 25212, 9331, '<td valign="top">To start with, I think you really need to be in a self portrait, for it to be called one. Apart from that, this is a highly original photo. Very intriguing. Perhaps the background is a bit too dark, and I also would have trimmed off the door frame on the right, as its a bit distracting</td>', 'To start with, I think you really need to be in a self portrait, for it to be called one. Apart from that, this is a highly original photo. Very intriguing. Perhaps the background is a bit too dark, and I also would have trimmed off the door frame on the right, as its a bit distracting', '2003-06-20 23:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(333579, 24922, 9331, '<td valign="top">A very nice shot and a well composed image</td>', 'A very nice shot and a well composed image', '2003-06-20 23:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333581, 25276, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good execution of the soft effect - especially on the right arm in the the hair. The face and neck are lighted perfectly to show the features, but not make them harsh.</td>', 'Good execution of the soft effect - especially on the right arm in the the hair. The face and neck are lighted perfectly to show the features, but not make them harsh.', '2003-06-20 23:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(333582, 24885, 9331, '<td valign="top">I think this would have made a nice high contrast shot - but as it is, I can''t help but feel its a little too high. Nicely composed though</td>', 'I think this would have made a nice high contrast shot - but as it is, I can''t help but feel its a little too high. Nicely composed though', '2003-06-20 23:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333583, 25189, 9331, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, not really bright enough and a bit too grainy. I''m not sure if the grain was added to the image on purpose, but if it was it doesn''t really add much to the picture. Apart from that, the composition of this photo is very good</td>', 'Unfortunately, not really bright enough and a bit too grainy. I''m not sure if the grain was added to the image on purpose, but if it was it doesn''t really add much to the picture. Apart from that, the composition of this photo is very good', '2003-06-20 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333585, 25166, 9331, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - but the inclusion of two people makes it difficult to determine who the self portrait is of. Perhaps a lighter shirt should have been worn for the shot as it doesn''t make you stand out from the background, and because of the darkness, the light from the window is overexposed and appears a bit too harsh</td>', 'Interesting shot - but the inclusion of two people makes it difficult to determine who the self portrait is of. Perhaps a lighter shirt should have been worn for the shot as it doesn''t make you stand out from the background, and because of the darkness, the light from the window is overexposed and appears a bit too harsh', '2003-06-20 23:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(333588, 24769, 6325, '<td valign="top">Really like the tones in this picture. The offset is a good touch, but I think you went just a little too far. Still very good.</td>', 'Really like the tones in this picture. The offset is a good touch, but I think you went just a little too far. Still very good.', '2003-06-20 23:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333589, 24638, 9331, '<td valign="top">The leaf at the left is a bit distracting, but unfortunately the overall feel I get is that there wasn'' much pre-planning put into this one. It feels as if you just sat down on a couch and took a pic. I like the fact that you have a dark shirt on with a dark couch, but if you had a black background as well, then all focus would be given to your face and this would have been a much more interesting shot</td>', 'The leaf at the left is a bit distracting, but unfortunately the overall feel I get is that there wasn'' much pre-planning put into this one. It feels as if you just sat down on a couch and took a pic. I like the fact that you have a dark shirt on with a dark couch, but if you had a black background as well, then all focus would be given to your face and this would have been a much more interesting shot', '2003-06-20 23:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(333593, 24589, 9331, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favourite shots - the framing with the hands is very effective, as is the texture white background to your left and the dark space to your right. Great photo and fits the challenge very well. Kudos !!</td>', 'This is one of my favourite shots - the framing with the hands is very effective, as is the texture white background to your left and the dark space to your right. Great photo and fits the challenge very well. Kudos !!', '2003-06-20 23:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(333595, 24676, 6325, '<td valign="top">You must be pretty good at billiards to set up this shot.</td>', 'You must be pretty good at billiards to set up this shot.', '2003-06-20 23:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333601, 25140, 8056, '<td valign="top">This effect is incredible, and without any doubt, this is under self-portrait. Self portrait photograph doesn''t mean must be a FACE or LOOK, is all about you, and about yourself. This pic stand out from the rest of pic,because this pic are telling us about his anger to us. Sorry for saying this, I glanced through all the submissions, only this pic hook me at here. Creativity winner!!! I gave a 10</td>', 'This effect is incredible, and without any doubt, this is under self-portrait. Self portrait photograph doesn''t mean must be a FACE or LOOK, is all about you, and about yourself. This pic stand out from the rest of pic,because this pic are telling us about his anger to us. Sorry for saying this, I glanced through all the submissions, only this pic hook me at here. Creativity winner!!! I gave a 10', '2003-06-20 23:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(333603, 25247, 5822, '<td valign="top">Now I get it! Very nice, romantic idea...and well done too...<br/>Now I have to find your wives picture and revise my score... :)</td>', 'Now I get it! Very nice, romantic idea...and well done too...Now I have to find your wives picture and revise my score... :)', '2003-06-20 23:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
