(333620, 24709, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like your pose, gaze and the lighting and the way you''ve captured the candle.  Good detail in your hair, beard and skin and I like the way you''ve used negative space.  I also like the very impressive 3 dimensional look of your face...it really pops out. Nothing much I can say to improve this photo. Very engaging image and very well done. 10</td>', 'I like your pose, gaze and the lighting and the way you''ve captured the candle.  Good detail in your hair, beard and skin and I like the way you''ve used negative space.  I also like the very impressive 3 dimensional look of your face...it really pops out. Nothing much I can say to improve this photo. Very engaging image and very well done. 10', '2003-06-21 00:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333621, 24928, 8056, '<td valign="top">wow, how to make this effect? by shaking ur cam? or this is a force of evil? 6</td>', 'wow, how to make this effect? by shaking ur cam? or this is a force of evil? 6', '2003-06-21 00:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(333623, 25279, 9331, '<td valign="top">It''s such a pity that you weren''t able to keep the camera perfectly still on yourself while taking this photo, because the idea is just great with the spinning background.</td>', 'It''s such a pity that you weren''t able to keep the camera perfectly still on yourself while taking this photo, because the idea is just great with the spinning background.', '2003-06-21 00:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333624, 25196, 9331, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, and very good portraiture - but I find the green cast on the face a bit distracting</td>', 'Nice composition, and very good portraiture - but I find the green cast on the face a bit distracting', '2003-06-21 00:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(333625, 25309, 9331, '<td valign="top">There''s a bit too much hair covering your face in this photo and I''m not able to get a good feeling for who you are (ie the hair is hiding your facial expressions). It also has too much red in it for my liking. If the hair had of been swept back, so we could see your mouth and the colour corrected, this would have been a very good shot</td>', 'There''s a bit too much hair covering your face in this photo and I''m not able to get a good feeling for who you are (ie the hair is hiding your facial expressions). It also has too much red in it for my liking. If the hair had of been swept back, so we could see your mouth and the colour corrected, this would have been a very good shot', '2003-06-21 00:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(333626, 25122, 9331, '<td valign="top">Bit too grainy and the light is a bit harsh - but the touch of colour and the sultry look are winners</td>', 'Bit too grainy and the light is a bit harsh - but the touch of colour and the sultry look are winners', '2003-06-21 00:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333628, 25305, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done - the high contrast works well here and the composition works extremely well</td>', 'Very nicely done - the high contrast works well here and the composition works extremely well', '2003-06-21 00:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(333630, 25275, 1897, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture, lovely coloration.  This is a real keepers</td>', 'Very nice picture, lovely coloration.  This is a real keepers', '2003-06-21 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333632, 25029, 9331, '<td valign="top">The framing makes this a very interesting shot - but I''m not sure how you did this as a self portrait. It will be interesting to hear how you did. I''m assuming it was done by self timer, and will rate it as such. I find that if a few cm are trimmed from the top of this, that photo works much better</td>', 'The framing makes this a very interesting shot - but I''m not sure how you did this as a self portrait. It will be interesting to hear how you did. I''m assuming it was done by self timer, and will rate it as such. I find that if a few cm are trimmed from the top of this, that photo works much better', '2003-06-21 00:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333634, 25272, 1897, '<td valign="top">the bra is a little overexposed (no pun intended) but is it a very nice pose and framing.</td>', 'the bra is a little overexposed (no pun intended) but is it a very nice pose and framing.', '2003-06-21 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(333635, 25261, 1897, '<td valign="top">I  really like the pose, and the black and white, but it is a little washed out for me.</td>', 'I  really like the pose, and the black and white, but it is a little washed out for me.', '2003-06-21 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333636, 24557, 1897, '<td valign="top">I like this, nice and abstract</td>', 'I like this, nice and abstract', '2003-06-21 00:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333637, 25199, 1897, '<td valign="top">well done.</td>', 'well done.', '2003-06-21 00:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333639, 25298, 9331, '<td valign="top">A classically elegant self portrait and one I''m sure you''ll be gald to have of yourself. The addition of the flower sets this off nicely and doesn''t take too much focus away from your face, which is the main point of interest in a self portrait. However, the background is a bit muddled. If I was you I''d take this shot again with a more suitable background, as you''ve captured yourself very nicely here. I also like the soft focus, but almost feels its a bit too soft</td>', 'A classically elegant self portrait and one I''m sure you''ll be gald to have of yourself. The addition of the flower sets this off nicely and doesn''t take too much focus away from your face, which is the main point of interest in a self portrait. However, the background is a bit muddled. If I was you I''d take this shot again with a more suitable background, as you''ve captured yourself very nicely here. I also like the soft focus, but almost feels its a bit too soft', '2003-06-21 00:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333640, 24767, 1897, '<td valign="top">this affect does not work for me, but otherwise I like the shot.</td>', 'this affect does not work for me, but otherwise I like the shot.', '2003-06-21 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(333641, 25105, 1897, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2003-06-21 00:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333642, 24800, 1897, '<td valign="top">you could have also titled this "say hello to my little friend"</td>', 'you could have also titled this "say hello to my little friend"', '2003-06-21 00:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333643, 24625, 9331, '<td valign="top">I''m in two minds about this one. At first I just thought there was too much light on your face, but then on closer inspection, it appears you''ve actually whitened it (with makeup?) as the skin on your arms and eyelid aren''t showing this whiteness. Because of this, the photo appears a bit odd, although it does give focus to your eyes nose and mouth (so that part of it works well). The lighting on the hair is also great and I find that if I hide the part of the photo just below the chin, that this works much better for me. I''ve given you good marks though as it''s something different and you''ve obviously gone to a lot of trouble to set this up</td>', 'I''m in two minds about this one. At first I just thought there was too much light on your face, but then on closer inspection, it appears you''ve actually whitened it (with makeup?) as the skin on your arms and eyelid aren''t showing this whiteness. Because of this, the photo appears a bit odd, although it does give focus to your eyes nose and mouth (so that part of it works well). The lighting on the hair is also great and I find that if I hide the part of the photo just below the chin, that this works much better for me. I''ve given you good marks though as it''s something different and you''ve obviously gone to a lot of trouble to set this up', '2003-06-21 00:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(333645, 25270, 1897, '<td valign="top">the is a great self portrait,  I love the expression you captured.  The eyes are excellent</td>', 'the is a great self portrait,  I love the expression you captured.  The eyes are excellent', '2003-06-21 00:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333646, 24928, 9331, '<td valign="top">Fascintaing. I can''t wait to hear how you did this and the light beam being traced in your eye is phenomenal. One of the more intriguing shots posted and I find the overall effect works very well. Good one !!</td>', 'Fascintaing. I can''t wait to hear how you did this and the light beam being traced in your eye is phenomenal. One of the more intriguing shots posted and I find the overall effect works very well. Good one !!', '2003-06-21 00:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333648, 25059, 9331, '<td valign="top">I''ve given you marks for orginality, but the overall shot is very poor - almost seems to have been made with a cheap web cam. The placement of your had and the right wall is a bit distracting - it almost seems that you''re trying to push the wall and this is where all my attention gets focussed</td>', 'I''ve given you marks for orginality, but the overall shot is very poor - almost seems to have been made with a cheap web cam. The placement of your had and the right wall is a bit distracting - it almost seems that you''re trying to push the wall and this is where all my attention gets focussed', '2003-06-21 00:38:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(333649, 25144, 1897, '<td valign="top">I can actually get some detail in the face if I turn my monitor up, was this supposed to be a silohette?  It looks great as one.</td>', 'I can actually get some detail in the face if I turn my monitor up, was this supposed to be a silohette?  It looks great as one.', '2003-06-21 00:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333651, 24686, 9331, '<td valign="top">Excellently done. The side profile here is perfect, as is the lighting and focus. Congratulations - great shot !</td>', 'Excellently done. The side profile here is perfect, as is the lighting and focus. Congratulations - great shot !', '2003-06-21 00:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(333652, 25189, 9241, '<td valign="top">wish i could see more detail</td>', 'wish i could see more detail', '2003-06-21 00:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(333654, 25020, 9241, '<td valign="top">been there myself! i think i might like it more flipped 180</td>', 'been there myself! i think i might like it more flipped 180', '2003-06-21 00:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333655, 24981, 9331, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred for a self portrait, for you to take up a bit more of the image, but apart from that, this pic is hard to fault, the composition lighting and angle all work extremely well. It''s the kind of shot you would see on an artists CD album cover and as such I find this works really well.</td>', 'Would have preferred for a self portrait, for you to take up a bit more of the image, but apart from that, this pic is hard to fault, the composition lighting and angle all work extremely well. It''s the kind of shot you would see on an artists CD album cover and as such I find this works really well.', '2003-06-21 00:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333656, 25236, 9241, '<td valign="top">very original- 8</td>', 'very original- 8', '2003-06-21 00:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(333658, 24889, 9241, '<td valign="top">Hey thats only the first glance, I miss your face in this, but get your point.  6</td>', 'Hey thats only the first glance, I miss your face in this, but get your point.  6', '2003-06-21 00:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333659, 25263, 9331, '<td valign="top">Had a big night huh :) Would have preferred to see the bottle at a bit more of an angle, as it doesn''t really look like you''re drinking from it and gives a "staged" look to the photo. Focus and brightness could have been a bit better, but a very interesting take on the "self portrait" idea</td>', 'Had a big night huh :) Would have preferred to see the bottle at a bit more of an angle, as it doesn''t really look like you''re drinking from it and gives a "staged" look to the photo. Focus and brightness could have been a bit better, but a very interesting take on the "self portrait" idea', '2003-06-21 00:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333663, 24843, 9331, '<td valign="top">I really like the symmetry of you and your shadow in this as such the composition works really well, but I just don''t find that the lighting on your face quite right. I''m not sure why that is, but it could be because of the strand of hair running down across your face</td>', 'I really like the symmetry of you and your shadow in this as such the composition works really well, but I just don''t find that the lighting on your face quite right. I''m not sure why that is, but it could be because of the strand of hair running down across your face', '2003-06-21 00:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333671, 25282, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great shot, especially with the lighting - but I think this would have worked better if you had of either trimmed off a few cm from the top, so that your eyes and lips matched the "rule of thirds" idea. If you make this into a square shape, I think you''ll see what I mean. Either that or I would have not trimmed the shot off so close to your chin - it just feels a bit unbalanced or "top heavy" as it is</td>', 'Great shot, especially with the lighting - but I think this would have worked better if you had of either trimmed off a few cm from the top, so that your eyes and lips matched the "rule of thirds" idea. If you make this into a square shape, I think you''ll see what I mean. Either that or I would have not trimmed the shot off so close to your chin - it just feels a bit unbalanced or "top heavy" as it is', '2003-06-21 01:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333672, 25101, 9241, '<td valign="top">very original</td>', 'very original', '2003-06-21 01:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
