(333676, 24820, 9241, '<td valign="top">just a little to bright for me, but i like the white on white with your dark hair</td>', 'just a little to bright for me, but i like the white on white with your dark hair', '2003-06-21 01:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333677, 25096, 3080, '<td valign="top">Should I comment, or just wait till I pull it in CC? lol<br/>I''ll say that I know you have some beautiful eyes, and they color of your eyes is mezmorizing.  Why you chose to hide them, I''ll never know.  There are 2 strands of hair that looked like they were placed over the eyes to hide it.  That bothers me a lot, especially since I know how bright they are.<br/>the angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting is also good. Nice skin tones.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Should I comment, or just wait till I pull it in CC? lolI''ll say that I know you have some beautiful eyes, and they color of your eyes is mezmorizing.  Why you chose to hide them, I''ll never know.  There are 2 strands of hair that looked like they were placed over the eyes to hide it.  That bothers me a lot, especially since I know how bright they are.the angle and framing/cropping are good.  Lighting is also good. Nice skin tones.~Heather~', '2003-06-21 01:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(333678, 25179, 9331, '<td valign="top">Ok - how did you do this? I sure hope that''s a remote in your left hand :) Assuming this is a self portrait (ie you did take the photo yourself), then this is an awesome photo. The appearance of the leg growing from your head and the symmetry of the limbs are just great. Focus is good too, but a pity that your arm is blurred</td>', 'Ok - how did you do this? I sure hope that''s a remote in your left hand :) Assuming this is a self portrait (ie you did take the photo yourself), then this is an awesome photo. The appearance of the leg growing from your head and the symmetry of the limbs are just great. Focus is good too, but a pity that your arm is blurred', '2003-06-21 01:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333680, 25214, 9331, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling from the title, that we''re supposed to be seeing a reflection of a desk in your eye - unfortunately, it''s not quite clear enough. Nice focus though, but it just seems to lack in expressing itself</td>', 'I have a feeling from the title, that we''re supposed to be seeing a reflection of a desk in your eye - unfortunately, it''s not quite clear enough. Nice focus though, but it just seems to lack in expressing itself', '2003-06-21 01:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333682, 25247, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great shot , great colours, great emotion. I would have had part of her face visible though as the image of nothing but hair is the only distracting part of this photo.</td>', 'Great shot , great colours, great emotion. I would have had part of her face visible though as the image of nothing but hair is the only distracting part of this photo.', '2003-06-21 01:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333683, 25103, 9241, '<td valign="top">cool effects..and it loks like you had fun too</td>', 'cool effects..and it loks like you had fun too', '2003-06-21 01:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333684, 25201, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately different.  Actually, I was surprised to see the ammount of green people here, but I still think it''s original.  The purple eye bothers me a bit.  And looking stright up your nose isn''t the view I would prefer.  However, I do think it''s nicely framed.  Focus also seems good. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately different.  Actually, I was surprised to see the ammount of green people here, but I still think it''s original.  The purple eye bothers me a bit.  And looking stright up your nose isn''t the view I would prefer.  However, I do think it''s nicely framed.  Focus also seems good. ~Heather~', '2003-06-21 01:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(333685, 24838, 8056, '<td valign="top">i like the fading effect and the sadness of the face through the light bulb. 7</td>', 'i like the fading effect and the sadness of the face through the light bulb. 7', '2003-06-21 01:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(333687, 25243, 3080, '<td valign="top">I am totally not impressed by the row of port-o-potties in the background.  This looks like it was taken at a fair or something.  Maybe if you had taken it with a better background, it would have been more appealing.  Also, the glasses look like the have some smudges on them that are a bit distracting as well.  I can see you, and definately get a sense of what you look like.  The shot also shows personality as well.  my only real complaint is the background.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'I am totally not impressed by the row of port-o-potties in the background.  This looks like it was taken at a fair or something.  Maybe if you had taken it with a better background, it would have been more appealing.  Also, the glasses look like the have some smudges on them that are a bit distracting as well.  I can see you, and definately get a sense of what you look like.  The shot also shows personality as well.  my only real complaint is the background.~Heather~', '2003-06-21 01:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(333688, 25037, 9241, '<td valign="top">very nice, very brave</td>', 'very nice, very brave', '2003-06-21 01:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
