(333691, 25249, 9241, '<td valign="top">and blue freckles</td>', 'and blue freckles', '2003-06-21 01:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(333693, 25296, 9331, '<td valign="top">Excellently done - very little to fault here and I''ve placed this in my top 3<br/>You''ve used the wide angle lens here to perfect effect. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t get some sort of ribbon and even if it doesn''t it won''t be far off. Well done</td>', 'Excellently done - very little to fault here and I''ve placed this in my top 3You''ve used the wide angle lens here to perfect effect. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t get some sort of ribbon and even if it doesn''t it won''t be far off. Well done', '2003-06-21 01:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(333694, 25262, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately makes me smile.  Good shot, and focus is good as well.  I wish that fuzzy animal wasn''t right near your head.  I find that a bit bothersome.  Smooth pulling it off without waking the baby. :)<br/>Lighting is really good for this shot.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  We can see your face really well, and even the precious babys face.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Definately makes me smile.  Good shot, and focus is good as well.  I wish that fuzzy animal wasn''t right near your head.  I find that a bit bothersome.  Smooth pulling it off without waking the baby. :)Lighting is really good for this shot.  No distracting shadows or bright spots.  We can see your face really well, and even the precious babys face.~Heather~', '2003-06-21 01:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(333697, 25188, 9331, '<td valign="top">Too funny - I''m sure you''ll get a lot of comments on the finger up the nose. Yep it''s disgusting, but it makes this picture highly memorable and certainly unique and as such deserves high marks. Well done</td>', 'Too funny - I''m sure you''ll get a lot of comments on the finger up the nose. Yep it''s disgusting, but it makes this picture highly memorable and certainly unique and as such deserves high marks. Well done', '2003-06-21 01:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333698, 24596, 9241, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the efffect. wish I could see some of you in this</td>', 'I like the idea and the efffect. wish I could see some of you in this', '2003-06-21 01:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333699, 25249, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really the most appealing of effects, but definately different.  I can''t really find a sharp focus in here.  Looks like maybe on your nose, but the effect kills any focus that might be here.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  Just doesn''t really appeal much to me.  You''re forhead looks like it''s trying to direct airplane traffic or something.  really way too bright.</td>', 'Not really the most appealing of effects, but definately different.  I can''t really find a sharp focus in here.  Looks like maybe on your nose, but the effect kills any focus that might be here.  I think the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  Just doesn''t really appeal much to me.  You''re forhead looks like it''s trying to direct airplane traffic or something.  really way too bright.', '2003-06-21 01:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333700, 24885, 9241, '<td valign="top">very white. I''d like too see better lighting on you</td>', 'very white. I''d like too see better lighting on you', '2003-06-21 01:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(333701, 25119, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very creative and unique. That''s what I like to see in a photo, someone using their imagintaion in a photo challenge - it really looks like you''re trapped inside the camera</td>', 'Very creative and unique. That''s what I like to see in a photo, someone using their imagintaion in a photo challenge - it really looks like you''re trapped inside the camera', '2003-06-21 01:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(333703, 25029, 9241, '<td valign="top">nice framing.</td>', 'nice framing.', '2003-06-21 01:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333705, 25275, 9241, '<td valign="top">Great lighting,great smile. Shows alot of who you are..9</td>', 'Great lighting,great smile. Shows alot of who you are..9', '2003-06-21 01:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333708, 24650, 9331, '<td valign="top">Oh wow :) So there''s two of these pics. I like the composition of your other half''s photo a bit better than this - I think the flowers work better in the other shot.<br/>I''d love to see the two of these photos joined together. Maybe you can do that for us after the challenge, so we can see what it would look like - as it would make a fantastic photo to be framed in your house. Well done and congrats on the unique idea you two had.</td>', 'Oh wow :) So there''s two of these pics. I like the composition of your other half''s photo a bit better than this - I think the flowers work better in the other shot.I''d love to see the two of these photos joined together. Maybe you can do that for us after the challenge, so we can see what it would look like - as it would make a fantastic photo to be framed in your house. Well done and congrats on the unique idea you two had.', '2003-06-21 01:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(333710, 24989, 3080, '<td valign="top">It looks like you are looking in a mirror, trying to see if you have a bald spot.  The answer?  it''s all there.  :)<br/>Looks good.  I like the angle and the framing/cropping are good too.  Your chin looks like it''s squished on something, or it''s covered in shadow.  Looks a little strange.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'It looks like you are looking in a mirror, trying to see if you have a bald spot.  The answer?  it''s all there.  :)Looks good.  I like the angle and the framing/cropping are good too.  Your chin looks like it''s squished on something, or it''s covered in shadow.  Looks a little strange.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-21 01:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(333711, 25101, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very clever. I can''t mark this down, as you do have your self portrait shot in it, and this shot just works so well.</td>', 'Very clever. I can''t mark this down, as you do have your self portrait shot in it, and this shot just works so well.', '2003-06-21 01:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
