(333731, 24994, 9331, '<td valign="top">Sorry - this image just doesn''t work for me at all. Contrast is too high, so we''re left with very little detail. It would make an interesting shot for a CD album cover, but as a self portrait I don''t find this succeeds. Also the lone dot near the centre just seems odd</td>', 'Sorry - this image just doesn''t work for me at all. Contrast is too high, so we''re left with very little detail. It would make an interesting shot for a CD album cover, but as a self portrait I don''t find this succeeds. Also the lone dot near the centre just seems odd', '2003-06-21 01:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333736, 25291, 9331, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression and unique perspective. I hope to god that your hair looks wet because of gel and not because ... well I''m sure you know what I''m thinking. Very memorable shot, so I''ve rated this highly</td>', 'Priceless expression and unique perspective. I hope to god that your hair looks wet because of gel and not because ... well I''m sure you know what I''m thinking. Very memorable shot, so I''ve rated this highly', '2003-06-21 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
