(333741, 25164, 9331, '<td valign="top">You''ve obviously gone to a lot of trouble to set this one up and the shot of your face is just fantastic. I just find that the reflections on the painted wall and the shadows to the side of your head too competing though. The hair also for some reason appears to be out of focus compared to the rest of your face. Overall great job though</td>', 'You''ve obviously gone to a lot of trouble to set this one up and the shot of your face is just fantastic. I just find that the reflections on the painted wall and the shadows to the side of your head too competing though. The hair also for some reason appears to be out of focus compared to the rest of your face. Overall great job though', '2003-06-21 01:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333745, 24656, 9331, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of background here and the lighting is spot on</td>', 'I like your choice of background here and the lighting is spot on', '2003-06-21 01:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(333749, 24568, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very well lit and composed shot. It also conveys a sense of who you are, so we can relate to the photo better. My only criticism, is the blurred cigarette. For a title of the Smoker, that''s the first thing we''re drawn to and it detracts from the image</td>', 'Very well lit and composed shot. It also conveys a sense of who you are, so we can relate to the photo better. My only criticism, is the blurred cigarette. For a title of the Smoker, that''s the first thing we''re drawn to and it detracts from the image', '2003-06-21 01:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(333752, 24684, 9331, '<td valign="top">I find this shot fascintaing. Two self portraits in one. How was it achieved? It looks as though you''re holding the photo in place, but for your reflection to appear on it, it would have to be stuck behind the glass. Anyway, job well done and certainly one of the more unusual shots on here</td>', 'I find this shot fascintaing. Two self portraits in one. How was it achieved? It looks as though you''re holding the photo in place, but for your reflection to appear on it, it would have to be stuck behind the glass. Anyway, job well done and certainly one of the more unusual shots on here', '2003-06-21 01:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(333755, 24980, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The bold red glasses really give us a sense of your personality and they help make this photo really work</td>', 'Great photo. The bold red glasses really give us a sense of your personality and they help make this photo really work', '2003-06-21 01:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333758, 25257, 1897, '<td valign="top">classic, on flowers in the hair would have been better</td>', 'classic, on flowers in the hair would have been better', '2003-06-21 01:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(333759, 25224, 1897, '<td valign="top">it the fifth beatle---good work</td>', 'it the fifth beatle---good work', '2003-06-21 01:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333760, 25058, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great colours and sense of irony in the use of the pencil instead of a cigarette. The photo works really well (even the shadowed creases of the red backgorund) and looks like it''s the kind of photo you''d see in a glossy magazine.</td>', 'Great colours and sense of irony in the use of the pencil instead of a cigarette. The photo works really well (even the shadowed creases of the red backgorund) and looks like it''s the kind of photo you''d see in a glossy magazine.', '2003-06-21 01:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
