(333763, 25082, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very emtotional shot. There''s a bit too much black space at the top of the photo for me and I think I''d like to have seen just a hint of your lips through the fingers to get across even more feeling. But you''ld have to be happy with this shot. It''s great - 8</td>', 'Very emtotional shot. There''s a bit too much black space at the top of the photo for me and I think I''d like to have seen just a hint of your lips through the fingers to get across even more feeling. But you''ld have to be happy with this shot. It''s great - 8', '2003-06-21 01:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
