(333766, 25086, 9331, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully composed photo. Use of contrast is good, as is the lighting, but just feel the edges of the fingers should have been a touch more visible as the bottom two seem to have been cut off</td>', 'Wonderfully composed photo. Use of contrast is good, as is the lighting, but just feel the edges of the fingers should have been a touch more visible as the bottom two seem to have been cut off', '2003-06-21 01:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
