(333785, 25303, 9331, '<td valign="top">49C !! I feel your chill  - looks like you also had to do this a few times to get the shot right too. BRRRR<br/>Would have liked to have seen just one more on the left as you were leaving the pier. Not the best photo on here, but certainly one of the most original and have to applaud you for that</td>', '49C !! I feel your chill  - looks like you also had to do this a few times to get the shot right too. BRRRRWould have liked to have seen just one more on the left as you were leaving the pier. Not the best photo on here, but certainly one of the most original and have to applaud you for that', '2003-06-21 02:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
