(333792, 24737, 9331, '<td valign="top">Your head may be in there - but where?</td>', 'Your head may be in there - but where?', '2003-06-21 02:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(333793, 25266, 9331, '<td valign="top">For a title of imperfect, I was expecting to see some imperfection in there somewhere, but was unable to do so. All looks fine from here :)</td>', 'For a title of imperfect, I was expecting to see some imperfection in there somewhere, but was unable to do so. All looks fine from here :)', '2003-06-21 02:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333794, 25202, 9331, '<td valign="top">My second highest rated photo. I love your irony in this. It''s a perfectly shot glamour photograph. But the addition of those nasty looking teeth bring our attention back to the fact that we are rating the merits of the photograph and not the looks of the person. Well done - this photo really rocks :)</td>', 'My second highest rated photo. I love your irony in this. It''s a perfectly shot glamour photograph. But the addition of those nasty looking teeth bring our attention back to the fact that we are rating the merits of the photograph and not the looks of the person. Well done - this photo really rocks :)', '2003-06-21 02:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333795, 24633, 9331, '<td valign="top">I was almost going to mark this down, cos I''m jealous of your body - LOL. But it''s too well shot for that and so had to give it a high rating :)</td>', 'I was almost going to mark this down, cos I''m jealous of your body - LOL. But it''s too well shot for that and so had to give it a high rating :)', '2003-06-21 02:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(333796, 24889, 9331, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot for a self portrait and very brave one at that :) Not sure if you should include "all" the guys - as I know a few of my gay friends wouldn''t be interested in them at all - LOL</td>', 'Interesting shot for a self portrait and very brave one at that :) Not sure if you should include "all" the guys - as I know a few of my gay friends wouldn''t be interested in them at all - LOL', '2003-06-21 02:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(333798, 24767, 9331, '<td valign="top">Almost like fine art. The grainy look and tones work well, but the lumpy look of the sheet doesn''t seem to go with the smooth curves of the body</td>', 'Almost like fine art. The grainy look and tones work well, but the lumpy look of the sheet doesn''t seem to go with the smooth curves of the body', '2003-06-21 02:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(333799, 24894, 9331, '<td valign="top">Ingenious. Great photo - loved this one.</td>', 'Ingenious. Great photo - loved this one.', '2003-06-21 02:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333800, 24955, 9331, '<td valign="top">Unfortunatey the mirror is too shattered, so it makes it almost impossible to see the self portrait in this photo. Which is a pity, as I really like the shot otherwise</td>', 'Unfortunatey the mirror is too shattered, so it makes it almost impossible to see the self portrait in this photo. Which is a pity, as I really like the shot otherwise', '2003-06-21 02:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(333802, 25043, 9331, '<td valign="top">Priceless expression and the one (stunningly blue) eye really work in seperating this photo apart from the other self portraits on here. Good luck on your wedding day by the way :)</td>', 'Priceless expression and the one (stunningly blue) eye really work in seperating this photo apart from the other self portraits on here. Good luck on your wedding day by the way :)', '2003-06-21 02:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333807, 25297, 9331, '<td valign="top">I''m just wonderinf if you got this idea from the movie "Contact". There''s a scene in there where Jodie Foster has the exact same effect. Haunting and ethereal, this is one of the better shots for this challenge. Well done</td>', 'I''m just wonderinf if you got this idea from the movie "Contact". There''s a scene in there where Jodie Foster has the exact same effect. Haunting and ethereal, this is one of the better shots for this challenge. Well done', '2003-06-21 03:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333810, 24762, 9331, '<td valign="top">The expression on your face doesn''t seem quite right for a self portrait, but the lighting and soft focus are very well done</td>', 'The expression on your face doesn''t seem quite right for a self portrait, but the lighting and soft focus are very well done', '2003-06-21 03:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333813, 25161, 9331, '<td valign="top">Highly original. I assume you had this set on long shutter speed with synch flash to capture yourself as you were falling. The ghostly image this created is truly unique</td>', 'Highly original. I assume you had this set on long shutter speed with synch flash to capture yourself as you were falling. The ghostly image this created is truly unique', '2003-06-21 03:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333817, 25304, 9331, '<td valign="top">Perfect shot. Well done</td>', 'Perfect shot. Well done', '2003-06-21 03:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(333821, 25129, 9331, '<td valign="top">Ok - how did you do that? Top marks for ingenuity here . I really like the yellow lighting on your face</td>', 'Ok - how did you do that? Top marks for ingenuity here . I really like the yellow lighting on your face', '2003-06-21 03:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333824, 25101, 933, '<td valign="top">The most original take on his challenge.  Very cool.  Nice composition, good colors and clarity.  And it conveys a story, so whats not to like?  Congrats on the win in advance.  10  md</td>', 'The most original take on his challenge.  Very cool.  Nice composition, good colors and clarity.  And it conveys a story, so whats not to like?  Congrats on the win in advance.  10  md', '2003-06-21 03:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(333826, 24800, 9331, '<td valign="top">Ok - this is a shot where I want to mark you down, cos you''re just too good looking. But the photo is near perfect. I can''t fault it. The addition of the bracelet is great - well we''ve got to have our eyes diverted when looking in that direction anyway. Big ticks for lighting, focus and composition, so I''ll give you a 10. Hmm, not on second thoughts, I''m gonna deduct a point for your looks just becaue I feel like being mean :) - 9</td>', 'Ok - this is a shot where I want to mark you down, cos you''re just too good looking. But the photo is near perfect. I can''t fault it. The addition of the bracelet is great - well we''ve got to have our eyes diverted when looking in that direction anyway. Big ticks for lighting, focus and composition, so I''ll give you a 10. Hmm, not on second thoughts, I''m gonna deduct a point for your looks just becaue I feel like being mean :) - 9', '2003-06-21 03:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(333828, 25296, 933, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, nice staging, good lighting.  Border is a bot too thick for my liking, but who cares, it''s an excellent shot.  And I''m sure the chicks are digging the skin.   ;?)    10  md</td>', 'Very well composed, nice staging, good lighting.  Border is a bot too thick for my liking, but who cares, it''s an excellent shot.  And I''m sure the chicks are digging the skin.   ;?)    10  md', '2003-06-21 03:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333831, 24818, 9331, '<td valign="top">A weird, yet wonderful photo. Lobve the lighting on this one and the sharpness is just great. Well done !!</td>', 'A weird, yet wonderful photo. Lobve the lighting on this one and the sharpness is just great. Well done !!', '2003-06-21 03:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333833, 25094, 933, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect lighting, great composition. Very good emotion conveyed through this very powerful image.  Very nice work.  10  md</td>', 'Absolutely perfect lighting, great composition. Very good emotion conveyed through this very powerful image.  Very nice work.  10  md', '2003-06-21 03:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333835, 24750, 9331, '<td valign="top">This is the photo I''ve been waiting for. Only giving one photo a perfect 10 and this is it. Can''t fault it in anyway. I''ll be very very suprised if you don''t get a ribbon for this one</td>', 'This is the photo I''ve been waiting for. Only giving one photo a perfect 10 and this is it. Can''t fault it in anyway. I''ll be very very suprised if you don''t get a ribbon for this one', '2003-06-21 03:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333836, 24838, 9331, '<td valign="top">Wow - how did you do that? Great use of colours and light here, plus top marks for originality</td>', 'Wow - how did you do that? Great use of colours and light here, plus top marks for originality', '2003-06-21 03:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(333839, 24644, 9331, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I find the reflections in the glasses a little distracting</td>', 'Great shot, but I find the reflections in the glasses a little distracting', '2003-06-21 03:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(333841, 25050, 6172, '<td valign="top">?  Am I missing something or did you when you interpeted the challenge?</td>', '?  Am I missing something or did you when you interpeted the challenge?', '2003-06-21 03:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(333842, 24964, 9331, '<td valign="top">Very different - so top marks for originality. Would have trimmed a bit off from the right though. The photo doesn''t look very centred because of it</td>', 'Very different - so top marks for originality. Would have trimmed a bit off from the right though. The photo doesn''t look very centred because of it', '2003-06-21 03:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333844, 24922, 933, '<td valign="top">Ya know, I''m not sure why I like this as much as I do.  The photo is a bit noisy and washed out, the focus seems a tad soft, and I''m not too sure about the composition.  But dang if it isn''t one of my favorites.  Just has a really great feel to it!  Well done!!  9  md</td>', 'Ya know, I''m not sure why I like this as much as I do.  The photo is a bit noisy and washed out, the focus seems a tad soft, and I''m not too sure about the composition.  But dang if it isn''t one of my favorites.  Just has a really great feel to it!  Well done!!  9  md', '2003-06-21 03:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(333846, 25129, 6172, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  I don''t know how you got the smaller picture in the picture, but it adds to the effect.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  I don''t know how you got the smaller picture in the picture, but it adds to the effect.', '2003-06-21 03:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(333849, 24889, 6172, '<td valign="top">You wish</td>', 'You wish', '2003-06-21 03:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333857, 25035, 6172, '<td valign="top">This would look better without the wood tiles at the top.  Good effect, but the focus is off.  I won''t penalize you too much because I appreciate the fact that you are trying something different.</td>', 'This would look better without the wood tiles at the top.  Good effect, but the focus is off.  I won''t penalize you too much because I appreciate the fact that you are trying something different.', '2003-06-21 03:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333861, 24682, 6172, '<td valign="top">This photo would be much better if the eye were in focus, in my opinion, novice that i am.</td>', 'This photo would be much better if the eye were in focus, in my opinion, novice that i am.', '2003-06-21 03:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333863, 24762, 6172, '<td valign="top">Not good focus, otherwise, good.</td>', 'Not good focus, otherwise, good.', '2003-06-21 03:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(333867, 25276, 6172, '<td valign="top">Your face goes well with the frame size of the photo, long :)  Nice shot, I like the soft focus.  You probably don''t need any more comments on how pretty you are, so I won''t.</td>', 'Your face goes well with the frame size of the photo, long :)  Nice shot, I like the soft focus.  You probably don''t need any more comments on how pretty you are, so I won''t.', '2003-06-21 03:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333868, 24764, 6172, '<td valign="top">No, you are old!</td>', 'No, you are old!', '2003-06-21 03:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(333869, 25215, 6172, '<td valign="top">Just a little bit too dark.</td>', 'Just a little bit too dark.', '2003-06-21 03:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(333870, 24693, 6172, '<td valign="top">So is that your eye, or are you the person reflected in the eye?</td>', 'So is that your eye, or are you the person reflected in the eye?', '2003-06-21 03:47:23.000000', NULL, 1);
