(333897, 25132, 9136, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot, you remind me of someone... 8.</td>', 'Awesome shot, you remind me of someone... 8.', '2003-06-21 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(333898, 24887, 9136, '<td valign="top">Hehe, great shot... I happen to like the openness on the right. One of my favorites this week.. good luck, 10.</td>', 'Hehe, great shot... I happen to like the openness on the right. One of my favorites this week.. good luck, 10.', '2003-06-21 06:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(333899, 24686, 9136, '<td valign="top">Your profile is gorgeous, nice shot. 9.</td>', 'Your profile is gorgeous, nice shot. 9.', '2003-06-21 06:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(333955, 24820, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent study in great light tones, great eye contact, perffect composition because the photographer leaves a lot to the imagination of the viewer.</td>', 'Excellent study in great light tones, great eye contact, perffect composition because the photographer leaves a lot to the imagination of the viewer.', '2003-06-21 09:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333957, 24825, 1570, '<td valign="top">oh, this is so-o-o-o sweet! 8.</td>', 'oh, this is so-o-o-o sweet! 8.', '2003-06-21 09:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333962, 25202, 7541, '<td valign="top">What a waste</td>', 'What a waste', '2003-06-21 09:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(333967, 24791, 7541, '<td valign="top">Love this shot, great concept and I can tell you whats wrong, you''ve only got half a brain, can''t complain about composition or color tones.  Final diagnosis is you will live for a long time.</td>', 'Love this shot, great concept and I can tell you whats wrong, you''ve only got half a brain, can''t complain about composition or color tones.  Final diagnosis is you will live for a long time.', '2003-06-21 10:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(333969, 25269, 7541, '<td valign="top">This is another great image, your family will know who it is but we have to wait till the sun comes up. Great image.</td>', 'This is another great image, your family will know who it is but we have to wait till the sun comes up. Great image.', '2003-06-21 10:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(333975, 25276, 7541, '<td valign="top">Excellent, great composition and light tones. Your eyes look great and the whole expression shows determination.  Lovely study.</td>', 'Excellent, great composition and light tones. Your eyes look great and the whole expression shows determination.  Lovely study.', '2003-06-21 10:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333977, 25217, 3290, '<td valign="top">Like it - novel composition. Might be nice to see the eye (or part of them) though.</td>', 'Like it - novel composition. Might be nice to see the eye (or part of them) though.', '2003-06-21 10:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(333978, 25207, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice set up. How did you do it?</td>', 'Nice set up. How did you do it?', '2003-06-21 10:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(333979, 25272, 3084, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the hands / fingers.  A very beautiful image of a gorgeous young woman.  I still remember what such beauty looks like, thanks for sharing.  Definite 10</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the hands / fingers.  A very beautiful image of a gorgeous young woman.  I still remember what such beauty looks like, thanks for sharing.  Definite 10', '2003-06-21 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(333981, 25307, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good try, but looks a little posed. The highlights are a little harshtoo. Nice tone though.</td>', 'Good try, but looks a little posed. The highlights are a little harshtoo. Nice tone though.', '2003-06-21 10:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(333982, 25311, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective - nice nostrils ;-)</td>', 'Interesting perspective - nice nostrils ;-)', '2003-06-21 10:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(333984, 25164, 3290, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Interesting. From  a technical perspective, the highlights on the face are a bit lown out, which detracts from the overall effect (for me anyway) but a very imaginative idea and interesting effect. Perhaps some ''frost'' on the hair?</td>', 'Hmm. Interesting. From  a technical perspective, the highlights on the face are a bit lown out, which detracts from the overall effect (for me anyway) but a very imaginative idea and interesting effect. Perhaps some ''frost'' on the hair?', '2003-06-21 10:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(333986, 25094, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice subtle lighting. It would be more engaging if we could see you face, though, I think.</td>', 'Nice subtle lighting. It would be more engaging if we could see you face, though, I think.', '2003-06-21 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(333987, 24964, 3290, '<td valign="top">Neat. Shame about the wire(?) on the left - rather spoils the effect.</td>', 'Neat. Shame about the wire(?) on the left - rather spoils the effect.', '2003-06-21 10:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333988, 25125, 6530, '<td valign="top">You''re eyes are out of focus did you try using an unsharpening mask?</td>', 'You''re eyes are out of focus did you try using an unsharpening mask?', '2003-06-21 10:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(333989, 25274, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice intimate feel to this - good communication with the eyes. Well done.</td>', 'Nice intimate feel to this - good communication with the eyes. Well done.', '2003-06-21 10:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(333991, 25237, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool, but a bit too dark - could do with more contrast, IMHO.</td>', 'Cool, but a bit too dark - could do with more contrast, IMHO.', '2003-06-21 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(333992, 25097, 3290, '<td valign="top">I think this would work better if not so overexposed in the highlights - otherwise it''s a nice portrait.</td>', 'I think this would work better if not so overexposed in the highlights - otherwise it''s a nice portrait.', '2003-06-21 10:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(333993, 24767, 3290, '<td valign="top">Very effective. For me, the grain detracts a bit but I like this very much anyway.</td>', 'Very effective. For me, the grain detracts a bit but I like this very much anyway.', '2003-06-21 10:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(333994, 25275, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice. Crop a little lighter in the right, I think.</td>', 'Nice. Crop a little lighter in the right, I think.', '2003-06-21 10:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(333996, 25101, 3290, '<td valign="top">Neat. Different. I like the contrast between the monochrome pictures and the colourful background. Nice one.</td>', 'Neat. Different. I like the contrast between the monochrome pictures and the colourful background. Nice one.', '2003-06-21 10:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(333997, 25180, 1570, '<td valign="top">i like this a lot - the expression on your face, the colors, the composition... 8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-25 08:16:24.</i></td>', 'i like this a lot - the expression on your face, the colors, the composition... 8.', '2003-06-21 10:21:42.000000', '2003-06-25 09:16:24.000000', 1),
(334001, 25304, 3290, '<td valign="top">I hope not. Nice shot.</td>', 'I hope not. Nice shot.', '2003-06-21 10:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(334002, 25202, 3290, '<td valign="top">Urgh! Good shock value.</td>', 'Urgh! Good shock value.', '2003-06-21 10:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(334004, 25272, 3290, '<td valign="top">I liek the frame effect/idea. Good one.</td>', 'I liek the frame effect/idea. Good one.', '2003-06-21 10:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(334008, 24801, 3084, '<td valign="top">Pick of the week.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Pick of the week.  10  Morgan', '2003-06-21 10:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(334010, 24824, 3084, '<td valign="top">Pick of the week.  10  Morgan</td>', 'Pick of the week.  10  Morgan', '2003-06-21 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334011, 25304, 3084, '<td valign="top">Pick of the week. Absolutely beautiful.. Love the eyes the best.  Great lighting.  Gorgeous face, too bad we can not see more... 10  Morgan</td>', 'Pick of the week. Absolutely beautiful.. Love the eyes the best.  Great lighting.  Gorgeous face, too bad we can not see more... 10  Morgan', '2003-06-21 10:38:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(334013, 25101, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great shot, very creative.  9  Morgan</td>', 'Great shot, very creative.  9  Morgan', '2003-06-21 10:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334084, 25285, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful smile and engaging picture.  I like your pose here and the way your blouse kind of waves in the lower left forground. It gives a feeling of depth to the shot.  I also like very much the way your hair flows down and covers the right side of the picture creating negative space. A nitpick here would be the small area of light getting through at the bottom lower right corner by the border. It''s a tiny bit distracting, but not all that important. I would have also liked to have seen a more interesting background. On the whole, well done!</td>', 'Beautiful smile and engaging picture.  I like your pose here and the way your blouse kind of waves in the lower left forground. It gives a feeling of depth to the shot.  I also like very much the way your hair flows down and covers the right side of the picture creating negative space. A nitpick here would be the small area of light getting through at the bottom lower right corner by the border. It''s a tiny bit distracting, but not all that important. I would have also liked to have seen a more interesting background. On the whole, well done!', '2003-06-21 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(334086, 24838, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very creative and unique.  I like everything about this picture, especially your focus on the filimament and the soft focus of your face.</td>', 'Very creative and unique.  I like everything about this picture, especially your focus on the filimament and the soft focus of your face.', '2003-06-21 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334088, 24769, 8911, '<td valign="top">The off-center nature of the photo almost works for me, but cutting off the left eye is too much of a disconnect - it "feels" wrong to have the face truncate there. I''d like to see more of the face in the picture, a bit of blank black space to the right, but not as much as now.<br/> <br/>Really nice lighting on this one.</td>', 'The off-center nature of the photo almost works for me, but cutting off the left eye is too much of a disconnect - it "feels" wrong to have the face truncate there. I''d like to see more of the face in the picture, a bit of blank black space to the right, but not as much as now. Really nice lighting on this one.', '2003-06-21 13:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(334092, 25122, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this one...the light source is a bit too harsh and washes out the top of your head a bit too much, though, even for the "steam" look.</td>', 'I like the composition on this one...the light source is a bit too harsh and washes out the top of your head a bit too much, though, even for the "steam" look.', '2003-06-21 13:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334106, 25191, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love that background, and you look good, too!</td>', 'Love that background, and you look good, too!', '2003-06-21 13:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334108, 24824, 1379, '<td valign="top">Ow!  That had to hurt!  Nice spin on the idea.</td>', 'Ow!  That had to hurt!  Nice spin on the idea.', '2003-06-21 13:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334111, 25192, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow, you got some GREAT lighting for this shot!  The mirror idea ws really clever, and you have beautiful hands and nails.  Nice work.</td>', 'Wow, you got some GREAT lighting for this shot!  The mirror idea ws really clever, and you have beautiful hands and nails.  Nice work.', '2003-06-21 13:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(334114, 24714, 1379, '<td valign="top">Your title and expression make me want to hug you!  The catchlights in your eyes look like tears.... or maybe my over-active imagination is supplying that notion.  Anyway, this is a great shot, and I hope you generally feel more upbeat.</td>', 'Your title and expression make me want to hug you!  The catchlights in your eyes look like tears.... or maybe my over-active imagination is supplying that notion.  Anyway, this is a great shot, and I hope you generally feel more upbeat.', '2003-06-21 13:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334115, 24847, 1379, '<td valign="top">This would be a great 8x10 for you to go to professional auditions!  It''s awesome!  You really got the lighting perfect.  Now let''s see some jazz hands!</td>', 'This would be a great 8x10 for you to go to professional auditions!  It''s awesome!  You really got the lighting perfect.  Now let''s see some jazz hands!', '2003-06-21 13:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334116, 25289, 1379, '<td valign="top">I hope you''re resting and not stressing!</td>', 'I hope you''re resting and not stressing!', '2003-06-21 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(334117, 25215, 1379, '<td valign="top">I really like this......  Just the minimum of details shows, hinting at what your whole countenance is...  I love the mysterious quality.</td>', 'I really like this......  Just the minimum of details shows, hinting at what your whole countenance is...  I love the mysterious quality.', '2003-06-21 13:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(334118, 25212, 1379, '<td valign="top">Heh.....</td>', 'Heh.....', '2003-06-21 13:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334119, 25096, 6900, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colors in your eye shadow, lips and shirt are all similar and don''t conflict.  I think the wet hair look here looks similar to your Practical Jokes shot, but enough different to be interesting to see.  I like how your eye is not covered by those two strands of hair.  Good job on the portrait. 8</td>', 'I like the way the colors in your eye shadow, lips and shirt are all similar and don''t conflict.  I think the wet hair look here looks similar to your Practical Jokes shot, but enough different to be interesting to see.  I like how your eye is not covered by those two strands of hair.  Good job on the portrait. 8', '2003-06-21 13:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334121, 25298, 1379, '<td valign="top">You look awesome for someone''s Nana!  The flower in your hair really adds to the overall emotive quality of this photo.  It seems to add a playful but sensuous feel.</td>', 'You look awesome for someone''s Nana!  The flower in your hair really adds to the overall emotive quality of this photo.  It seems to add a playful but sensuous feel.', '2003-06-21 13:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334122, 25207, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love infinity photos, and this one is really well done.  I like the negative spaceon the right, too.</td>', 'I love infinity photos, and this one is really well done.  I like the negative spaceon the right, too.', '2003-06-21 13:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(334123, 25243, 1379, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love it!  Althought I just noticed the porta-potties, this is a great idea, and those johns add some humor and context.  Cool!</td>', 'Wow!  I love it!  Althought I just noticed the porta-potties, this is a great idea, and those johns add some humor and context.  Cool!', '2003-06-21 13:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334124, 25037, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the more daring shots in the challenge - a great feat.  I know this skintone well, as I call a very similar place "home" or "pillow" often. :)  I like the inclusion of the wedding band and  I think this is an exceptionally well taken self portrait.</td>', 'One of the more daring shots in the challenge - a great feat.  I know this skintone well, as I call a very similar place "home" or "pillow" often. :)  I like the inclusion of the wedding band and  I think this is an exceptionally well taken self portrait.', '2003-06-21 13:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(334125, 25307, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, and your hair frames your face really well.  Nice work!</td>', 'Awesome lighting, and your hair frames your face really well.  Nice work!', '2003-06-21 13:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(334127, 25074, 1379, '<td valign="top">Great story!!</td>', 'Great story!!', '2003-06-21 13:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(334129, 25058, 1379, '<td valign="top">I love this!  I could easiy be a poster with those exact words on it.  Great job, and use of negative space.  Heck, I even like the texture (notice i''m not saying wrinkles) in the fabric behind you.</td>', 'I love this!  I could easiy be a poster with those exact words on it.  Great job, and use of negative space.  Heck, I even like the texture (notice i''m not saying wrinkles) in the fabric behind you.', '2003-06-21 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(334130, 25104, 1379, '<td valign="top">Terrific portrait, and I must tell you that my favorite part of this is your hair.  The light you used really highlights just how smooth and perfect it is.  Nice work!</td>', 'Terrific portrait, and I must tell you that my favorite part of this is your hair.  The light you used really highlights just how smooth and perfect it is.  Nice work!', '2003-06-21 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(334132, 24922, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love the movement of your scarf in the wind.  Great background, too, and plus you''re an attractive model.  Nice work!</td>', 'Love the movement of your scarf in the wind.  Great background, too, and plus you''re an attractive model.  Nice work!', '2003-06-21 14:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(334141, 24661, 1379, '<td valign="top">Well, my husband (mag) told me to be on the lookout for your shot, and here it is.  He just told me that this is your last submission to dpc, and I''m disappointed and surprised.  As you may know, I don''t really follow the chatty stuff, but mostly just focus on the photos.  I''ve always found your work to be both interesting and inspiring.  I hope that your hiatus is short.  <br/>The element of this picture that I really like is the lighting, with all the little catchights on the various surfaces, like on the toe of your shoe.<br/>Return soon.</td>', 'Well, my husband (mag) told me to be on the lookout for your shot, and here it is.  He just told me that this is your last submission to dpc, and I''m disappointed and surprised.  As you may know, I don''t really follow the chatty stuff, but mostly just focus on the photos.  I''ve always found your work to be both interesting and inspiring.  I hope that your hiatus is short.  The element of this picture that I really like is the lighting, with all the little catchights on the various surfaces, like on the toe of your shoe.Return soon.', '2003-06-21 14:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334142, 25199, 1379, '<td valign="top">Soulful.  I love it.</td>', 'Soulful.  I love it.', '2003-06-21 14:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334143, 25234, 1379, '<td valign="top">Those are the greatest glasses!  So Thomas Dolby!!  And you framed yourself well within this space.  Nice work!</td>', 'Those are the greatest glasses!  So Thomas Dolby!!  And you framed yourself well within this space.  Nice work!', '2003-06-21 14:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334144, 25226, 1897, '<td valign="top">I do not really like the cheescake pose in a self portrait, I would like to have seen more of your face and eyes.  Nice background, this show you in an environment that you seem to like, that is a plus.</td>', 'I do not really like the cheescake pose in a self portrait, I would like to have seen more of your face and eyes.  Nice background, this show you in an environment that you seem to like, that is a plus.', '2003-06-21 14:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(334146, 25095, 7969, '<td valign="top">Really a creative and very interesting shot.  Good choice of background color.  good luck!!</td>', 'Really a creative and very interesting shot.  Good choice of background color.  good luck!!', '2003-06-21 14:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(334147, 24818, 7969, '<td valign="top">I think you have done a really amazing job at capturing the look and feel of a caricature.  The dark background and lighting have certainly served to add to the drama of your shot as well as your expression.  Creative self portrait!! nice job!!</td>', 'I think you have done a really amazing job at capturing the look and feel of a caricature.  The dark background and lighting have certainly served to add to the drama of your shot as well as your expression.  Creative self portrait!! nice job!!', '2003-06-21 14:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(334151, 25161, 7969, '<td valign="top">Now what i would like to know is how you were able to make yourself transparent?  Hope you did not land to hard--lol</td>', 'Now what i would like to know is how you were able to make yourself transparent?  Hope you did not land to hard--lol', '2003-06-21 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(334152, 25163, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice emotive quality to this image. I like the tones a lot. Lighting to match your lovely expression might enhance the photo, perhaps. Nice work, though.</td>', 'Nice emotive quality to this image. I like the tones a lot. Lighting to match your lovely expression might enhance the photo, perhaps. Nice work, though.', '2003-06-21 14:22:32.000000', NULL, 1),
