(334154, 24889, 6870, '<td valign="top">Give some of us a break, anyway! Certainly a cynical view, which would be enhanced with some kind of "cynical" lighting, perhaps....still--clever shot, and appropriate point of view, of course!</td>', 'Give some of us a break, anyway! Certainly a cynical view, which would be enhanced with some kind of "cynical" lighting, perhaps....still--clever shot, and appropriate point of view, of course!', '2003-06-21 14:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
