(334159, 25058, 2605, '<td valign="top">great photo - love the colors, the light. not too fond of the title though, of course it looks like you''re smoking, but a title more provocative would add more meaning to the shot.</td>', 'great photo - love the colors, the light. not too fond of the title though, of course it looks like you''re smoking, but a title more provocative would add more meaning to the shot.', '2003-06-21 14:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
