(334302, 25058, 5112, '<td valign="top">I love the red background - it''s very daring of you to use it!  Very nice overall.  My one comment, it might have been better to use a different colour pencil (for the cigarette).  ~8</td>', 'I love the red background - it''s very daring of you to use it!  Very nice overall.  My one comment, it might have been better to use a different colour pencil (for the cigarette).  ~8', '2003-06-21 19:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334303, 25234, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is one excellent self-portrait! i especially love how the dynamics of your hair "repeats" the lines of the plant in front of the ivy... i am in the middle of voting, and it''s my favorite so far... that would be a ten (10)...on a side note, i hope that in your remarks you explain what kind of plant it is, or maybe you could pm me, i am interested in growing it at home... thankyouverymuch! irina.<br/></td>', 'this is one excellent self-portrait! i especially love how the dynamics of your hair "repeats" the lines of the plant in front of the ivy... i am in the middle of voting, and it''s my favorite so far... that would be a ten (10)...on a side note, i hope that in your remarks you explain what kind of plant it is, or maybe you could pm me, i am interested in growing it at home... thankyouverymuch! irina.', '2003-06-21 19:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(334307, 25029, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I love your idea of using all the branches as a frame.  To my eyes, you (the person) looks just a tad out of focus, but I''m not sure of that.  B/W is a good choice here.  ~8</td>', 'Very nice!  I love your idea of using all the branches as a frame.  To my eyes, you (the person) looks just a tad out of focus, but I''m not sure of that.  B/W is a good choice here.  ~8', '2003-06-21 19:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334311, 25085, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super use of depth of field here. Your eye is the only thing in real focus, and that is very effective.</td>', 'Super use of depth of field here. Your eye is the only thing in real focus, and that is very effective.', '2003-06-21 20:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(334313, 24656, 6870, '<td valign="top">Hey, where''s your dog? I kinda miss him... I really like the white on white here.</td>', 'Hey, where''s your dog? I kinda miss him... I really like the white on white here.', '2003-06-21 20:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334314, 25185, 8860, '<td valign="top">Which one is you then? But seriously, a nice shot with good composition and crisp colours.</td>', 'Which one is you then? But seriously, a nice shot with good composition and crisp colours.', '2003-06-21 20:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(334315, 25257, 6870, '<td valign="top">Putting yourself off center makes it seem like this scene goes on and on. Perhaps it does. I do like how this shot says things about yourself, even though we can''t see your face.</td>', 'Putting yourself off center makes it seem like this scene goes on and on. Perhaps it does. I do like how this shot says things about yourself, even though we can''t see your face.', '2003-06-21 20:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334316, 24906, 6870, '<td valign="top">The perfect place to take a photo of such a lovely model. I really enjoy how you''ve used shadow and light to frame yourself.</td>', 'The perfect place to take a photo of such a lovely model. I really enjoy how you''ve used shadow and light to frame yourself.', '2003-06-21 20:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(334317, 24746, 6870, '<td valign="top">This looks like the photo from your profile. I like your expression here, and the simple sample of suroundings as background.</td>', 'This looks like the photo from your profile. I like your expression here, and the simple sample of suroundings as background.', '2003-06-21 20:08:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334318, 25237, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice quality shot.</td>', 'Nice quality shot.', '2003-06-21 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
