(334327, 25093, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the mood created here by your lighting, though I''d like to see either more or less of your face and perhaps less of your chest, which doesn''t seem to have anything to do with your title or communication here. 8</td>', 'I like the mood created here by your lighting, though I''d like to see either more or less of your face and perhaps less of your chest, which doesn''t seem to have anything to do with your title or communication here. 8', '2003-06-21 20:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
