(334339, 24658, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the earnestness of the pose, but I don''t really get the "light" part.</td>', 'I like the earnestness of the pose, but I don''t really get the "light" part.', '2003-06-21 20:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334340, 25261, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure, the frame works well.</td>', 'Nice exposure, the frame works well.', '2003-06-21 20:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334341, 24633, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is one situation where the amount of extra black on the right doesn''t hurt the composition but sort of balances it.  I like the rawness of this.</td>', 'This is one situation where the amount of extra black on the right doesn''t hurt the composition but sort of balances it.  I like the rawness of this.', '2003-06-21 20:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334342, 25058, 8860, '<td valign="top">... so will pencils if you don''t go on a graphite diet! Nice composition and great colours - shows your character too. -7</td>', '... so will pencils if you don''t go on a graphite diet! Nice composition and great colours - shows your character too. -7', '2003-06-21 20:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334343, 25161, 6565, '<td valign="top">Looks less like "falling" than "flying leaping" to me! :)  Really interesting the way you''re only partially transparent.  Clever.</td>', 'Looks less like "falling" than "flying leaping" to me! :)  Really interesting the way you''re only partially transparent.  Clever.', '2003-06-21 20:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(334344, 24557, 6565, '<td valign="top">Can''t see what is on the right, but the way you''ve reduced this to almost a line drawing is really interesting.  would like a little bit of white in the upper-right corner to feel more balanced, but overall this is really nice!</td>', 'Can''t see what is on the right, but the way you''ve reduced this to almost a line drawing is really interesting.  would like a little bit of white in the upper-right corner to feel more balanced, but overall this is really nice!', '2003-06-21 20:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334345, 25278, 6565, '<td valign="top">Haha!  I like the expression on your face!  The frame works for you, too.</td>', 'Haha!  I like the expression on your face!  The frame works for you, too.', '2003-06-21 20:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(334346, 25301, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s something so honest and direct about this photo!  Are you a model?  A model''s photographer?  Both?  This comes across with very nice artistry in expression and composition.</td>', 'Wow, there''s something so honest and direct about this photo!  Are you a model?  A model''s photographer?  Both?  This comes across with very nice artistry in expression and composition.', '2003-06-21 20:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334348, 25161, 8860, '<td valign="top">How come you''re transparent? Is it part reflection? A fun shot and shows character. Too many serious shots in this challenge! -7</td>', 'How come you''re transparent? Is it part reflection? A fun shot and shows character. Too many serious shots in this challenge! -7', '2003-06-21 20:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(334349, 25307, 6565, '<td valign="top">I think this needs to be cropped either a lot closer or a lot farther.  Right now it''s at a midpoint that doesn''t work really well for me.</td>', 'I think this needs to be cropped either a lot closer or a lot farther.  Right now it''s at a midpoint that doesn''t work really well for me.', '2003-06-21 20:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334350, 24928, 6565, '<td valign="top">Cool "constellation" in your eye!</td>', 'Cool "constellation" in your eye!', '2003-06-21 20:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334351, 24593, 1570, '<td valign="top">very vivid and dynamic, i like it a lot, 8.</td>', 'very vivid and dynamic, i like it a lot, 8.', '2003-06-21 20:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334352, 24716, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great ghostly feel to this one -- the low contrast works really nicely!</td>', 'Great ghostly feel to this one -- the low contrast works really nicely!', '2003-06-21 20:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334354, 24775, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, but as a self-portrait the monitor doesn''t really work as an effective reflecting device in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the concept, but as a self-portrait the monitor doesn''t really work as an effective reflecting device in my opinion.', '2003-06-21 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(334355, 25057, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice that you used a pawn, and the shot is clean, but for a self-portrait I would hope to see something "you" that sets you apart from the other pawns in that part of the country. :)</td>', 'Nice that you used a pawn, and the shot is clean, but for a self-portrait I would hope to see something "you" that sets you apart from the other pawns in that part of the country. :)', '2003-06-21 20:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(334356, 25181, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think a better background would do this justice.  It is a nice idea for a self portrait, and shows lots about you.  I''m just not fond of the cluttered background.  I think it would have been a bit better maybe on a flat solid colored background.  There is also quite a bit of glare on the large pic over near the right of the photo.  I am glad you have your hands in the photo to give it some personal touch.</td>', 'I think a better background would do this justice.  It is a nice idea for a self portrait, and shows lots about you.  I''m just not fond of the cluttered background.  I think it would have been a bit better maybe on a flat solid colored background.  There is also quite a bit of glare on the large pic over near the right of the photo.  I am glad you have your hands in the photo to give it some personal touch.', '2003-06-21 20:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334357, 25127, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the Warhol feel of this!  The eye makeup definitely makes the tones stand out in your eyes, and the use of color is great.</td>', 'I love the Warhol feel of this!  The eye makeup definitely makes the tones stand out in your eyes, and the use of color is great.', '2003-06-21 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(334358, 24801, 6565, '<td valign="top">On my monitor, there''s head, shirt, tie, and nothing else.  Not sure if that''s how you intended it, but for some reason it works!</td>', 'On my monitor, there''s head, shirt, tie, and nothing else.  Not sure if that''s how you intended it, but for some reason it works!', '2003-06-21 20:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334359, 24767, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely job capturing form -- it feels almost like a medical image of some sort.  Very organic!</td>', 'Wow, lovely job capturing form -- it feels almost like a medical image of some sort.  Very organic!', '2003-06-21 20:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(334360, 24825, 6565, '<td valign="top">Straight black-and-white seems to pull away from the emotion that''s obviously in this shot.  What does it look like in sepia, or in color with really low saturation?</td>', 'Straight black-and-white seems to pull away from the emotion that''s obviously in this shot.  What does it look like in sepia, or in color with really low saturation?', '2003-06-21 20:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334361, 25207, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting cropping choice, right at the chin like that.  Feels like we''re looking at a statue, in a good way. :)</td>', 'Interesting cropping choice, right at the chin like that.  Feels like we''re looking at a statue, in a good way. :)', '2003-06-21 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(334363, 25107, 3080, '<td valign="top">You seem to have a bit of magenta tint to your face.  I think it''s probably reflecting off your shirt.  It seems unnatural to me.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and I like the angle as well. The border just doesn''t work for me.  I see that it matches the hat, but with so much of the magenta tint, it looks quite odd.  Nice to meet you!</td>', 'You seem to have a bit of magenta tint to your face.  I think it''s probably reflecting off your shirt.  It seems unnatural to me.  Your focus and clarity are really good, and I like the angle as well. The border just doesn''t work for me.  I see that it matches the hat, but with so much of the magenta tint, it looks quite odd.  Nice to meet you!', '2003-06-21 20:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(334364, 24994, 6565, '<td valign="top">I generally like the high-contrast type photos, but I think this might take it a little too far.</td>', 'I generally like the high-contrast type photos, but I think this might take it a little too far.', '2003-06-21 20:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334366, 25179, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great movement and an interesting setting!  This tells us more about you than just what you look like, which is what a self-portrait should do.  Nice work!</td>', 'Great movement and an interesting setting!  This tells us more about you than just what you look like, which is what a self-portrait should do.  Nice work!', '2003-06-21 20:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334367, 25050, 6565, '<td valign="top">Ghostly, but not enough "you" to judge as a self portrait, in my opinion.</td>', 'Ghostly, but not enough "you" to judge as a self portrait, in my opinion.', '2003-06-21 20:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334368, 25020, 3080, '<td valign="top">boy does this make you think.  lol  Interesting take.  I think though that the lighting is a bit harsh.  it''s quite bright on your legs, and then also the shadow from your head and bike are a little distracting as well.  Really neat though.  nice to meet you.</td>', 'boy does this make you think.  lol  Interesting take.  I think though that the lighting is a bit harsh.  it''s quite bright on your legs, and then also the shadow from your head and bike are a little distracting as well.  Really neat though.  nice to meet you.', '2003-06-21 20:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334369, 24763, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the fairytale feel of this.  Very happy, which is a nice change from most of the somber self-portraits. :)</td>', 'I like the fairytale feel of this.  Very happy, which is a nice change from most of the somber self-portraits. :)', '2003-06-21 20:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334370, 24750, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Different to see a high key shot in here among all the low key ones.  I think this is very well done.  You didnt over do it, and you were still able to keep recognizable features.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose very much.  good use of negative space.  Nice to meet you.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice.  Different to see a high key shot in here among all the low key ones.  I think this is very well done.  You didnt over do it, and you were still able to keep recognizable features.  I like the angle and framing/cropping you chose very much.  good use of negative space.  Nice to meet you.  ~Heather~', '2003-06-21 20:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(334372, 24834, 6565, '<td valign="top">If the corner where the side part met the frame was in focus, I''d like this a lot better.</td>', 'If the corner where the side part met the frame was in focus, I''d like this a lot better.', '2003-06-21 20:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(334373, 24894, 3080, '<td valign="top">Excellent job lining up the photo with the real deal.  The background does''t line up well, but your glasses line up perfectly.  Creative for sure.  And VERY well done.  Focus and clarity are good as well.  Only thing I notice, and this is me being very picky is that the photo is tilted.  has a bit of a right lean.  might have been quite difficult though to get this perfect.</td>', 'Excellent job lining up the photo with the real deal.  The background does''t line up well, but your glasses line up perfectly.  Creative for sure.  And VERY well done.  Focus and clarity are good as well.  Only thing I notice, and this is me being very picky is that the photo is tilted.  has a bit of a right lean.  might have been quite difficult though to get this perfect.', '2003-06-21 20:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(334374, 25029, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the hidden setting, like you have a little fort in there!</td>', 'I like the hidden setting, like you have a little fort in there!', '2003-06-21 20:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334376, 24624, 6565, '<td valign="top">Would have liked a tiny bit of white space above your head, but the shapes of light and dark work well together.</td>', 'Would have liked a tiny bit of white space above your head, but the shapes of light and dark work well together.', '2003-06-21 20:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(334378, 24882, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like how your body art adds to the light and dark tones in this image.</td>', 'I like how your body art adds to the light and dark tones in this image.', '2003-06-21 20:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334379, 25272, 3080, '<td valign="top">The lighting on your bra is WAY too bright.  It also creates hot spots on your cheek, nose and chest.  I like the idea a lot.  I think it looks good.  But the lighting is spoiling it for me.  Focus seems a bit soft as well.  sometimes soft focus works, but here I would like to see some crisp details of your face.  neat idea.</td>', 'The lighting on your bra is WAY too bright.  It also creates hot spots on your cheek, nose and chest.  I like the idea a lot.  I think it looks good.  But the lighting is spoiling it for me.  Focus seems a bit soft as well.  sometimes soft focus works, but here I would like to see some crisp details of your face.  neat idea.', '2003-06-21 20:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334381, 25278, 3080, '<td valign="top">I wish that the left side of the shot wasn''t so dark.  it is ok on the goggles, but your eye is totally in darkness.  the focus seems a bit soft as well.  The sharpest focus seems to be on the black part of the mouthpiece, where it meets the light colored snorkel.  Nice desaturation though.  and definately interesting.</td>', 'I wish that the left side of the shot wasn''t so dark.  it is ok on the goggles, but your eye is totally in darkness.  the focus seems a bit soft as well.  The sharpest focus seems to be on the black part of the mouthpiece, where it meets the light colored snorkel.  Nice desaturation though.  and definately interesting.', '2003-06-21 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334382, 25232, 3080, '<td valign="top">the lighting on your face is a little harsh here, making you look a bit yellow.  just doesn''t look natural.  Focus and clarity are really awesome though.  I like the angle.  Although I looked at it for a long time with my head tilted, I think it adds character.  you have really nice eyes.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'the lighting on your face is a little harsh here, making you look a bit yellow.  just doesn''t look natural.  Focus and clarity are really awesome though.  I like the angle.  Although I looked at it for a long time with my head tilted, I think it adds character.  you have really nice eyes.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-21 20:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(334383, 25037, 4767, '<td valign="top">You are a brave soul to share this with us...  or is it easier to show parts than expose your Self through your eyes, your facial expression?  I fear too many may see this as ''nekkid,'' though l hope we''re not all that puerile.</td>', 'You are a brave soul to share this with us...  or is it easier to show parts than expose your Self through your eyes, your facial expression?  I fear too many may see this as ''nekkid,'' though l hope we''re not all that puerile.', '2003-06-21 21:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334386, 24676, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, I''m trying to work out the geometry of this scene in my head, this is one funky shot! I''d prefer a more natural color balance though.</td>', 'Wow, I''m trying to work out the geometry of this scene in my head, this is one funky shot! I''d prefer a more natural color balance though.', '2003-06-21 21:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334393, 25188, 6388, '<td valign="top">i actually laughed out loud.  thanks.</td>', 'i actually laughed out loud.  thanks.', '2003-06-21 21:49:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334395, 25078, 4380, '<td valign="top">oooops its almost ten for me for the concept, i really like the idea, but the image is quite blurry in my screen. if i were you i will crop it, all white background, well, if i followed my criteria, you i still got a high score from me...good luck to the challenge.</td>', 'oooops its almost ten for me for the concept, i really like the idea, but the image is quite blurry in my screen. if i were you i will crop it, all white background, well, if i followed my criteria, you i still got a high score from me...good luck to the challenge.', '2003-06-21 21:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334396, 25185, 4380, '<td valign="top">quite funny, great concept...but the cow is more on focus...well, i guess you want to portray something here...got a high score from me...good luck dudes!</td>', 'quite funny, great concept...but the cow is more on focus...well, i guess you want to portray something here...got a high score from me...good luck dudes!', '2003-06-21 21:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(334397, 24894, 4380, '<td valign="top">good concept and sepia colour...i like the way you framed your half face...congrats...got a high score from me.....GOOD LUCK!</td>', 'good concept and sepia colour...i like the way you framed your half face...congrats...got a high score from me.....GOOD LUCK!', '2003-06-21 21:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334399, 25285, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice shoots, a classic posing, and a perfect smile...congrats...</td>', 'nice shoots, a classic posing, and a perfect smile...congrats...', '2003-06-21 21:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334401, 25093, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice play of light and shadows...also like the colour...GREATTTTTT!</td>', 'nice play of light and shadows...also like the colour...GREATTTTTT!', '2003-06-21 22:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334403, 25093, 1863, '<td valign="top">oooer! just ooooer! Beautiful lighting in this one. The mood is beautiful. I wonder what you''re thinking.</td>', 'oooer! just ooooer! Beautiful lighting in this one. The mood is beautiful. I wonder what you''re thinking.', '2003-06-21 22:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(334404, 25166, 8911, '<td valign="top">The title would suggest that you are the person in the foreground. The focus, however, has settled on the guy on the stool behind you, leaving you slightly more blurred than motion would account for; the glare from the window adds to that.<br/> <br/>It''s still a very nice shot, good tones and a lovely setup - I think it could have been more with better focus and maybe a bit less glare if that could have been achieved, though.</td>', 'The title would suggest that you are the person in the foreground. The focus, however, has settled on the guy on the stool behind you, leaving you slightly more blurred than motion would account for; the glare from the window adds to that. It''s still a very nice shot, good tones and a lovely setup - I think it could have been more with better focus and maybe a bit less glare if that could have been achieved, though.', '2003-06-21 22:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334406, 24661, 1863, '<td valign="top">Charming, just charming! I think black and white suits this very well. Very self deprecating portrait.</td>', 'Charming, just charming! I think black and white suits this very well. Very self deprecating portrait.', '2003-06-21 22:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(334409, 25046, 8911, '<td valign="top">In most circumstances, including some of my own recent photos, I consider blurriness and washed-out looks a flaw. Not here - it goes well with your title/theme and is mild enough to work as a stylistic element - a nice photograph.</td>', 'In most circumstances, including some of my own recent photos, I consider blurriness and washed-out looks a flaw. Not here - it goes well with your title/theme and is mild enough to work as a stylistic element - a nice photograph.', '2003-06-21 22:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334410, 24885, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the way the over-exposure makes this one look like a sketch, as much as a photo. What a lovely moment to capture for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the way the over-exposure makes this one look like a sketch, as much as a photo. What a lovely moment to capture for this challenge.', '2003-06-21 22:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(334416, 25249, 8911, '<td valign="top">Red-eye might be a more impressive effect if it didn''t come with cyan-speckled nose, cheeks, and ears. As it is, it looks like you have a bizarre rash.</td>', 'Red-eye might be a more impressive effect if it didn''t come with cyan-speckled nose, cheeks, and ears. As it is, it looks like you have a bizarre rash.', '2003-06-21 22:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(334421, 24569, 2586, '<td valign="top">What a scary sob you are! Am afraid that if i give you a low score the guy in the middle will come after me. So, the National Enquirer is right after all: 3-headed monsters do exist!<br/>Some suggestions: there''s a lot of useless black space at the top; would have cropped near the top of the forehead. Would have recommended wearing a black scarf or something since the neck is rather uncomfortable to contemplate and since it has very light shapes, it draws attention to that area and away from the face, eh faces, and tend to lead the eye out of the pic. <br/>The portraits on the left and right are great. Great lighting resulting in beautiful and intriguing shapes Particularly like the catch light in the eye on the left portrait.  Mr Left and Mr Right look like sympathetic characters (also seem to have a very sensual mouth but let me not  dwell on that, lol).<br/>It''s the guy in the middle that gives me the creeps. Oddly enough, he seems about double the age of the other two guys. That''s what you get with those double exposures, i guess :)  It isn''t really a double exposure but a long one.  He looks like he''s a debt collector or a repossessor of automobiles on which payments have fallen behind or a mafia hitman or perhaps he represents the prototype of the dpc does-not-meet-the-challenge-1 voter. I really feel sorry for Mr Left and Mr Right that they have to put up with this creep. They ought to stick their heads together and come up with a scheme to eliminate the middleman. Poison him or burn him into oblivion (burn not dodge!) or drag him to the recycle bin.  Hope it all works out for Mr Left and Mr Right.<br/>This image has Dostoyevski overtones to it. It seems to tell the story of good and evil. I hope for you that it will have a hollywoody happy ending and not end up being one of those Dostoyevski miseries where everything and everybody is going to hell and you already know that by page 3 and then have another 700 pages of  the most depressing  miseries to go through. <br/>My initial reaction to this pic was that i did not like it. However, it obviously generated a lot of interest in me and got my imagination all fired up. In other words, it has a lot of impact. I also love the title.  So, i''ll give it my top score for now and hope this pic does well in the challenge.<br/>Sorry for writing such a long comment but when an image really hits me, i get carried away.  Oh, and i also hope you drop the rule of thirds and reclaim self-rule. 8</td>', 'What a scary sob you are! Am afraid that if i give you a low score the guy in the middle will come after me. So, the National Enquirer is right after all: 3-headed monsters do exist!Some suggestions: there''s a lot of useless black space at the top; would have cropped near the top of the forehead. Would have recommended wearing a black scarf or something since the neck is rather uncomfortable to contemplate and since it has very light shapes, it draws attention to that area and away from the face, eh faces, and tend to lead the eye out of the pic. The portraits on the left and right are great. Great lighting resulting in beautiful and intriguing shapes Particularly like the catch light in the eye on the left portrait.  Mr Left and Mr Right look like sympathetic characters (also seem to have a very sensual mouth but let me not  dwell on that, lol).It''s the guy in the middle that gives me the creeps. Oddly enough, he seems about double the age of the other two guys. That''s what you get with those double exposures, i guess :)  It isn''t really a double exposure but a long one.  He looks like he''s a debt collector or a repossessor of automobiles on which payments have fallen behind or a mafia hitman or perhaps he represents the prototype of the dpc does-not-meet-the-challenge-1 voter. I really feel sorry for Mr Left and Mr Right that they have to put up with this creep. They ought to stick their heads together and come up with a scheme to eliminate the middleman. Poison him or burn him into oblivion (burn not dodge!) or drag him to the recycle bin.  Hope it all works out for Mr Left and Mr Right.This image has Dostoyevski overtones to it. It seems to tell the story of good and evil. I hope for you that it will have a hollywoody happy ending and not end up being one of those Dostoyevski miseries where everything and everybody is going to hell and you already know that by page 3 and then have another 700 pages of  the most depressing  miseries to go through. My initial reaction to this pic was that i did not like it. However, it obviously generated a lot of interest in me and got my imagination all fired up. In other words, it has a lot of impact. I also love the title.  So, i''ll give it my top score for now and hope this pic does well in the challenge.Sorry for writing such a long comment but when an image really hits me, i get carried away.  Oh, and i also hope you drop the rule of thirds and reclaim self-rule. 8', '2003-06-21 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334427, 25272, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the very literal use of framing in this picture. :)</td>', 'I like the very literal use of framing in this picture. :)', '2003-06-21 23:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334429, 25097, 8637, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but way too much flash.  thanks</td>', 'Nice photo but way too much flash.  thanks', '2003-06-21 23:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(334431, 24767, 7485, '<td valign="top">Maybe not a portrait, but a lovely nude. The grain effect works very well here.</td>', 'Maybe not a portrait, but a lovely nude. The grain effect works very well here.', '2003-06-21 23:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(334432, 24746, 8637, '<td valign="top">Little out of focus...thanks</td>', 'Little out of focus...thanks', '2003-06-21 23:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(334434, 24763, 1280, '<td valign="top">Different but good!</td>', 'Different but good!', '2003-06-21 23:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(334436, 24682, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Good job....has impact.  I like the comp very much, as well as the lighting.  The focus on your eye could be sharper though.</td>', 'Wow!  Good job....has impact.  I like the comp very much, as well as the lighting.  The focus on your eye could be sharper though.', '2003-06-21 23:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(334438, 25236, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but I find the camera strap and sideways chair distracting.</td>', 'Great idea, but I find the camera strap and sideways chair distracting.', '2003-06-21 23:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(334439, 24838, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice, nice effect. Especially like the weird and interesting colors that the shot made out of your face, against the shadows/coolness of the background.</td>', 'Nice, nice effect. Especially like the weird and interesting colors that the shot made out of your face, against the shadows/coolness of the background.', '2003-06-21 23:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(334440, 24555, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good clarity, especially in your eyes.</td>', 'Good clarity, especially in your eyes.', '2003-06-21 23:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334441, 24577, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed this shot - the angle works with the lighting to make it nicely dramatic. Beautiful!</td>', 'I like the way you framed this shot - the angle works with the lighting to make it nicely dramatic. Beautiful!', '2003-06-21 23:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(334442, 25095, 8911, '<td valign="top">Bravo. Attractive enough, but what made this a winner for me was the sheer novelty of the concept. I like the idea of a person as a puzzle! (I also like the fact that you played fast and loose with either two puzzles or a double shot of yourself - the eyes in the upper right corner are nicely positioned and it took me a while to realize that with a third eye in the lower left, something was weird....)</td>', 'Bravo. Attractive enough, but what made this a winner for me was the sheer novelty of the concept. I like the idea of a person as a puzzle! (I also like the fact that you played fast and loose with either two puzzles or a double shot of yourself - the eyes in the upper right corner are nicely positioned and it took me a while to realize that with a third eye in the lower left, something was weird....)', '2003-06-21 23:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(334444, 24650, 2586, '<td valign="top">And here''s the other half of the Sidwell combo! You guys make it so blatantly obvious who you are; what''s this, vote-pandering??? The problem is one has an original idea and the other is just a copycat and stealing the now famous flower bouquet prop, too. All joking aside, these two pictures would make a very nice diptych and i do like your combined efforts in these self portraits and the two of you do come across as a great team! Lovely colors. The reddish cast in your hair and the orange/red colors are a nice complementary to the greens in the background. 7<br/>When i look at this portrait i see a warm and sympathetic woman. A good woman! And since a good woman is so tough to find i''ll up her picture to a 9. Dsidwell better not be jealous of the score discrepancy; he ought to know that he is a doggone lucky guy. 9</td>', 'And here''s the other half of the Sidwell combo! You guys make it so blatantly obvious who you are; what''s this, vote-pandering??? The problem is one has an original idea and the other is just a copycat and stealing the now famous flower bouquet prop, too. All joking aside, these two pictures would make a very nice diptych and i do like your combined efforts in these self portraits and the two of you do come across as a great team! Lovely colors. The reddish cast in your hair and the orange/red colors are a nice complementary to the greens in the background. 7When i look at this portrait i see a warm and sympathetic woman. A good woman! And since a good woman is so tough to find i''ll up her picture to a 9. Dsidwell better not be jealous of the score discrepancy; he ought to know that he is a doggone lucky guy. 9', '2003-06-21 23:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334445, 25192, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this. I''m not 100% sure even now whether I''m looking at you and someone else connecting, or at a mirrored shot; the angle to each face is such that it''s hard to be sure, easy to see them as different, and yet in all probability a reflection. I love that, and the choice of black and white for this photo was a good one; I think color would have distracted, in this shot.</td>', 'I like this. I''m not 100% sure even now whether I''m looking at you and someone else connecting, or at a mirrored shot; the angle to each face is such that it''s hard to be sure, easy to see them as different, and yet in all probability a reflection. I love that, and the choice of black and white for this photo was a good one; I think color would have distracted, in this shot.', '2003-06-21 23:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(334446, 24737, 8911, '<td valign="top">Is that supposed to be literal? I''m not seeing any reflections of you or hidden camera tricks, which is what I expected from the title. I''m not sure what I am seeing - they look like, perhaps, fake boulders, till you see what looks like a person-statue in the upper right. I''m not sure what I''m looking at a picture of, nor how it relates to you, in the end.</td>', 'Is that supposed to be literal? I''m not seeing any reflections of you or hidden camera tricks, which is what I expected from the title. I''m not sure what I am seeing - they look like, perhaps, fake boulders, till you see what looks like a person-statue in the upper right. I''m not sure what I''m looking at a picture of, nor how it relates to you, in the end.', '2003-06-21 23:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334447, 25217, 8911, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but it didn''t work for me. I had to scroll to see you - when the photo first appeared, all I saw was the blank white, and it still seemed to take up too much of the photo even realizing what your intent was. Also, I''m not sure why the grey look creeps in at the edges - something in the lighting? - but it''s distracting.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but it didn''t work for me. I had to scroll to see you - when the photo first appeared, all I saw was the blank white, and it still seemed to take up too much of the photo even realizing what your intent was. Also, I''m not sure why the grey look creeps in at the edges - something in the lighting? - but it''s distracting.', '2003-06-21 23:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(334449, 24820, 1280, '<td valign="top">High key, interesting expression, very serious.  Nice job!</td>', 'High key, interesting expression, very serious.  Nice job!', '2003-06-21 23:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334450, 24593, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast of colors, the green against the red, but they dominate the picture far more than you do. Your face is blurred and in shadow, and tinged by the adjacent colors in both directions. That may have been your intent, but I find it off-putting for the subject to be so - unsubject-like. The whole photo, really, seems to lack a focus, with the only thing not blurred in some degree being the brilliant but fairly undifferentiated green. My eyes "wow" on the green but they don''t quite know where to stop and rest.</td>', 'I like the contrast of colors, the green against the red, but they dominate the picture far more than you do. Your face is blurred and in shadow, and tinged by the adjacent colors in both directions. That may have been your intent, but I find it off-putting for the subject to be so - unsubject-like. The whole photo, really, seems to lack a focus, with the only thing not blurred in some degree being the brilliant but fairly undifferentiated green. My eyes "wow" on the green but they don''t quite know where to stop and rest.', '2003-06-21 23:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(334451, 24818, 7485, '<td valign="top">Scary! Very effective use of harsh shadows.</td>', 'Scary! Very effective use of harsh shadows.', '2003-06-21 23:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334452, 24994, 8911, '<td valign="top">Not sure why this is ''blue side'' - there''s no blue - and it looks like it''s been edited fairly substantially. The editing hasn''t left enough detail for me to really get a sense of you; it could almost be an ink blot. It''s stark, but also unreachable, for me.</td>', 'Not sure why this is ''blue side'' - there''s no blue - and it looks like it''s been edited fairly substantially. The editing hasn''t left enough detail for me to really get a sense of you; it could almost be an ink blot. It''s stark, but also unreachable, for me.', '2003-06-21 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334453, 24828, 5958, '<td valign="top">OMG -- this one has to be my fav of all of them.  Your eyes tell the whole story LOL.  How timely :)  best of luck!</td>', 'OMG -- this one has to be my fav of all of them.  Your eyes tell the whole story LOL.  How timely :)  best of luck!', '2003-06-21 23:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(334454, 24894, 5958, '<td valign="top">This is just toooooooooo weird --- so I LOVE IT! :)<br/>Awesome work!</td>', 'This is just toooooooooo weird --- so I LOVE IT! :)Awesome work!', '2003-06-21 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334455, 24887, 5958, '<td valign="top">This one is just beautiful........heck, I''d probably hang it :)</td>', 'This one is just beautiful........heck, I''d probably hang it :)', '2003-06-21 23:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334456, 25130, 1280, '<td valign="top">What''s good about this is that you included an environment that represents a part of yourself.  Good job!</td>', 'What''s good about this is that you included an environment that represents a part of yourself.  Good job!', '2003-06-21 23:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334457, 25099, 8911, '<td valign="top">I found the reflections in your sunglasses very distracting - mostly because they didn''t seem to fit the ''feel'' of the photo or its title; if there had been plants/trees there without the road, it might have worked better. Nice backdrop, though.</td>', 'I found the reflections in your sunglasses very distracting - mostly because they didn''t seem to fit the ''feel'' of the photo or its title; if there had been plants/trees there without the road, it might have worked better. Nice backdrop, though.', '2003-06-21 23:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334458, 25056, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but the focus is a little too soft on the eye. The frame is distracting.</td>', 'Great idea, but the focus is a little too soft on the eye. The frame is distracting.', '2003-06-21 23:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334459, 24589, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like the device of framing yourself with your hands, though it looks less shy than precise or even show-offy to me. Regardless, it works well!</td>', 'I like the device of framing yourself with your hands, though it looks less shy than precise or even show-offy to me. Regardless, it works well!', '2003-06-21 23:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334460, 25101, 1280, '<td valign="top">Unique idea and well executed.</td>', 'Unique idea and well executed.', '2003-06-21 23:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334461, 25108, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, sweet. I like the space on the left side that keeps your face from being overpowering or overpowered - a nice balance there - and the strand of hair hanging down over your face makes the picture, in many ways. Beautiful.</td>', 'Nice, simple, sweet. I like the space on the left side that keeps your face from being overpowering or overpowered - a nice balance there - and the strand of hair hanging down over your face makes the picture, in many ways. Beautiful.', '2003-06-21 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334462, 25234, 8911, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing a grin, but the plants and specs are definitely there. I love the composition on this one - the way you''ve framed yourself with the plant.</td>', 'I''m not seeing a grin, but the plants and specs are definitely there. I love the composition on this one - the way you''ve framed yourself with the plant.', '2003-06-21 23:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334463, 24769, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good focus, and it feels like you are extending your hand for a handshake.</td>', 'Good focus, and it feels like you are extending your hand for a handshake.', '2003-06-21 23:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(334464, 25035, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this one - it was easy to figure out what you''d done, but it doesn''t make the effect any less powerful. The camera focussed more on your hair than your face, so that you''re slightly softened, and yet that only - for the effect you are going for - makes the photo more powerful. A nice shot.</td>', 'I like this one - it was easy to figure out what you''d done, but it doesn''t make the effect any less powerful. The camera focussed more on your hair than your face, so that you''re slightly softened, and yet that only - for the effect you are going for - makes the photo more powerful. A nice shot.', '2003-06-21 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334465, 24633, 7485, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective pose. Adding some backlight would have given more definition to the outlines and hair.</td>', 'Simple but effective pose. Adding some backlight would have given more definition to the outlines and hair.', '2003-06-21 23:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334466, 24811, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice to see a smile!!  Good job!</td>', 'Nice to see a smile!!  Good job!', '2003-06-21 23:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(334467, 25020, 8911, '<td valign="top">I can only think that posing for this must have gotten a bit old - I hope you didn''t need too many shots to get this one. I didn''t get it from thumbnail but this is wonderfully funny!</td>', 'I can only think that posing for this must have gotten a bit old - I hope you didn''t need too many shots to get this one. I didn''t get it from thumbnail but this is wonderfully funny!', '2003-06-21 23:53:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(334469, 24709, 8911, '<td valign="top">The candle looks like something out of a classic painting, after the slow exposure, but it''s lit you wonderfully for this shot - it works, and works well.</td>', 'The candle looks like something out of a classic painting, after the slow exposure, but it''s lit you wonderfully for this shot - it works, and works well.', '2003-06-21 23:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(334470, 25085, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is exactly how most people usually see me!  Nicely composed, and good choice of black and white.  Works well here.</td>', 'This is exactly how most people usually see me!  Nicely composed, and good choice of black and white.  Works well here.', '2003-06-21 23:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(334471, 24751, 8911, '<td valign="top">Nice. I especially like that, not only is the rear-view reflecting you, your sunglasses are reflecting the road ahead. I do wish the rest of the picture weren''t quite so glaring, but I wouldn''t want it to be clear either, since the focus of interest is (and should be) on the mirror!</td>', 'Nice. I especially like that, not only is the rear-view reflecting you, your sunglasses are reflecting the road ahead. I do wish the rest of the picture weren''t quite so glaring, but I wouldn''t want it to be clear either, since the focus of interest is (and should be) on the mirror!', '2003-06-21 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(334472, 25119, 7485, '<td valign="top">Intreresting idea, but really distracting dust on the lens</td>', 'Intreresting idea, but really distracting dust on the lens', '2003-06-22 00:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(334473, 25176, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice...a little different, which makes it interesting.</td>', 'Nice...a little different, which makes it interesting.', '2003-06-22 00:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334474, 24676, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this, though I find it really hard to figure out where you actually are in the picture. Very disorienting. This is one I''d love to know how it was set up - it works really well. Like the framing with your hands.</td>', 'I like this, though I find it really hard to figure out where you actually are in the picture. Very disorienting. This is one I''d love to know how it was set up - it works really well. Like the framing with your hands.', '2003-06-22 00:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334481, 25275, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is so lovely!  The setting sun has cast a wonderful glow on you both.  The child is so involved and draws me in.  I must admit the railing gets in the way somewhat....distracting.  But it also leads in, so what do I know????  LOL  But no leading line is necessary really.  9<br/>Over all I like this very much.  Warm and emotive.  Great job!  Good luck.</td>', 'This is so lovely!  The setting sun has cast a wonderful glow on you both.  The child is so involved and draws me in.  I must admit the railing gets in the way somewhat....distracting.  But it also leads in, so what do I know????  LOL  But no leading line is necessary really.  9Over all I like this very much.  Warm and emotive.  Great job!  Good luck.', '2003-06-22 00:10:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334482, 25212, 8911, '<td valign="top">Thank you - this was good for a giggle, and is also nicely framed/shot.</td>', 'Thank you - this was good for a giggle, and is also nicely framed/shot.', '2003-06-22 00:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(334483, 25082, 7869, '<td valign="top">this doesn''t say sadness to me, it says fear</td>', 'this doesn''t say sadness to me, it says fear', '2003-06-22 00:11:36.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(334484, 25058, 1280, '<td valign="top">I love that you are actually holding a pencil!  Smart move!  Over all this is an interesting/artsy shot.  Well done!</td>', 'I love that you are actually holding a pencil!  Smart move!  Over all this is an interesting/artsy shot.  Well done!', '2003-06-22 00:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334488, 25057, 6597, '<td valign="top">does''t look like portrait to me</td>', 'does''t look like portrait to me', '2003-06-22 00:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334490, 24820, 7869, '<td valign="top">kind of overexposed, good pic</td>', 'kind of overexposed, good pic', '2003-06-22 00:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334491, 25132, 1280, '<td valign="top">Fun shot!</td>', 'Fun shot!', '2003-06-22 00:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(334492, 24886, 7869, '<td valign="top">another nosetril shot</td>', 'another nosetril shot', '2003-06-22 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334496, 24885, 7869, '<td valign="top">too bright and overexposed</td>', 'too bright and overexposed', '2003-06-22 00:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(334497, 25098, 7869, '<td valign="top">blury</td>', 'blury', '2003-06-22 00:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334505, 25057, 7869, '<td valign="top">is this what you call a self-portrait?<br/>i dont like the idea and i don''t like the photo, sorry</td>', 'is this what you call a self-portrait?i dont like the idea and i don''t like the photo, sorry', '2003-06-22 00:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334506, 24814, 7869, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2003-06-22 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334508, 24889, 7869, '<td valign="top">oh what a title! <br/>another brave girl here!</td>', 'oh what a title! another brave girl here!', '2003-06-22 00:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334513, 24661, 2792, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Some of the best reading happens in the bathroom.  :p  There apparently are three John''s here.  =-)  Nice use of B&amp;W</td>', 'LOL.  Some of the best reading happens in the bathroom.  :p  There apparently are three John''s here.  =-)  Nice use of B&W', '2003-06-22 00:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334521, 25163, 3080, '<td valign="top">Why would you be angry for a self portrait?  This isn''t the most flattering pose.  I think I would like to see your eyes in a bit better focus.  They seem soft to me here.  it looks like you have your eye brow pierced, but we can''t really see it enough for it to enhance the photo any, I find it to be a bit of a distraction here.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Why would you be angry for a self portrait?  This isn''t the most flattering pose.  I think I would like to see your eyes in a bit better focus.  They seem soft to me here.  it looks like you have your eye brow pierced, but we can''t really see it enough for it to enhance the photo any, I find it to be a bit of a distraction here.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-22 01:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334522, 25272, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and very well shot. But if that''s a bad hair day for you, then your hair must look exceptional on a good day!</td>', 'Great idea and very well shot. But if that''s a bad hair day for you, then your hair must look exceptional on a good day!', '2003-06-22 01:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(334523, 24555, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes.  The lighting on your nose is a little harsh though.  Also, I find the ring of hair to the left of the photo to be a bit distracting.  I''m not sure about the crop.  I don''t think it should go right through  your mouth.  i''m wondering if showing your mouth would have been better?  Either that or cropping closer to your eyes.  The shadows are also a little distracting.  I like the closeness though.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice eyes.  The lighting on your nose is a little harsh though.  Also, I find the ring of hair to the left of the photo to be a bit distracting.  I''m not sure about the crop.  I don''t think it should go right through  your mouth.  i''m wondering if showing your mouth would have been better?  Either that or cropping closer to your eyes.  The shadows are also a little distracting.  I like the closeness though.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-22 01:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(334525, 25106, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is good as well.  The only thing that bothers me a bit are the horizontal lines going through the dark areas on the left of the photo.  You did an excellent job photographing glasses without glares or reflections.  Very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are good, and the focus is good as well.  The only thing that bothers me a bit are the horizontal lines going through the dark areas on the left of the photo.  You did an excellent job photographing glasses without glares or reflections.  Very nice. ~Heather~', '2003-06-22 01:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334527, 24928, 3080, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but it doesn''t really appeal much to me.  Your focus is good on the main eye.  I''ve never been a fan of up your nose kind of shots.  I think "Blair witch project" ruined that for me. lol.  Definately different, just not really my cup of tea.<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'Interesting, but it doesn''t really appeal much to me.  Your focus is good on the main eye.  I''ve never been a fan of up your nose kind of shots.  I think "Blair witch project" ruined that for me. lol.  Definately different, just not really my cup of tea.~Heather~', '2003-06-22 01:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334536, 24650, 7485, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, a pair of portraits! Same comment applies here too: exactly what a self-portrait should do, tell something about yourself. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Neat idea, a pair of portraits! Same comment applies here too: exactly what a self-portrait should do, tell something about yourself. Very nicely done.', '2003-06-22 01:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334541, 24723, 8732, '<td valign="top">Although I think the contrast in the photo is a little too high, I can''t help giving it a 10. I love it. You used the mirror/reflection method well, and conveyed so much more emotion than a lot of the entries in this challenge.</td>', 'Although I think the contrast in the photo is a little too high, I can''t help giving it a 10. I love it. You used the mirror/reflection method well, and conveyed so much more emotion than a lot of the entries in this challenge.', '2003-06-22 01:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334544, 24593, 7485, '<td valign="top">The saturated colors separated by the black are a great idea, but the in-focus shoulder with out-of-focus face is odd.</td>', 'The saturated colors separated by the black are a great idea, but the in-focus shoulder with out-of-focus face is odd.', '2003-06-22 01:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334547, 25281, 8732, '<td valign="top">Although I think you are very beautiful, I''m trying to be objective so that had no effect on the high score I gave you. I love the shadows, tones, and textures in your portrait. Good work.</td>', 'Although I think you are very beautiful, I''m trying to be objective so that had no effect on the high score I gave you. I love the shadows, tones, and textures in your portrait. Good work.', '2003-06-22 01:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(334551, 24887, 8732, '<td valign="top">At first I wasn''t sure if I liked the large ammount of pure white background, but after coming back to your portrait I have decided that it is indeed a nice use of negative space. I also like the blue in your eyes because it is subtle and not so bright that it looks bad in contrast with the sepia (i think?) tones of the rest. 9</td>', 'At first I wasn''t sure if I liked the large ammount of pure white background, but after coming back to your portrait I have decided that it is indeed a nice use of negative space. I also like the blue in your eyes because it is subtle and not so bright that it looks bad in contrast with the sepia (i think?) tones of the rest. 9', '2003-06-22 01:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(334554, 25305, 8732, '<td valign="top">Its a wonderful portrait - very intense.  The only things that kind of bother me are the DOF - i would like to see your eye in sharper focus, and the crop - I think maybe less of the nose should be included so that it is exactly half of your face. 8.</td>', 'Its a wonderful portrait - very intense.  The only things that kind of bother me are the DOF - i would like to see your eye in sharper focus, and the crop - I think maybe less of the nose should be included so that it is exactly half of your face. 8.', '2003-06-22 01:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(334556, 24589, 8732, '<td valign="top">I almost think you could do without the border since the picture seems to frame itself. Well done though. You have a photo that has taken a more creative approach to the "I am a photographer" portrait. I also like the choice of sepia tones for this image.</td>', 'I almost think you could do without the border since the picture seems to frame itself. Well done though. You have a photo that has taken a more creative approach to the "I am a photographer" portrait. I also like the choice of sepia tones for this image.', '2003-06-22 01:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(334558, 25078, 8732, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''re getting lots of comments saying that your portrait is blurry and out of focus, but I would just like to say that I really like this photo.  I like the slight shadow on the wall, the simple colors, and i like the soft focus. Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sure you''re getting lots of comments saying that your portrait is blurry and out of focus, but I would just like to say that I really like this photo.  I like the slight shadow on the wall, the simple colors, and i like the soft focus. Good luck.', '2003-06-22 01:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334559, 24557, 8732, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked to have seen this with a little less contrasting and a few more gray hues thrown in there. It seems like an interesting picture, but because its so dark, its hard to figure it out.</td>', 'I think I would have liked to have seen this with a little less contrasting and a few more gray hues thrown in there. It seems like an interesting picture, but because its so dark, its hard to figure it out.', '2003-06-22 01:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334560, 25195, 8732, '<td valign="top">Part of me feels like the only thing really making this photo interesting is the neg-art colors, but even if it is only the colors that make it more than just average, I do like it. The look on your face is very intense and very powerful. I like the DOF so that your hand is blury but your face is in sharp focus. 8. Sorry if this comment is very contradictory ;-)</td>', 'Part of me feels like the only thing really making this photo interesting is the neg-art colors, but even if it is only the colors that make it more than just average, I do like it. The look on your face is very intense and very powerful. I like the DOF so that your hand is blury but your face is in sharp focus. 8. Sorry if this comment is very contradictory ;-)', '2003-06-22 01:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334567, 25113, 5822, '<td valign="top">This photo seems unorganized, cluttered, with poor lighting and little artistic value, yet it is colorful, interesting to look at, funny, well exposed, cheerful, makes me smile, and I see the subject as being loveable.  An informal portrait such as this one tells much more about the person and is more honest in it''s depiction of the subject than the formal variety kind, IMO. In addition, this picture tells a story.  There is much for the viewer to feast on here.  Nice job.</td>', 'This photo seems unorganized, cluttered, with poor lighting and little artistic value, yet it is colorful, interesting to look at, funny, well exposed, cheerful, makes me smile, and I see the subject as being loveable.  An informal portrait such as this one tells much more about the person and is more honest in it''s depiction of the subject than the formal variety kind, IMO. In addition, this picture tells a story.  There is much for the viewer to feast on here.  Nice job.', '2003-06-22 02:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(334576, 25234, 70, '<td valign="top">Your hair is truly awesome.</td>', 'Your hair is truly awesome.', '2003-06-22 03:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334614, 24955, 5792, '<td valign="top">One of the more unique self-portraits. Psychoanalysts would have a field day with it.</td>', 'One of the more unique self-portraits. Psychoanalysts would have a field day with it.', '2003-06-22 06:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334616, 25043, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful expression. Creative self-portrait.</td>', 'Wonderful expression. Creative self-portrait.', '2003-06-22 06:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334640, 25095, 8274, '<td valign="top">One of the more creative pictures in this challenge</td>', 'One of the more creative pictures in this challenge', '2003-06-22 09:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334644, 25258, 5235, '<td valign="top">i like the warm tone of yellow.  good shot.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'i like the warm tone of yellow.  good shot.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-06-22 09:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334646, 25188, 5235, '<td valign="top">dramatic use of light/shadow.  funny composition.  good luck!</td>', 'dramatic use of light/shadow.  funny composition.  good luck!', '2003-06-22 09:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(334647, 25095, 5235, '<td valign="top">good idea.  good luck</td>', 'good idea.  good luck', '2003-06-22 09:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(334650, 24814, 5235, '<td valign="top">i like a lot the composition + reflections.  good luck.</td>', 'i like a lot the composition + reflections.  good luck.', '2003-06-22 09:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334651, 24894, 5235, '<td valign="top">very creative.  congratulations!</td>', 'very creative.  congratulations!', '2003-06-22 09:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(334657, 25234, 5235, '<td valign="top">i like the way the branchs seem to wave like your hair.  oppsss, or the opposite? <br/>:-)   good luck!</td>', 'i like the way the branchs seem to wave like your hair.  oppsss, or the opposite? :-)   good luck!', '2003-06-22 09:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(334659, 24671, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish the pan did not seem to be impaled in your head.  I also find that your skin tones to be too dark.</td>', 'I wish the pan did not seem to be impaled in your head.  I also find that your skin tones to be too dark.', '2003-06-22 09:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(334668, 24747, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like your pose, expression and pleasing features. Your face is well lit with a nice soft natural light despite the strong backlighting, but there appears to be a slight yellow color cast to the picture that is not flattering.  Also, I don''t like the sudden demarcation between the white and yellow background and find that the upper white part of the background is empty space that adds nothing to the photo. Focus is too soft as well.</td>', 'I like your pose, expression and pleasing features. Your face is well lit with a nice soft natural light despite the strong backlighting, but there appears to be a slight yellow color cast to the picture that is not flattering.  Also, I don''t like the sudden demarcation between the white and yellow background and find that the upper white part of the background is empty space that adds nothing to the photo. Focus is too soft as well.', '2003-06-22 09:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334676, 25297, 7628, '<td valign="top">I really lie how this pic goes with its title.  The face on the right really looks like a projection the way the blur radiates out from and become slightly larger than the crisp portrait on the left.  It has a nice ghostly quality while remaining clear enough to see details of eyes and mouth etc.  Very creative and skillful. 9</td>', 'I really lie how this pic goes with its title.  The face on the right really looks like a projection the way the blur radiates out from and become slightly larger than the crisp portrait on the left.  It has a nice ghostly quality while remaining clear enough to see details of eyes and mouth etc.  Very creative and skillful. 9', '2003-06-22 09:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(334682, 24955, 5822, '<td valign="top">Good job on elliminating all glare, and I like the contrasting deep, dark blue sky. However, I think the photo to be a tad bit underexposed and find that you are hard to make out in the mirror.  Maybe some fill light directed your way could have remedied this.  Also, I''m not crazy about the composition as I find the mirror and rocks to be prominent and command a majority of the attention here and you are secondary, which should not be the case in a portrait.</td>', 'Good job on elliminating all glare, and I like the contrasting deep, dark blue sky. However, I think the photo to be a tad bit underexposed and find that you are hard to make out in the mirror.  Maybe some fill light directed your way could have remedied this.  Also, I''m not crazy about the composition as I find the mirror and rocks to be prominent and command a majority of the attention here and you are secondary, which should not be the case in a portrait.', '2003-06-22 09:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(334688, 24964, 5822, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect but I find focus is not as sharp as could be. and I find the cable in the left part of the picture to be distracting. Also, wish your face was better illuminated on your left side.</td>', 'Interesting effect but I find focus is not as sharp as could be. and I find the cable in the left part of the picture to be distracting. Also, wish your face was better illuminated on your left side.', '2003-06-22 09:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(334692, 25284, 8274, '<td valign="top">Quite ugly, but worth good points</td>', 'Quite ugly, but worth good points', '2003-06-22 09:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334696, 24847, 6405, '<td valign="top">I would like it better with busy look instead of straight in the camera,but picture quality is superb, 9 from me!</td>', 'I would like it better with busy look instead of straight in the camera,but picture quality is superb, 9 from me!', '2003-06-22 10:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(334717, 24811, 1570, '<td valign="top">i love the mood you''ve created here... very dynamic and colorful... 8</td>', 'i love the mood you''ve created here... very dynamic and colorful... 8', '2003-06-22 10:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(334723, 25235, 3540, '<td valign="top">Need focus.  THe ears are funky red too.  Good idea, one i tried myself and failed at.</td>', 'Need focus.  THe ears are funky red too.  Good idea, one i tried myself and failed at.', '2003-06-22 10:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334726, 25034, 3540, '<td valign="top">Need to adjust lighting so the cleft in the chin isn''t quite so dark.  It looks extremely unnatural.  The rest of it is very good though.</td>', 'Need to adjust lighting so the cleft in the chin isn''t quite so dark.  It looks extremely unnatural.  The rest of it is very good though.', '2003-06-22 10:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334728, 25082, 3540, '<td valign="top">The tones and the smoothness of your skin make this look almost like a mannequin.  Could be a little clearer too.</td>', 'The tones and the smoothness of your skin make this look almost like a mannequin.  Could be a little clearer too.', '2003-06-22 10:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
