(334866, 25129, 3320, '<td valign="top">I like the agressivity and the ''voilence'' in this picture. Plust the realisation is very good with the hair looking like jail bars (intended I guess). Nice and original. one of my preferred this week. Yellow on the face a little too ''blown out''. 8. Lionel</td>', 'I like the agressivity and the ''voilence'' in this picture. Plust the realisation is very good with the hair looking like jail bars (intended I guess). Nice and original. one of my preferred this week. Yellow on the face a little too ''blown out''. 8. Lionel', '2003-06-22 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
