(335017, 24882, 7711, '<td valign="top">reminds me of the lead singer of sugar ray, mark mcgrath. Cool tattoos, and good lighting too, I like how you fill the frame.</td>', 'reminds me of the lead singer of sugar ray, mark mcgrath. Cool tattoos, and good lighting too, I like how you fill the frame.', '2003-06-22 20:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(335020, 24644, 8713, '<td valign="top">I like the way you cropped this photo. I also like the softness &amp; the slight touch of color.</td>', 'I like the way you cropped this photo. I also like the softness & the slight touch of color.', '2003-06-22 21:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(335021, 24847, 8713, '<td valign="top">Great composition, lighting &amp; photo. Good job.</td>', 'Great composition, lighting & photo. Good job.', '2003-06-22 21:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(335022, 25144, 8713, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped this a little tighter, having the background be only the screen. Nice photo. Good luck.</td>', 'I think I would have cropped this a little tighter, having the background be only the screen. Nice photo. Good luck.', '2003-06-22 21:06:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(335023, 24650, 7711, '<td valign="top">I saw this one back to back with "holding her" and I was blown away by how cute it was, and what a co-incidence that they would appear together on my random display. I didn''t get to comment on this one as I accidentally closed the browser, but I"ll take the time now to say the two shots together are adorable, and a great way to go beyond the challenge and show us something about you too.</td>', 'I saw this one back to back with "holding her" and I was blown away by how cute it was, and what a co-incidence that they would appear together on my random display. I didn''t get to comment on this one as I accidentally closed the browser, but I"ll take the time now to say the two shots together are adorable, and a great way to go beyond the challenge and show us something about you too.', '2003-06-22 21:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(335025, 24633, 7711, '<td valign="top">focus a bit soft on your eyes, but cool pose. :) brave dude.</td>', 'focus a bit soft on your eyes, but cool pose. :) brave dude.', '2003-06-22 21:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(335033, 25192, 7510, '<td valign="top">Hello,<br/>Interesting point of view.  It hints at what your whole face looks like with out quite giving it away.  NIce tones, and I like the slight grainyness.</td>', 'Hello,Interesting point of view.  It hints at what your whole face looks like with out quite giving it away.  NIce tones, and I like the slight grainyness.', '2003-06-22 21:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(335036, 25097, 7711, '<td valign="top">beautiful. :) I love the tiny and dark shape of your mouth, reminds me of cinnamon heards. The highlights of your hair are also just lovely. :) I love the contrast of background against the lips.</td>', 'beautiful. :) I love the tiny and dark shape of your mouth, reminds me of cinnamon heards. The highlights of your hair are also just lovely. :) I love the contrast of background against the lips.', '2003-06-22 21:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(335038, 25101, 7711, '<td valign="top">supremely clever, good focus and lighting. :)</td>', 'supremely clever, good focus and lighting. :)', '2003-06-22 21:22:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(335045, 25078, 7711, '<td valign="top">love it! Wish you hadn''t cut off the top of your head. Maybe a portrait instead of a landscape? The soft focus really creates a cool mood. I''m sure others dislike the lack of sharpness, but I think it works here.</td>', 'love it! Wish you hadn''t cut off the top of your head. Maybe a portrait instead of a landscape? The soft focus really creates a cool mood. I''m sure others dislike the lack of sharpness, but I think it works here.', '2003-06-22 21:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(335048, 24762, 7711, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the focus seems a bit soft and needs more contrast.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the focus seems a bit soft and needs more contrast.', '2003-06-22 21:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(335070, 24764, 3084, '<td valign="top">Well done.  A nice portrait and a good example of the challenge.  8  Morgan</td>', 'Well done.  A nice portrait and a good example of the challenge.  8  Morgan', '2003-06-22 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
