(335098, 24750, 7711, '<td valign="top">absolutely LOVE the high key. This is a technique I would really like to learn. Great selfportrait.</td>', 'absolutely LOVE the high key. This is a technique I would really like to learn. Great selfportrait.', '2003-06-22 21:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335115, 25164, 4007, '<td valign="top">Very unique, but the image quality here is pretty low.  If that''s beyond your control, then so be it, but if it is due to excessive post processing or poor shooting conditions that might be something to work on.</td>', 'Very unique, but the image quality here is pretty low.  If that''s beyond your control, then so be it, but if it is due to excessive post processing or poor shooting conditions that might be something to work on.', '2003-06-22 21:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(335118, 25274, 4007, '<td valign="top">It has a two dimensional feel to it for some reason.  I''m not sure why, but the flatness does seem to detract from the image.  I don''t know how to fix that problem though.</td>', 'It has a two dimensional feel to it for some reason.  I''m not sure why, but the flatness does seem to detract from the image.  I don''t know how to fix that problem though.', '2003-06-22 21:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(335119, 24928, 4007, '<td valign="top">The execution is very nice here, but I don''t really find the result all that appealing.  The lines created by the glint of light inthe eye are interesting.</td>', 'The execution is very nice here, but I don''t really find the result all that appealing.  The lines created by the glint of light inthe eye are interesting.', '2003-06-22 21:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(335127, 24775, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like this concept a lot... I wish you had paid more ttention to your background, however. It is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like this concept a lot... I wish you had paid more ttention to your background, however. It is a bit distracting.', '2003-06-22 22:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335128, 25199, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting.</td>', 'Excellent lighting.', '2003-06-22 22:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(335129, 25163, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that your title fits... you don''t really look angry to me in this portrait.</td>', 'I''m not sure that your title fits... you don''t really look angry to me in this portrait.', '2003-06-22 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(335137, 24714, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great portrait... my only nit here (which you have probably heard before) is that the t-shirt under the sweatshirt is a bit distracting. Otherwise, it''s a great shot.</td>', 'Great portrait... my only nit here (which you have probably heard before) is that the t-shirt under the sweatshirt is a bit distracting. Otherwise, it''s a great shot.', '2003-06-22 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(335165, 25113, 1570, '<td valign="top">but you should! those pictures you are holding up, they look pretty good to me! 8.</td>', 'but you should! those pictures you are holding up, they look pretty good to me! 8.', '2003-06-23 00:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(335168, 25237, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is very powerful, i love it... 10.</td>', 'this is very powerful, i love it... 10.', '2003-06-23 00:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(335171, 25164, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is absolutely stunning, 10!</td>', 'this is absolutely stunning, 10!', '2003-06-23 00:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(335192, 25236, 4380, '<td valign="top">simply perfect...10</td>', 'simply perfect...10', '2003-06-23 01:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(335198, 25179, 4380, '<td valign="top">nice work kiddo! you''ve got my 10! congrats...how i wish you''ll  get the ribbon...<br/>goodluck...</td>', 'nice work kiddo! you''ve got my 10! congrats...how i wish you''ll  get the ribbon...goodluck...', '2003-06-23 01:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(335201, 24764, 4380, '<td valign="top">everything is great, except the glare in your glasses...good shot.</td>', 'everything is great, except the glare in your glasses...good shot.', '2003-06-23 01:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(335204, 25202, 4380, '<td valign="top">yup, im goin to kiss you...yeah, express yourself...good idea.</td>', 'yup, im goin to kiss you...yeah, express yourself...good idea.', '2003-06-23 01:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(335238, 25095, 1686, '<td valign="top">Most creative idea that I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'Most creative idea that I''ve seen so far.', '2003-06-23 02:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335240, 24885, 9115, '<td valign="top">It''s trying to be different, but I really don''t like the contrast on this photo.</td>', 'It''s trying to be different, but I really don''t like the contrast on this photo.', '2003-06-23 02:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335241, 24964, 9115, '<td valign="top">This would have been better with more depth of field - it''s not in focus round the eyes.</td>', 'This would have been better with more depth of field - it''s not in focus round the eyes.', '2003-06-23 02:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(335242, 25162, 9115, '<td valign="top">Very good!  This really captures the essence of a serious Swede.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-26 17:13:47.</i></td>', 'Very good!  This really captures the essence of a serious Swede.', '2003-06-23 02:10:08.000000', '2003-06-26 18:13:47.000000', 1),
(335245, 25304, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice composition. the white string is a little distracting though. :o)<br/> <br/>&lt;edit&gt; i just realized the mirror is cracked. oops.</td>', 'nice composition. the white string is a little distracting though. :o) <edit> i just realized the mirror is cracked. oops.', '2003-06-23 02:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(335248, 25057, 6477, '<td valign="top">????</td>', '????', '2003-06-23 02:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(335249, 25107, 6565, '<td valign="top">The reds seem a bit strong in this photo -- maybe from low light?</td>', 'The reds seem a bit strong in this photo -- maybe from low light?', '2003-06-23 02:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335251, 25047, 6565, '<td valign="top">Sky''s a bit washed out, but I like the pose.</td>', 'Sky''s a bit washed out, but I like the pose.', '2003-06-23 02:23:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(335252, 25253, 6565, '<td valign="top">The light''s a bit bright, but it''s a very cute image!</td>', 'The light''s a bit bright, but it''s a very cute image!', '2003-06-23 02:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(335253, 24886, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like how the camera''s angle makes the viewer feel so insignificant next to such geek power.  Cute idea!</td>', 'I like how the camera''s angle makes the viewer feel so insignificant next to such geek power.  Cute idea!', '2003-06-23 02:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(335254, 25085, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very artsy-feeling, in a good way.  I like the tones in this image.</td>', 'Very artsy-feeling, in a good way.  I like the tones in this image.', '2003-06-23 02:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(335256, 25096, 6565, '<td valign="top">The wet-look hair makes this feel very Ophelia and haunting.  Was that what you were going for?  If so, it worked!</td>', 'The wet-look hair makes this feel very Ophelia and haunting.  Was that what you were going for?  If so, it worked!', '2003-06-23 02:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(335260, 24955, 6565, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it''s true, but it looks like you have on a tie and a baseball hat.  That incongruity is distracting me from the point of your image, which is otherwise very interesting!</td>', 'Not sure if it''s true, but it looks like you have on a tie and a baseball hat.  That incongruity is distracting me from the point of your image, which is otherwise very interesting!', '2003-06-23 02:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(335261, 25097, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great use of color -- the strong background doesn''t detract, which I''d have guessed it would.</td>', 'Great use of color -- the strong background doesn''t detract, which I''d have guessed it would.', '2003-06-23 02:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335263, 24894, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very creative and fun!  I like that the tones in the print are slightly different, to make it exact but also definitely not just a white frame.  Neat!</td>', 'Very creative and fun!  I like that the tones in the print are slightly different, to make it exact but also definitely not just a white frame.  Neat!', '2003-06-23 02:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335264, 24831, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love how the light creates such great contrast on your hair!  It''s a shame that that same range of tones is not as present on the "darker" side of your face.</td>', 'I love how the light creates such great contrast on your hair!  It''s a shame that that same range of tones is not as present on the "darker" side of your face.', '2003-06-23 02:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(335265, 25263, 6565, '<td valign="top">Looks like a candid snapshot -- an interesting choice for a self-portrait.</td>', 'Looks like a candid snapshot -- an interesting choice for a self-portrait.', '2003-06-23 02:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335267, 24676, 6565, '<td valign="top">Wow, there''s so much going on here I can''t get my bearings!  Really creative!</td>', 'Wow, there''s so much going on here I can''t get my bearings!  Really creative!', '2003-06-23 02:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(335268, 25125, 6477, '<td valign="top">I think you should center the eyes only if is the only thing you want to show... and maybe in B&amp;W or sepia tones works a little better, you should try it outside the challenge</td>', 'I think you should center the eyes only if is the only thing you want to show... and maybe in B&W or sepia tones works a little better, you should try it outside the challenge', '2003-06-23 02:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(335269, 25226, 6565, '<td valign="top">NIce pose and backdrop, would have liked a bit more background on the top edge.</td>', 'NIce pose and backdrop, would have liked a bit more background on the top edge.', '2003-06-23 02:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(335270, 25074, 6565, '<td valign="top">The left side has necessary information but doesn''t provide enough interest.  Might have liked to have seen this shot from inside those ropes, similar position.</td>', 'The left side has necessary information but doesn''t provide enough interest.  Might have liked to have seen this shot from inside those ropes, similar position.', '2003-06-23 02:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(335272, 25295, 6565, '<td valign="top">Looks blurry and a bit on the red side on my monitor.</td>', 'Looks blurry and a bit on the red side on my monitor.', '2003-06-23 02:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(335274, 25130, 6565, '<td valign="top">Cool how the light from the window is hitting you at an angle so it looks like it came from the computer!</td>', 'Cool how the light from the window is hitting you at an angle so it looks like it came from the computer!', '2003-06-23 02:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(335275, 25305, 4380, '<td valign="top">the cropping is great, the facial expression so nice. good composition and good choice of black and white...</td>', 'the cropping is great, the facial expression so nice. good composition and good choice of black and white...', '2003-06-23 02:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(335276, 25311, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, but I don''t know what it''s adding to the portrait.</td>', 'Interesting angle, but I don''t know what it''s adding to the portrait.', '2003-06-23 02:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(335277, 25235, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the shapes defined by your shoulders with this lighting technique.</td>', 'I like the shapes defined by your shoulders with this lighting technique.', '2003-06-23 02:35:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(335278, 25286, 6565, '<td valign="top">I don''t really "get it," though I do wonder how you got there before the auto-timer went off. :)</td>', 'I don''t really "get it," though I do wonder how you got there before the auto-timer went off. :)', '2003-06-23 02:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335279, 25216, 6565, '<td valign="top">Slightly blurry on my monitor, but the lighting is nice.</td>', 'Slightly blurry on my monitor, but the lighting is nice.', '2003-06-23 02:37:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(335280, 24613, 6565, '<td valign="top">The reflection in your glasses is distracting -- I think the light is a bit too bright.</td>', 'The reflection in your glasses is distracting -- I think the light is a bit too bright.', '2003-06-23 02:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(335282, 25199, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice expression and tonal range.</td>', 'Nice expression and tonal range.', '2003-06-23 02:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(335283, 24887, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the desaturation technique, but the blue in the curler on the left makes it not work here.  Cute concept. :)</td>', 'I like the desaturation technique, but the blue in the curler on the left makes it not work here.  Cute concept. :)', '2003-06-23 02:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(335284, 24838, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  I don''t know how you did it, but I just love the sharpness of the interior of the bulb and the dreamy quality of your face.  Like a crystal ball!</td>', 'This is awesome!  I don''t know how you did it, but I just love the sharpness of the interior of the bulb and the dreamy quality of your face.  Like a crystal ball!', '2003-06-23 02:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(335285, 25133, 6565, '<td valign="top">The stripes plus the pose against the wall suggest a sort of prison theme.  Does the title imply that the person you wait for has trapped you in some way?</td>', 'The stripes plus the pose against the wall suggest a sort of prison theme.  Does the title imply that the person you wait for has trapped you in some way?', '2003-06-23 02:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(335286, 25119, 6565, '<td valign="top">The dust is very distracting here!</td>', 'The dust is very distracting here!', '2003-06-23 02:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(335287, 25103, 6565, '<td valign="top">Cool scribble effect.  Lighting might be a bit too harsh.</td>', 'Cool scribble effect.  Lighting might be a bit too harsh.', '2003-06-23 02:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(335288, 25209, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great retro feel -- the border really adds to this image, because the dimensions make it feel like it''s straight out of the 50s!</td>', 'Great retro feel -- the border really adds to this image, because the dimensions make it feel like it''s straight out of the 50s!', '2003-06-23 02:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(335289, 25213, 6565, '<td valign="top">The resolution on this image is VERY low -- it''s making big pixel boxes on my screen.  Did you mean to do that?  If not, try to get as close to 150k as you can, that should help.</td>', 'The resolution on this image is VERY low -- it''s making big pixel boxes on my screen.  Did you mean to do that?  If not, try to get as close to 150k as you can, that should help.', '2003-06-23 02:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(335290, 25269, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice color and feel!  Would like to see the end of the fishing pole for a sense of completion, but I really like this!</td>', 'Nice color and feel!  Would like to see the end of the fishing pole for a sense of completion, but I really like this!', '2003-06-23 02:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(335291, 24889, 6565, '<td valign="top">Clever concept -- a bit too red throughout, probably because of low light.</td>', 'Clever concept -- a bit too red throughout, probably because of low light.', '2003-06-23 02:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(335294, 25129, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice self-referential idea, use of fringe over your face looks like hair and really adds to a sort of defiant, punk feel.</td>', 'Nice self-referential idea, use of fringe over your face looks like hair and really adds to a sort of defiant, punk feel.', '2003-06-23 02:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(335295, 25280, 6565, '<td valign="top">Something about the way this fades out gives it a really nice mood.</td>', 'Something about the way this fades out gives it a really nice mood.', '2003-06-23 02:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(335296, 25105, 6565, '<td valign="top">Love how the streak in your hair plus the blue eyes give us multiple focal points in this image!</td>', 'Love how the streak in your hair plus the blue eyes give us multiple focal points in this image!', '2003-06-23 02:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(335297, 24980, 6565, '<td valign="top">The light source is much too bright here, unfortunately!</td>', 'The light source is much too bright here, unfortunately!', '2003-06-23 02:47:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(335299, 24989, 6565, '<td valign="top">The shadow at the bottom is distracting, but the pose is very dynamic.</td>', 'The shadow at the bottom is distracting, but the pose is very dynamic.', '2003-06-23 02:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(335300, 25162, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like this!  Very sculptured-feeling.  Not sure what it is, maybe the sharpness of the image, but I like it a lot.</td>', 'I like this!  Very sculptured-feeling.  Not sure what it is, maybe the sharpness of the image, but I like it a lot.', '2003-06-23 02:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(335301, 24568, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like how the cigarette is the only thing in motion, creates a certain urgency to it, which matches the title well.  I also like the "tobacco" color choice. :)</td>', 'I like how the cigarette is the only thing in motion, creates a certain urgency to it, which matches the title well.  I also like the "tobacco" color choice. :)', '2003-06-23 02:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(335302, 25297, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is great!  The sharpness of the left face and the softness of the right are great counterpoints to each other.  Very ghostly and ominous.</td>', 'This is great!  The sharpness of the left face and the softness of the right are great counterpoints to each other.  Very ghostly and ominous.', '2003-06-23 02:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(335304, 25191, 8953, '<td valign="top">the lines take away from a great shot still 7</td>', 'the lines take away from a great shot still 7', '2003-06-23 02:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(335305, 25028, 6565, '<td valign="top">Really nice!  I like how your eyes are smiling in the non-reflection, and your face is smiling in the reflection.  One of the few self-portraits to really convey happiness.</td>', 'Really nice!  I like how your eyes are smiling in the non-reflection, and your face is smiling in the reflection.  One of the few self-portraits to really convey happiness.', '2003-06-23 02:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(335307, 24733, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting, with the gray shirt and black background, your face is unexpectedly NOT desaturated.  Adds real interest.</td>', 'Interesting, with the gray shirt and black background, your face is unexpectedly NOT desaturated.  Adds real interest.', '2003-06-23 02:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(335308, 25266, 6565, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but doesn''t hold my interest, perhaps because the lighting is not dramatic enough?  I''m not sure why.</td>', 'This is nice, but doesn''t hold my interest, perhaps because the lighting is not dramatic enough?  I''m not sure why.', '2003-06-23 02:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(335309, 24964, 6565, '<td valign="top">Cool halo effect.  The horizontal line above your ears and the black line on the left are very distracting, but I like the concept.</td>', 'Cool halo effect.  The horizontal line above your ears and the black line on the left are very distracting, but I like the concept.', '2003-06-23 02:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(335310, 25082, 6565, '<td valign="top">Comes across more as fear than sadness.  I like the blue tones.</td>', 'Comes across more as fear than sadness.  I like the blue tones.', '2003-06-23 02:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(335311, 25092, 6565, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract, cool eye on the left</td>', 'Interesting abstract, cool eye on the left', '2003-06-23 02:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(335313, 25211, 6565, '<td valign="top">I swear I commented on this already, but maybe I missed it.  The line in the upper left (a doorway?) is distracting, and I don''t really care for the pose, but I like the lighting overall.</td>', 'I swear I commented on this already, but maybe I missed it.  The line in the upper left (a doorway?) is distracting, and I don''t really care for the pose, but I like the lighting overall.', '2003-06-23 02:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(335321, 25236, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the starkness of this!  It bears a slight resemblance to something I was going to attempt but ran out of time.  You did a much better inerpretation than I would have. :)</td>', 'I love the starkness of this!  It bears a slight resemblance to something I was going to attempt but ran out of time.  You did a much better inerpretation than I would have. :)', '2003-06-23 03:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(335324, 25046, 6565, '<td valign="top">I''m not entirely sure what''s a reflection and what''s not, but this doesn''t really work for me.  Not enough information, I guess?</td>', 'I''m not entirely sure what''s a reflection and what''s not, but this doesn''t really work for me.  Not enough information, I guess?', '2003-06-23 03:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(335325, 25108, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great expression, the wisp of hair works and adds visual interest.</td>', 'Great expression, the wisp of hair works and adds visual interest.', '2003-06-23 03:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(335326, 24589, 6565, '<td valign="top">The pose and sunglasses work with the title -- the string on the left and the background on the right are distracting, though.  I''d like to see this against a plain background.</td>', 'The pose and sunglasses work with the title -- the string on the left and the background on the right are distracting, though.  I''d like to see this against a plain background.', '2003-06-23 03:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(335328, 25305, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like the graininess of the exposure, and the cropping, especially on the bottom edge.</td>', 'I like the graininess of the exposure, and the cropping, especially on the bottom edge.', '2003-06-23 03:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(335329, 24714, 6565, '<td valign="top">The reflection on your forehead is distracting with this color choice, but I like the moodiness of the picture.</td>', 'The reflection on your forehead is distracting with this color choice, but I like the moodiness of the picture.', '2003-06-23 03:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(335330, 24820, 6565, '<td valign="top">Nice fadeout, went a bit too far with it in my opinion, though, because the right side of the image is a little TOO washed out.  Just by a little.</td>', 'Nice fadeout, went a bit too far with it in my opinion, though, because the right side of the image is a little TOO washed out.  Just by a little.', '2003-06-23 03:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(335331, 24569, 6565, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Really cool and seamless how all three faces sprout from the same neck.  Very dramatic!</td>', 'Whoa!  Really cool and seamless how all three faces sprout from the same neck.  Very dramatic!', '2003-06-23 03:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(335332, 24686, 6565, '<td valign="top">I love the formality of this profile.  Wouldn''t expect the dark background to work with dark hair, but it does.</td>', 'I love the formality of this profile.  Wouldn''t expect the dark background to work with dark hair, but it does.', '2003-06-23 03:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(335333, 25201, 6565, '<td valign="top">The white in your eyes really makes this photo work.  Interesting choice!</td>', 'The white in your eyes really makes this photo work.  Interesting choice!', '2003-06-23 03:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(335334, 25238, 6565, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, though I wish the camera didn''t block your face in this case.</td>', 'Neat concept, though I wish the camera didn''t block your face in this case.', '2003-06-23 03:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(335335, 25020, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great pose!</td>', 'Great pose!', '2003-06-23 03:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(335337, 24837, 6565, '<td valign="top">The angle and framing make this photo interesting.  It looks like it''s mostly but not entirely desaturated.  Can''t tell if that''s my imagination, but it adds warmth.</td>', 'The angle and framing make this photo interesting.  It looks like it''s mostly but not entirely desaturated.  Can''t tell if that''s my imagination, but it adds warmth.', '2003-06-23 03:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(335338, 25191, 6565, '<td valign="top">There''s not enough light on your face, in my opinion, but I like the backdrop choice to contrast with your outline.</td>', 'There''s not enough light on your face, in my opinion, but I like the backdrop choice to contrast with your outline.', '2003-06-23 03:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(335339, 25164, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great dramatic makeup and pose!  Your hair is blurry, and I can''t tell if it''s from movement or what.  Would suggest not using such a glossy wall as a backdrop as well, since the light reflected off of it and is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Great dramatic makeup and pose!  Your hair is blurry, and I can''t tell if it''s from movement or what.  Would suggest not using such a glossy wall as a backdrop as well, since the light reflected off of it and is a bit distracting.', '2003-06-23 03:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(335340, 25275, 6565, '<td valign="top">Great colors and setting!  This has such warmth to it!</td>', 'Great colors and setting!  This has such warmth to it!', '2003-06-23 03:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(335341, 24972, 6565, '<td valign="top">Definitely says something about you, if the viewer knows what you have in your hand.  If not, it might look accidental or be confusing.</td>', 'Definitely says something about you, if the viewer knows what you have in your hand.  If not, it might look accidental or be confusing.', '2003-06-23 03:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
