(335631, 24716, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the eerie and haunting effect you got with the bottom lighting and the tones it rendered.  The use of negative space is very effective and the composition is really good with the three different poses and looks you''ve taken.  The lone track light in the foreground also adds alot to the image. Well done...one of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'I like the eerie and haunting effect you got with the bottom lighting and the tones it rendered.  The use of negative space is very effective and the composition is really good with the three different poses and looks you''ve taken.  The lone track light in the foreground also adds alot to the image. Well done...one of my favorites for this challenge.', '2003-06-23 12:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
