(336057, 24906, 2567, '<td valign="top">Good dof.  Wonderful colors and focus.</td>', 'Good dof.  Wonderful colors and focus.', '2003-06-24 02:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(336059, 25162, 2567, '<td valign="top">This is very effective.  Good focus and I like the angle.</td>', 'This is very effective.  Good focus and I like the angle.', '2003-06-24 02:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(336063, 24838, 8580, '<td valign="top">This is easily the most interesting photo in the challenge. Looking forward to find out how it was done....great job</td>', 'This is easily the most interesting photo in the challenge. Looking forward to find out how it was done....great job', '2003-06-24 02:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(336065, 25178, 2567, '<td valign="top">I feel there is just too many things in this shot for it to be effective.</td>', 'I feel there is just too many things in this shot for it to be effective.', '2003-06-24 02:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(336070, 24847, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Sharp focus and looks great in black and white</td>', 'Nicely done.  Sharp focus and looks great in black and white', '2003-06-24 03:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(336071, 25136, 2567, '<td valign="top">I think the background takes priority over the portrait in this shot</td>', 'I think the background takes priority over the portrait in this shot', '2003-06-24 03:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(336072, 24583, 2567, '<td valign="top">I wish the focus had been sharper</td>', 'I wish the focus had been sharper', '2003-06-24 03:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(336079, 25104, 6172, '<td valign="top">Looks like you''re taking it hard....  (much too hard for someone who is still so pretty, or, at least, could be).  So, I don''t like the title, but I like the photo.  Good background, and seems like the b&amp;w works good, it makes the photo.</td>', 'Looks like you''re taking it hard....  (much too hard for someone who is still so pretty, or, at least, could be).  So, I don''t like the title, but I like the photo.  Good background, and seems like the b&w works good, it makes the photo.', '2003-06-24 03:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(336081, 24767, 9419, '<td valign="top">Light and tonal design set this image apart.  The self-portrait aspect make it magical.</td>', 'Light and tonal design set this image apart.  The self-portrait aspect make it magical.', '2003-06-24 03:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(336082, 25179, 6172, '<td valign="top">Of course, I''d like to see how you took this photo.  I''ll take your word that you did.  Pretty good shot.  The blur of the arm seems a little distracting, but on the other hand, it adds some "action" factor to the shot.</td>', 'Of course, I''d like to see how you took this photo.  I''ll take your word that you did.  Pretty good shot.  The blur of the arm seems a little distracting, but on the other hand, it adds some "action" factor to the shot.', '2003-06-24 03:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(336084, 24886, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good angle, it goes with the title.</td>', 'Good angle, it goes with the title.', '2003-06-24 03:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(336085, 25037, 9419, '<td valign="top">Self-portraits are difficult to compose.  Tension of image angle and attempted modisty encourage the viewer to look closer.</td>', 'Self-portraits are difficult to compose.  Tension of image angle and attempted modisty encourage the viewer to look closer.', '2003-06-24 03:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(336086, 24964, 6172, '<td valign="top">Like an angel!  Only there seems to be a wire running out of your head.</td>', 'Like an angel!  Only there seems to be a wire running out of your head.', '2003-06-24 03:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(336088, 25057, 9581, '<td valign="top">Awesome outlook! Great Idea!</td>', 'Awesome outlook! Great Idea!', '2003-06-24 03:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(336090, 24709, 6172, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool, this is one of my favorites of the guys ( us guys don''t seem to be doing as well as the girls at this self portrait project).  Excellent lighting and I like the somewhat soft focus.</td>', 'Pretty cool, this is one of my favorites of the guys ( us guys don''t seem to be doing as well as the girls at this self portrait project).  Excellent lighting and I like the somewhat soft focus.', '2003-06-24 03:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(336092, 24889, 9419, '<td valign="top">Humorous title adds dimension to this image.  Was it shot using a mirror?</td>', 'Humorous title adds dimension to this image.  Was it shot using a mirror?', '2003-06-24 03:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(336095, 25093, 9419, '<td valign="top">For some the mention of telepathic is drama enough.  This self-portrait intensified it with lighting.</td>', 'For some the mention of telepathic is drama enough.  This self-portrait intensified it with lighting.', '2003-06-24 03:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(336097, 25238, 9419, '<td valign="top">Composition elevates this image</td>', 'Composition elevates this image', '2003-06-24 03:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(336102, 25235, 9419, '<td valign="top">Hiding in front of the lens</td>', 'Hiding in front of the lens', '2003-06-24 03:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(336103, 25272, 9419, '<td valign="top">Framed ... Now the interest is heightening</td>', 'Framed ... Now the interest is heightening', '2003-06-24 03:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(336104, 25101, 9419, '<td valign="top">Self-portrait, second hand or ...</td>', 'Self-portrait, second hand or ...', '2003-06-24 03:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(336105, 25263, 9419, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t you rather have a Blanton''s?</td>', 'Wouldn''t you rather have a Blanton''s?', '2003-06-24 03:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(336106, 25056, 9419, '<td valign="top">Compostion enhances the hidden amimal sense.</td>', 'Compostion enhances the hidden amimal sense.', '2003-06-24 03:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(336107, 25226, 9419, '<td valign="top">This image entices the viewer to want more.</td>', 'This image entices the viewer to want more.', '2003-06-24 03:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(336108, 25050, 9419, '<td valign="top">This subject is faster than the eye.  Well done.</td>', 'This subject is faster than the eye.  Well done.', '2003-06-24 03:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(336109, 24683, 9419, '<td valign="top">I''ve  changed my mind.  Give me that.</td>', 'I''ve  changed my mind.  Give me that.', '2003-06-24 03:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(336111, 25212, 9419, '<td valign="top">Flat subject, high contrast scene</td>', 'Flat subject, high contrast scene', '2003-06-24 04:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(336112, 25218, 9419, '<td valign="top">Available light cast on an available subject</td>', 'Available light cast on an available subject', '2003-06-24 04:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(336113, 24887, 9419, '<td valign="top">Blue eyes on a high-key image.  There are many misteries here, Why did she let anyone photograph her wearing tubes?  Is she really nude?''<br/>There is power in those eyes.</td>', 'Blue eyes on a high-key image.  There are many misteries here, Why did she let anyone photograph her wearing tubes?  Is she really nude?''There is power in those eyes.', '2003-06-24 04:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(336115, 24593, 9419, '<td valign="top">Red earth, green sky.  Geat color conrtrast.</td>', 'Red earth, green sky.  Geat color conrtrast.', '2003-06-24 04:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(336124, 24593, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very unique portrait and one I like very much. I love the way you seperate the two different colors and your use of negative space.  The colors are super and the overall effect is very effective. Great job!</td>', 'Very unique portrait and one I like very much. I love the way you seperate the two different colors and your use of negative space.  The colors are super and the overall effect is very effective. Great job!', '2003-06-24 04:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(336128, 25084, 5822, '<td valign="top">More than anything, I like the grainy, gritty feel to this photo because I think it balances well with the high key tone of the image and the color of your eyes.   Together they provide clues for the viewer to see more deeply and completely to your essence. Correct me if I''m wrong but from your gaze and expression I believe I see a gentle, peaceful and sensitive soul who is upbeat and uplifting.  Very well done.</td>', 'More than anything, I like the grainy, gritty feel to this photo because I think it balances well with the high key tone of the image and the color of your eyes.   Together they provide clues for the viewer to see more deeply and completely to your essence. Correct me if I''m wrong but from your gaze and expression I believe I see a gentle, peaceful and sensitive soul who is upbeat and uplifting.  Very well done.', '2003-06-24 05:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(336132, 25234, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great concept for a portrait !  It''s certainly a different angle and one that I like very much. The background equally contributes, along with this viewpoint, and your appearance to the impression I get of you as being unique, intelligent, artistic, creative, a man with vision, connected with nature, wild and a very "colorful" person, indeed. Exposure and focus are very sharp. Contrast is excellent and really helps to make you stand out. Colors are rich and vibrant. Outstanding work!</td>', 'Great concept for a portrait !  It''s certainly a different angle and one that I like very much. The background equally contributes, along with this viewpoint, and your appearance to the impression I get of you as being unique, intelligent, artistic, creative, a man with vision, connected with nature, wild and a very "colorful" person, indeed. Exposure and focus are very sharp. Contrast is excellent and really helps to make you stand out. Colors are rich and vibrant. Outstanding work!', '2003-06-24 05:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(336134, 25199, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very well done...I absolutely love the use of negative space here. An engaging and intriquing portrait.</td>', 'Very well done...I absolutely love the use of negative space here. An engaging and intriquing portrait.', '2003-06-24 05:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(336138, 25043, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very expressive... Very artistic... Wonderful job :)</td>', 'Very expressive... Very artistic... Wonderful job :)', '2003-06-24 05:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(336139, 25129, 2337, '<td valign="top">If you were going for the hair in front of your face to give the impression of prison bars, it worked wonderfully... If you weren''t going for that, then I have an over active imagination :)  Great shot</td>', 'If you were going for the hair in front of your face to give the impression of prison bars, it worked wonderfully... If you weren''t going for that, then I have an over active imagination :)  Great shot', '2003-06-24 05:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(336140, 24818, 2337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect... I hope you''ll write up how you achieved it!</td>', 'Very interesting effect... I hope you''ll write up how you achieved it!', '2003-06-24 05:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(336141, 25084, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great use of selective desaturation!  Well done</td>', 'Great use of selective desaturation!  Well done', '2003-06-24 05:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(336142, 24885, 2337, '<td valign="top">Great concept!!!  My one nitpick is the burn out was a little overdone for my taste.  Too much detail lost.  Still a wonderful shot...</td>', 'Great concept!!!  My one nitpick is the burn out was a little overdone for my taste.  Too much detail lost.  Still a wonderful shot...', '2003-06-24 05:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(336143, 24709, 2337, '<td valign="top">Nice effect!  Hope you included the f-stop and shutter info... I''ll be interested to see them when the challenge is over.</td>', 'Nice effect!  Hope you included the f-stop and shutter info... I''ll be interested to see them when the challenge is over.', '2003-06-24 05:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(336144, 25185, 2337, '<td valign="top">You''re the one on the right, right?  Kidding :)<br/> <br/>Nice concept... I think it would have benefitted from a less busy background... Maybe a shallower dof?</td>', 'You''re the one on the right, right?  Kidding :) Nice concept... I think it would have benefitted from a less busy background... Maybe a shallower dof?', '2003-06-24 05:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
