(336841, 24676, 2983, '<td valign="top">Nice idea here.  You should''ve worn a different color shirt, something vibrant to really break up the subtle tones in the room.</td>', 'Nice idea here.  You should''ve worn a different color shirt, something vibrant to really break up the subtle tones in the room.', '2003-06-25 00:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
