(336844, 24723, 4380, '<td valign="top">everything is perfect, the sharpness is great..and the expression is awesome. this is a winning shot!  A PERFECT 10...GREAT.</td>', 'everything is perfect, the sharpness is great..and the expression is awesome. this is a winning shot!  A PERFECT 10...GREAT.', '2003-06-25 00:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(336845, 24684, 2983, '<td valign="top">I like the color vs. black and white, it is balanced well.  Only problem here is your color self could be brighter, and not have the double reflection.  Looks like you used a reflection off glass, so that might be unavoidable.</td>', 'I like the color vs. black and white, it is balanced well.  Only problem here is your color self could be brighter, and not have the double reflection.  Looks like you used a reflection off glass, so that might be unavoidable.', '2003-06-25 00:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(336846, 25269, 7706, '<td valign="top">looks a little over saturated, but I will give you a 9, because I still really like this shot</td>', 'looks a little over saturated, but I will give you a 9, because I still really like this shot', '2003-06-25 00:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(336848, 25216, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful black and white.  I like how the ''white'' is just the little twinkle in your eye.  I like the lighting very much and think that the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  There is a small object in the background near your shoulder that could be a little distracting, but nothing serious.  Nice to meet you.</td>', 'Beautiful black and white.  I like how the ''white'' is just the little twinkle in your eye.  I like the lighting very much and think that the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  There is a small object in the background near your shoulder that could be a little distracting, but nothing serious.  Nice to meet you.', '2003-06-25 00:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(336850, 24676, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is utterly confusing, but if I looked at it long enough, i...well who am I kidding I''d never figure it out. lol    I do think it''s really cool, but find the blurry hands a bit distracting from you.  Overall nice concept though. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'This is utterly confusing, but if I looked at it long enough, i...well who am I kidding I''d never figure it out. lol    I do think it''s really cool, but find the blurry hands a bit distracting from you.  Overall nice concept though. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(336851, 24843, 2221, '<td valign="top">Wow! This photo transports emotion. I like the lighting and the composition. A very creative self-portrait. 9</td>', 'Wow! This photo transports emotion. I like the lighting and the composition. A very creative self-portrait. 9', '2003-06-25 00:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(336853, 25215, 2221, '<td valign="top">Great lighting. I like the use of negative space here. I don''t see anything wrong here.</td>', 'Great lighting. I like the use of negative space here. I don''t see anything wrong here.', '2003-06-25 00:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(336855, 24922, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice clean shot.  Focus and clarity are really good, and the background is great.  Only complaint is that the sky is just a slight bit too bright, but the lighting on the rest of the shot is perfect.  good angle and cropping.  I like this a lot. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice clean shot.  Focus and clarity are really good, and the background is great.  Only complaint is that the sky is just a slight bit too bright, but the lighting on the rest of the shot is perfect.  good angle and cropping.  I like this a lot. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(336857, 25291, 3080, '<td valign="top">light on  your face and shirt is almost a little bright.  Can''t say this is the most appealing shot in the bunch, but it does show a lot of personality, and that''s important.  I don''t like your lenolium though.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'light on  your face and shirt is almost a little bright.  Can''t say this is the most appealing shot in the bunch, but it does show a lot of personality, and that''s important.  I don''t like your lenolium though.  Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(336858, 25257, 2221, '<td valign="top">Good idea. This photo has potential. The composition is good (off-centered) and it was a deliberate colour choice of your dress. The green vs. pink works good. Only thing I don''t like here is the lighting. It''s a bit flat and bland. Maybe a shot at a different time, like during sunset, could have helped. Still an 8.</td>', 'Good idea. This photo has potential. The composition is good (off-centered) and it was a deliberate colour choice of your dress. The green vs. pink works good. Only thing I don''t like here is the lighting. It''s a bit flat and bland. Maybe a shot at a different time, like during sunset, could have helped. Still an 8.', '2003-06-25 00:50:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(336860, 24569, 3080, '<td valign="top">JEB did a shot similar to this for the illusions challenge, I think it was.  I saw it on photo know how on photosig.  I''m totally sure that''s not the first place it ever showed up, but I still think it''s an interesting effect.  I think you did an excellent job getting the center face centered and clear.  And also getting the side faces symetrical.  I like it.  Good lighting as well. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'JEB did a shot similar to this for the illusions challenge, I think it was.  I saw it on photo know how on photosig.  I''m totally sure that''s not the first place it ever showed up, but I still think it''s an interesting effect.  I think you did an excellent job getting the center face centered and clear.  And also getting the side faces symetrical.  I like it.  Good lighting as well. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(336862, 25270, 4007, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  The framing works well.  The shallow depth of field draws the viewers attention effectively.  Your eyes and hair both stand out wonderfully and provide interesting colors.  And of course this shot has a strong sense of intimacy as well.. but I''m not sure what to say about that. = ) <br/>Great work.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  The framing works well.  The shallow depth of field draws the viewers attention effectively.  Your eyes and hair both stand out wonderfully and provide interesting colors.  And of course this shot has a strong sense of intimacy as well.. but I''m not sure what to say about that. = ) Great work.', '2003-06-25 00:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(336864, 24843, 4007, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I could go on about all the things I like about this, but I''ll just throw out a few.. I like the symetry, and I like that it''s not perfect symetry, and that the whole thing is off center, and the pose, and the lighting, and the black and white, and the concept, and the texture of the wall you used, and the angle of the shot.  I have a feeling this won''t score as high as it should, but I know I''ll add it to my favorites after the challenge ends. 10.  Great work.<br/>(I just thought I''d add that I voted on almost every entry in this challenge, and this was my only 10 I gave.)</td>', 'Beautiful.  I could go on about all the things I like about this, but I''ll just throw out a few.. I like the symetry, and I like that it''s not perfect symetry, and that the whole thing is off center, and the pose, and the lighting, and the black and white, and the concept, and the texture of the wall you used, and the angle of the shot.  I have a feeling this won''t score as high as it should, but I know I''ll add it to my favorites after the challenge ends. 10.  Great work.(I just thought I''d add that I voted on almost every entry in this challenge, and this was my only 10 I gave.)', '2003-06-25 00:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(336865, 24831, 3080, '<td valign="top">Every time I go to comment on this, I get distracted and end up not doing it.  It''s popped up like 5 times now, so I HAVE to get this in. lol  The only thing that I notice is that the focus on your eyes looks a bit soft, where the left of the photo (your right) seems to be the crispest.  Probably lighting?  Overall though, I think it''s an excellent self portrait and shows personality as well as detail. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Every time I go to comment on this, I get distracted and end up not doing it.  It''s popped up like 5 times now, so I HAVE to get this in. lol  The only thing that I notice is that the focus on your eyes looks a bit soft, where the left of the photo (your right) seems to be the crispest.  Probably lighting?  Overall though, I think it''s an excellent self portrait and shows personality as well as detail. Nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(336866, 24589, 7706, '<td valign="top">I like the way you framed yourself in. The colors look good witht his shot too.</td>', 'I like the way you framed yourself in. The colors look good witht his shot too.', '2003-06-25 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(336867, 25122, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think though that the lighting above your head is a distraction and a bit too bright.  Overall though, I like the foggyness and the orange cast over the photo.  Original and definately shows you.  I like your shower curtain too, adds a nice bit of color to the shot.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think though that the lighting above your head is a distraction and a bit too bright.  Overall though, I like the foggyness and the orange cast over the photo.  Original and definately shows you.  I like your shower curtain too, adds a nice bit of color to the shot.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(336868, 25295, 3080, '<td valign="top">Dizzy because of the soft focus?  I think it''s a nice portrait, however I do wish that the focus were crisp.  I like detail, and I think it''s hindered here due to my eyes trying to focus on this shot.  Good color and lighting.  I like the closeness.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~</td>', 'Dizzy because of the soft focus?  I think it''s a nice portrait, however I do wish that the focus were crisp.  I like detail, and I think it''s hindered here due to my eyes trying to focus on this shot.  Good color and lighting.  I like the closeness.  nice to meet you. ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(336869, 25247, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a pic - I wanted to get everyone at NYC GTG together for a group shot with EACH of our cams on timers to submit for SP, but I just didn''t get it done - this is a similar idea and I love both shots.  Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Great idea for a pic - I wanted to get everyone at NYC GTG together for a group shot with EACH of our cams on timers to submit for SP, but I just didn''t get it done - this is a similar idea and I love both shots.  Excellent stuff.', '2003-06-25 00:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(336870, 24650, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great idea for a pic - I wanted to get everyone at NYC GTG together for a group shot with EACH of our cams on timers to submit for SP, but I just didn''t get it done - this is a similar idea and I love both shots.  Excellent stuff.</td>', 'Great idea for a pic - I wanted to get everyone at NYC GTG together for a group shot with EACH of our cams on timers to submit for SP, but I just didn''t get it done - this is a similar idea and I love both shots.  Excellent stuff.', '2003-06-25 00:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(336871, 24818, 3080, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting on this.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Really adds some personality.  focus on your eye is great, and detail is wonderful.  definately unique.  Great shot! ~Heather~</td>', 'I really like the lighting on this.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are good as well.  Really adds some personality.  focus on your eye is great, and detail is wonderful.  definately unique.  Great shot! ~Heather~', '2003-06-25 00:57:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(336873, 25101, 6900, '<td valign="top">Scab?  :)  The best of a good group of pictures.  I love the concept and how you got this into the pic without being IN the shot...first person anyways.  10</td>', 'Scab?  :)  The best of a good group of pictures.  I love the concept and how you got this into the pic without being IN the shot...first person anyways.  10', '2003-06-25 00:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(336877, 24633, 4224, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments.  I am really surprised that 1. so many people gave it below a three, and that 2. so many people gave it a nine or ten.<br/> <br/>For me personally, this is one of my favorite pictures that I''ve ever taken.  Maybe it could''ve used a little less green, but I''ve played with it a lot and been very happy with it in many incarnations.  And I had to pick one :)  I definitely felt it was better with a little color as opposed to black and white, but also that full color detracted from the shot.<br/> <br/>Anyway, thanks.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-25 10:06:00.</i></td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments.  I am really surprised that 1. so many people gave it below a three, and that 2. so many people gave it a nine or ten. For me personally, this is one of my favorite pictures that I''ve ever taken.  Maybe it could''ve used a little less green, but I''ve played with it a lot and been very happy with it in many incarnations.  And I had to pick one :)  I definitely felt it was better with a little color as opposed to black and white, but also that full color detracted from the shot. Anyway, thanks.', '2003-06-25 01:07:05.000000', '2003-06-25 11:06:00.000000', 0),
(336878, 25296, 255, '<td valign="top">this is way cool. great angle, toning and lighting.</td>', 'this is way cool. great angle, toning and lighting.', '2003-06-25 01:08:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(336879, 25307, 7706, '<td valign="top">I thought this was you. I have not seen enough photos to have been sure, but I knew it. Good job anyway</td>', 'I thought this was you. I have not seen enough photos to have been sure, but I knew it. Good job anyway', '2003-06-25 01:09:41.000000', NULL, 0),
