(336883, 24661, 2217, '<td valign="top">I think you have a fine sense of humour!   Congratulations on your POTD on DPContest.  Looking forward to seeing your work on other sites.  Goodluck.</td>', 'I think you have a fine sense of humour!   Congratulations on your POTD on DPContest.  Looking forward to seeing your work on other sites.  Goodluck.', '2003-06-25 01:12:53.000000', NULL, 0),
