(337124, 25304, 8865, '<td valign="top">Wow. Thanks all so much for the comments &amp; votes. I really appreciate it :) I can''t believe I got a ribbon for only my 2nd submission. <br/> <br/>I didn''t think I would crack the top 10 with all these wonderful pictures that were submitted. <br/> <br/>I wasn''t sure if I was going to submit this photo or another one. I''m glad I used this one.<br/> <br/>I accidently broke the mirror a couple weeks ago, and was just playing around taking pictures with it, because I gave up hope of all the other portraits I tried. lol. I haven''t had any bad luck, yet. *knock on wood* hehe... ;)<br/> <br/>So Thank you all once again. Now I''m off to see all the other portraits and match your names with a face :)<br/></td>', 'Wow. Thanks all so much for the comments & votes. I really appreciate it :) I can''t believe I got a ribbon for only my 2nd submission.  I didn''t think I would crack the top 10 with all these wonderful pictures that were submitted.  I wasn''t sure if I was going to submit this photo or another one. I''m glad I used this one. I accidently broke the mirror a couple weeks ago, and was just playing around taking pictures with it, because I gave up hope of all the other portraits I tried. lol. I haven''t had any bad luck, yet. *knock on wood* hehe... ;) So Thank you all once again. Now I''m off to see all the other portraits and match your names with a face :)', '2003-06-25 02:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(337130, 24800, 8865, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a really great photo, and thought that it would atleast place in the top 5. I would have liked to see the eyes more seductive looking... ;) I gave you a 9 though.</td>', 'I thought this was a really great photo, and thought that it would atleast place in the top 5. I would have liked to see the eyes more seductive looking... ;) I gave you a 9 though.', '2003-06-25 02:59:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(337149, 24658, 8987, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments!<br/> <br/>In retrospect, I should perhaps have called it "Electronic saint" which would have made my intention more clear. Of course the whole saint theme was meant ironically ;)<br/> <br/>Annida: thanks for your comment. But the light behind my head should have symbolized the halo! :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-25 02:25:13.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments! In retrospect, I should perhaps have called it "Electronic saint" which would have made my intention more clear. Of course the whole saint theme was meant ironically ;) Annida: thanks for your comment. But the light behind my head should have symbolized the halo! :)', '2003-06-25 03:07:04.000000', '2003-06-25 03:25:13.000000', 0),
(337174, 25262, 714, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite shot.  I love it.  You must be a good father.  And they are hard to find.</td>', 'This is my favorite shot.  I love it.  You must be a good father.  And they are hard to find.', '2003-06-25 03:16:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(337177, 25261, 1054, '<td valign="top">Hi Jennifer, great shot.  I was one of the 4 people to give this a 10, and frankly, I am shocked and disappointed that it did not do better. Like others, I was not quite sure what to make of your facial experession... but the positive side of that is that it caused me to stop and pay attention, and think for a bit... but what I got out of it was someone who is balancing a career and a child... which after reading your profile turns out to be correct! Now, that can be stressful of course, and I think your expression reflects that. I like the toning of this shot, it''s warm and fitting to the mood of the shot as a whole. The lightinw works for me, and though it wasn''t a factor in my scoring, you make an attractive model as well.<br/> <br/>In all I think this deserved much better than the 5.7  you finished with. Thanks for sharing, and good luck in future challenges!</td>', 'Hi Jennifer, great shot.  I was one of the 4 people to give this a 10, and frankly, I am shocked and disappointed that it did not do better. Like others, I was not quite sure what to make of your facial experession... but the positive side of that is that it caused me to stop and pay attention, and think for a bit... but what I got out of it was someone who is balancing a career and a child... which after reading your profile turns out to be correct! Now, that can be stressful of course, and I think your expression reflects that. I like the toning of this shot, it''s warm and fitting to the mood of the shot as a whole. The lightinw works for me, and though it wasn''t a factor in my scoring, you make an attractive model as well. In all I think this deserved much better than the 5.7  you finished with. Thanks for sharing, and good luck in future challenges!', '2003-06-25 03:17:51.000000', NULL, 0),
