(337256, 24767, 9363, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments! I can''t believe I basically have as many one''s as I do ten''s!  That is so weird how people react so differently to a photo.  I know some had an issue with my face not showing.  I wasn''t going for that.  I didn''t want to take a portrait to show you what I look like.  I wanted to take a photograph to show who I am.  (Not an ass) haha.  But that I''m a soft person(the blurriness), that is sensual, tranquil, relaxed, confident, and with an edge(the graininess).<br/>For those who got it, high five.<br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments! I can''t believe I basically have as many one''s as I do ten''s!  That is so weird how people react so differently to a photo.  I know some had an issue with my face not showing.  I wasn''t going for that.  I didn''t want to take a portrait to show you what I look like.  I wanted to take a photograph to show who I am.  (Not an ass) haha.  But that I''m a soft person(the blurriness), that is sensual, tranquil, relaxed, confident, and with an edge(the graininess).For those who got it, high five.', '2003-06-25 04:01:17.000000', NULL, 0),
