(337353, 25297, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey.  This was an awesome effect.  I''d love to know how you managed to capture this with our camera.  please pm me with precise details if your willing.  I thought this was going to do much better.  It definetely deserved to do better than mine, which was blurry and gross.  I love the concept of the duality of self.  Hows yer country farin''?</td>', 'Hey.  This was an awesome effect.  I''d love to know how you managed to capture this with our camera.  please pm me with precise details if your willing.  I thought this was going to do much better.  It definetely deserved to do better than mine, which was blurry and gross.  I love the concept of the duality of self.  Hows yer country farin''?', '2003-06-25 05:30:35.000000', NULL, 0),
