(337450, 24661, 1829, '<td valign="top">SETZ, SSSSSTTTTTAAAAAYYYYY.  I love your work mate.  But whatever you decide to do, I know you will do it well.  Pop in and say ''hi'' from time to time ok.  PROMISE...<br/>By the way, love the legs and that bald head!!</td>', 'SETZ, SSSSSTTTTTAAAAAYYYYY.  I love your work mate.  But whatever you decide to do, I know you will do it well.  Pop in and say ''hi'' from time to time ok.  PROMISE...By the way, love the legs and that bald head!!', '2003-06-25 09:15:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(337465, 25108, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Corner*<br/> <br/>Guess who got yours.  What do I say about yours?  The focus is good the lighting works well for this, leaving mild shadows where needed.  That one strand of hair adds such a statement to the photo, but at the same time that is where your problem is.  As I sit here I notice it looks slightly soft at the end and I can decide if it is fanning out slightly of if the focus is off on it.  Whichever it is it does pull the eye to it.<br/> <br/>Over all I thing this is a very beautiful self portrait and well done.<br/> <br/>Anna<br/>Overall</td>', '*Critique Corner* Guess who got yours.  What do I say about yours?  The focus is good the lighting works well for this, leaving mild shadows where needed.  That one strand of hair adds such a statement to the photo, but at the same time that is where your problem is.  As I sit here I notice it looks slightly soft at the end and I can decide if it is fanning out slightly of if the focus is off on it.  Whichever it is it does pull the eye to it. Over all I thing this is a very beautiful self portrait and well done. AnnaOverall', '2003-06-25 09:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
