(337885, 25261, 8713, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the helpful comments. Special thanks to ClubJuggle for the in-depth critique. <br/> <br/>I can''t explain the reason for my facial expression, except to say that obviously I don''t know how to model. ;-)<br/> <br/>Thanks again, everyone!</td>', 'Thank you all for the helpful comments. Special thanks to ClubJuggle for the in-depth critique.  I can''t explain the reason for my facial expression, except to say that obviously I don''t know how to model. ;-) Thanks again, everyone!', '2003-06-25 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 0),
