(338143, 25234, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man JJ, now I see what you really look like! Cool pic, luv your glasses.</td>', 'Man JJ, now I see what you really look like! Cool pic, luv your glasses.', '2003-06-25 18:02:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(338223, 24838, 6696, '<td valign="top">All,<br/>Thanks for all the constructive and supporting comments.  With this being my first ribbon, I was really jazzed when the scores started to pour in!  Let the addiction begin!  I wasn''t going to submit to this challenge given my low interest in self portraitures, but I thought of this at the last minute.  I purposefully introduced some blur and over saturation - if I had a better subject, I would do things a little differently.  To answer some questions, the bulb is resting directly on a computer display containing the portrait - pretty simple.  Thanks again,<br/>Jerry<br/></td>', 'All,Thanks for all the constructive and supporting comments.  With this being my first ribbon, I was really jazzed when the scores started to pour in!  Let the addiction begin!  I wasn''t going to submit to this challenge given my low interest in self portraitures, but I thought of this at the last minute.  I purposefully introduced some blur and over saturation - if I had a better subject, I would do things a little differently.  To answer some questions, the bulb is resting directly on a computer display containing the portrait - pretty simple.  Thanks again,Jerry', '2003-06-25 18:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(338289, 25307, 7711, '<td valign="top">aww..thanks. I wish the pose I liked better had been in focus. It was a disaster trying to reshoot it.</td>', 'aww..thanks. I wish the pose I liked better had been in focus. It was a disaster trying to reshoot it.', '2003-06-25 20:05:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(338311, 24633, 6504, '<td valign="top">You need to put some meat on them bones!</td>', 'You need to put some meat on them bones!', '2003-06-25 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(338359, 24894, 5340, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much to all of you for the votes and comments. I didn''t get to be among the 3 first ones, but I got very close. I received 50 very positive comments and I was very satisfied. The line between the non sense and ridiculous is very thin and it is very gratifying when we noticed that we got right in the point.<br/>Regards</td>', 'Thank you very much to all of you for the votes and comments. I didn''t get to be among the 3 first ones, but I got very close. I received 50 very positive comments and I was very satisfied. The line between the non sense and ridiculous is very thin and it is very gratifying when we noticed that we got right in the point.Regards', '2003-06-25 21:17:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(338467, 25192, 6870, '<td valign="top">Just super work! Congratulations on your first ribbon and your first entry! I like your profile photo, too.</td>', 'Just super work! Congratulations on your first ribbon and your first entry! I like your profile photo, too.', '2003-06-25 22:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(338469, 24838, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simply super work! I love the idea and the execution. Congratulations!</td>', 'Simply super work! I love the idea and the execution. Congratulations!', '2003-06-25 22:39:25.000000', NULL, 0);
