(340354, 25164, 2978, '<td valign="top">Thank you, folks for all your votes and comment. I didn''t expect to get this high, giving the fact that there are some flaws that you have pointed out. I have some shots with no motion blur on my hair and with different lighting. Obviously, I like this one I posed the most. And I couldn''t bother take more shots because the make up got into my eyes. In fact, the idea of scratchinc the make-up was an accident. I got very hungry and had dinner after I put the full make-up on. There you go!</td>', 'Thank you, folks for all your votes and comment. I didn''t expect to get this high, giving the fact that there are some flaws that you have pointed out. I have some shots with no motion blur on my hair and with different lighting. Obviously, I like this one I posed the most. And I couldn''t bother take more shots because the make up got into my eyes. In fact, the idea of scratchinc the make-up was an accident. I got very hungry and had dinner after I put the full make-up on. There you go!', '2003-06-27 11:35:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(340370, 24828, 9393, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the time spent on commenting on this image. It was shot on board a flight from Kunming to Beijing, China (Beijing was finally taken off the watchful list of WHO on 25 June). Yes, all air hostess were masked, but not all passengers wore them on this flight. (Most wore masks in April when the epidemic reached its height). This was a simple self-portrait shot, no prior arrangement or anything. Kind of lucky however that one of the air-hostess was working behind me then, and her appearance helped add some flavour to this otherwise a very bland image. But as one comment has it that this being " a story in one picture ", and for this point alone, I thought the picture did after all carry some value! :-)</td>', 'Thanks for all the time spent on commenting on this image. It was shot on board a flight from Kunming to Beijing, China (Beijing was finally taken off the watchful list of WHO on 25 June). Yes, all air hostess were masked, but not all passengers wore them on this flight. (Most wore masks in April when the epidemic reached its height). This was a simple self-portrait shot, no prior arrangement or anything. Kind of lucky however that one of the air-hostess was working behind me then, and her appearance helped add some flavour to this otherwise a very bland image. But as one comment has it that this being " a story in one picture ", and for this point alone, I thought the picture did after all carry some value! :-)', '2003-06-27 11:59:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(341201, 24883, 5834, '<td valign="top">Heh i never got so dispersed votes :) Maybe is my fault but i couldn''t stand still for 10 seconds. Anyway thx for critiq and votes to all.<br/></td>', 'Heh i never got so dispersed votes :) Maybe is my fault but i couldn''t stand still for 10 seconds. Anyway thx for critiq and votes to all.', '2003-06-28 04:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
