(806469, 25122, 19017, '<td valign="top">It looks like the only thing steamy in the room was the dump someone took while you were showering...what''s with the flared nostrils?? This photo needs everything from better focus, lighting, you name it. A little less nostril and a little more somebody else. <br/> <br/>ps: Do you people even LOOK at the pictures before you critique them?</td>', 'It looks like the only thing steamy in the room was the dump someone took while you were showering...what''s with the flared nostrils?? This photo needs everything from better focus, lighting, you name it. A little less nostril and a little more somebody else.  ps: Do you people even LOOK at the pictures before you critique them?', '2004-07-11 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(823657, 25266, 18665, '<td valign="top">Hey! Erin, out of 222 it came out 135....not very bad...as you were afraid of ;)<br/> <br/>From my part...I always thought for any portrait images...if you are not interested in showing full face.....at least show your mouth or nose or eyes....that''s how I love portriats :)<br/> <br/>Anyway...your skin texture is not that smooth over here.....but hands are alright...but it would be better if there was some long nails :D</td>', 'Hey! Erin, out of 222 it came out 135....not very bad...as you were afraid of ;) From my part...I always thought for any portrait images...if you are not interested in showing full face.....at least show your mouth or nose or eyes....that''s how I love portriats :) Anyway...your skin texture is not that smooth over here.....but hands are alright...but it would be better if there was some long nails :D', '2004-07-23 21:18:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(856938, 25037, 3087, '<td valign="top">Was chatting to someone about this image today and their comment below about it not being my heart. This was my response, which I thought might be nice to also add here.<br/> <br/><i>It IS the wrong side to be my heart... but it was a figurative title for me so I decided to go with it. "Hand on my heart" is often said to convey truthfulness about the statement it accompanies and that''s what I was going for.</i></td>', 'Was chatting to someone about this image today and their comment below about it not being my heart. This was my response, which I thought might be nice to also add here. It IS the wrong side to be my heart... but it was a figurative title for me so I decided to go with it. "Hand on my heart" is often said to convey truthfulness about the statement it accompanies and that''s what I was going for.', '2004-08-12 12:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
